WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

2
00:00:42.941 --> 00:00:45.744
[leaves rustling]

3
00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.729
<i>[Ubuyashiki]</i>
<i>Within the next five days.</i>

4
00:01:02.761 --> 00:01:04.464
<i>Muzan will come.</i>

5
00:01:10.969 --> 00:01:13.905
I will be the bait you use.

6
00:01:13.939 --> 00:01:17.377
When he comes.
I need you to behead him.

7
00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:25.117
- Master. what leads you
to believe he'll find you?

8
00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:27.754
- [chuckles]

9
00:01:27.786 --> 00:01:30.390
My intuition. That's all.

10
00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.125
Nothing beyond that.

11
00:01:33.158 --> 00:01:36.928
But listen.
the others can't know.

12
00:01:36.962 --> 00:01:41.933
They would never agree
to using me as bait like this.

13
00:01:41.967 --> 00:01:44.903
They would sooner die
than do it.

14
00:01:44.936 --> 00:01:49.208
You're the only one
that I can ask. Gyomei.

15
00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:55.080
Even if you behead him.
he won't die.

16
00:01:56.416 --> 00:02:00.453
There's likely only one way
to destroy Muzan.

17
00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:04.956
trapping him in place until
sunlight shines upon him.

18
00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:07.760
If beheading
isn't enough to kill him.

19
00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:10.396
there's only one option left.

20
00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:14.900
You all must endure a battle
until the sun rises.

21
00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:17.503
- Yes. sir.

22
00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:21.507
<i>If that is your wish.</i>
<i>then so be it. Master.</i>

23
00:02:25.043 --> 00:02:26.978
<i>- Thank goodness.</i>

24
00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:33.985
<i>Gyomei...</i>

25
00:02:34.019 --> 00:02:36.356
<i>after I have perished.</i>

26
00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:39.091
<i>please do not let</i>
<i>any more of my children</i>

27
00:02:39.124 --> 00:02:41.627
<i>be sent to their graves.</i>

28
00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.730
<i>That is my wish.</i>

29
00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:46.098
[beads rattle]

30
00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:51.537
[coat rustles]

31
00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:01.046
<i>[intense music]</i>

32
00:03:01.079 --> 00:03:03.383
<i>[Muzan] You think you've</i>
<i>driven me into a corner</i>

33
00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:04.883
<i>with your little plan?</i>

34
00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:10.088
But you are all about to be
going straight to hell!

35
00:03:10.122 --> 00:03:12.190
Mark my words. Demon Slayers.

36
00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:15.927
I'll massacre every one of you
before sunrise!

37
00:03:15.961 --> 00:03:17.028
- [growls]

38
00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.064
- [note twangs]
- [gasps]

39
00:03:19.998 --> 00:03:22.702
You're the only one
going to hell.

40
00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.970
and you won't get away!

41
00:03:25.003 --> 00:03:27.774
- Oh. is that so?

42
00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:30.343
Let's see you try.

43
00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:32.578
Tanjiro Kamado!

44
00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:36.982
- I will defeat you!

45
00:03:38.451 --> 00:03:40.753
<i>Muzan Kibutsuji!</i>

46
00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:43.623
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

47
00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:46.191
<i>♪ ♪</i>

48
00:03:46.225 --> 00:03:47.159
[gasps]

49
00:03:47.192 --> 00:03:49.762
<i>["Taiyo ga Noboranai Sekai"</i>
<i>by Aimer]</i>

50
00:03:49.796 --> 00:03:52.665
<i>♪ ♪</i>

51
00:03:52.698 --> 00:03:54.901
<i>[Tanjiro] What is this place?</i>

52
00:03:54.933 --> 00:03:57.837
<i>Everything's upside down.</i>

53
00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:01.574
<i>Was all of this made using</i>
<i>the enemy's Blood Demon Art?</i>

54
00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.646
<i>I don't understand</i>
<i>what's happening.</i>

55
00:04:06.679 --> 00:04:09.981
<i>except that Ms. Tamayo</i>
<i>was restraining Muzan.</i>

56
00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:11.950
<i>Even so...</i>

57
00:04:11.983 --> 00:04:14.420
<i>how long can she</i>
<i>keep that up?</i>

58
00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:16.889
- [screams]

59
00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.791
- Calm down. Kanroji!

60
00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:20.860
- I-- Yes!

61
00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:22.361
- Stay with me!

62
00:04:22.395 --> 00:04:28.267
<i>♪ ♪</i>

63
00:04:34.841 --> 00:04:36.007
- [gasps]

64
00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:41.481
- [roars]

65
00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:48.119
<i>♪ ♪</i>

66
00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:10.041
<i>♪ ♪</i>

67
00:05:17.283 --> 00:05:19.785
<i>[Tanjiro] I need to reach</i>
<i>Muzan as soon as possible</i>

68
00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:20.720
<i>and defeat him!</i>

69
00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:23.021
<i>By whatever means!</i>

70
00:05:26.759 --> 00:05:28.361
[gasps]

71
00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:32.298
<i>That's the bottom!</i>

72
00:05:32.331 --> 00:05:34.901
<i>I'll be killed at this speed!</i>

73
00:05:34.934 --> 00:05:37.135
<i>I'll use a move</i>
<i>to change directions.</i>

74
00:05:37.168 --> 00:05:39.372
<i>then find something</i>
<i>to grab on to.</i>

75
00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.107
- [water splashes]
- [grunts]

76
00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:44.343
<i>It didn't work.</i>

77
00:05:44.377 --> 00:05:46.812
<i>I can't break away</i>
<i>from this freefall.</i>

78
00:05:48.414 --> 00:05:55.321
<i>♪ ♪</i>

79
00:06:09.869 --> 00:06:11.637
- [winces]

80
00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:13.472
- [gasps]

81
00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:20.713
<i>[music fades]</i>

82
00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.652
<i>[wind blowing]</i>

83
00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:31.223
[panting]

84
00:06:36.028 --> 00:06:37.597
[Giyu] You all right?

85
00:06:38.998 --> 00:06:40.131
- Yes!

86
00:06:40.165 --> 00:06:41.968
Thanks for your help.

87
00:06:42.001 --> 00:06:43.636
[sighs]

88
00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:45.004
You really saved--

89
00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:46.672
<i>[tense music]</i>

90
00:06:46.706 --> 00:06:51.744
Water Breathing First Form:
Water Surface Slash.

91
00:06:53.546 --> 00:06:54.647
- Tanjiro!

92
00:06:55.881 --> 00:06:57.148
- [grunts]

93
00:06:57.182 --> 00:06:59.752
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

94
00:06:59.785 --> 00:07:04.122
<i>♪ ♪</i>

95
00:07:04.155 --> 00:07:06.258
- [snarling]

96
00:07:16.569 --> 00:07:18.671
<i>- Water Breathing...</i>
<i>- Water Breathing...</i>

97
00:07:18.704 --> 00:07:20.039
<i>- Sixth Form...</i>

98
00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:21.407
<i>- Third Form...</i>

99
00:07:22.675 --> 00:07:24.944
<i>[Tanjiro] Whirlpool.</i>

100
00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:26.412
<i>- Flowing Dance.</i>

101
00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:33.719
- [groans]

102
00:07:33.753 --> 00:07:36.489
<i>Mr. Giyu's amazing.</i>

103
00:07:36.522 --> 00:07:40.026
<i>He can tell exactly</i>
<i>which move I'm gonna use.</i>

104
00:07:40.059 --> 00:07:41.394
<i>Then he follows up with one</i>

105
00:07:41.427 --> 00:07:44.597
<i>that prevents any kind</i>
<i>of friendly fire.</i>

106
00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.666
<i>He's unbelievable.</i>

107
00:07:46.699 --> 00:07:49.535
<i>Just what's</i>
<i>behind those eyes?!</i>

108
00:07:49.568 --> 00:07:52.004
[murmurs]

109
00:07:52.038 --> 00:07:55.207
- If I'm not mistaken.
this is the place

110
00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:57.743
that Shinazugawa
and Iguro mentioned.

111
00:07:57.777 --> 00:08:00.913
<i>[reverential music]</i>

112
00:08:00.946 --> 00:08:05.418
Which means Kibutsuji's plan
was to gather everyone here.

113
00:08:05.451 --> 00:08:08.854
then kill us all
in one fell swoop.

114
00:08:08.888 --> 00:08:14.160
From here on out. we'll need
to be even more vigilant.

115
00:08:14.192 --> 00:08:15.594
- Right.

116
00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:18.397
- Let's go.

117
00:08:18.431 --> 00:08:19.331
- Right!

118
00:08:20.132 --> 00:08:22.702
<i>[intense music]</i>

119
00:08:22.735 --> 00:08:24.904
<i>♪ ♪</i>

120
00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.615
[demons snarling]

121
00:08:40.686 --> 00:08:41.721
[demons yelp]

122
00:08:41.754 --> 00:08:44.790
- Serpent Breathing
Fifth Form...

123
00:08:44.824 --> 00:08:45.891
- [hisses]

124
00:08:45.925 --> 00:08:48.527
[demons groaning]

125
00:08:51.797 --> 00:08:54.366
- Slithering Serpent!

126
00:08:56.335 --> 00:08:58.037
You demon scum...

127
00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.207
stay away from Kanroji!

128
00:09:00.239 --> 00:09:01.941
- [squeals]

129
00:09:01.974 --> 00:09:04.510
<i>Mr. Iguro is so cool!</i>

130
00:09:05.377 --> 00:09:06.345
- Are you hurt?

131
00:09:06.378 --> 00:09:07.580
- No. not at all!

132
00:09:07.613 --> 00:09:08.514
- Then let's go.

133
00:09:08.547 --> 00:09:09.248
- Okay!

134
00:09:09.281 --> 00:09:12.618
[squeals]

135
00:09:14.887 --> 00:09:18.124
<i>♪ ♪</i>

136
00:09:18.157 --> 00:09:20.326
[demons groan]

137
00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:22.595
- [grunts]

138
00:09:22.628 --> 00:09:29.034
<i>♪ ♪</i>

139
00:09:30.136 --> 00:09:31.070
Tokito!

140
00:09:31.103 --> 00:09:33.873
[demons groan]

141
00:09:33.906 --> 00:09:37.676
<i>♪ ♪</i>

142
00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.613
[Tokito] There's a whole lot
of demons. huh?

143
00:09:40.646 --> 00:09:42.215
- It would seem
they've been given

144
00:09:42.249 --> 00:09:43.949
the strength
of the Lower Ranks.

145
00:09:43.983 --> 00:09:47.787
It's clear that they're being
used to try and exhaust us.

146
00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.321
[demon snarls fade]

147
00:09:51.258 --> 00:09:52.391
- Hmm.

148
00:09:53.192 --> 00:09:54.693
What of the Master?

149
00:09:55.528 --> 00:09:58.297
- He has departed
from this world.

150
00:09:59.131 --> 00:10:01.734
It was a truly noble end.

151
00:10:02.701 --> 00:10:03.903
- Knowing him...

152
00:10:03.936 --> 00:10:07.640
he never would have allowed
himself to be caught unawares.

153
00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:11.278
Did he sacrifice himself?

154
00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.678
- Indeed.

155
00:10:12.711 --> 00:10:15.347
The Master did not
have much time left.

156
00:10:16.148 --> 00:10:17.583
- [winces]

157
00:10:19.286 --> 00:10:21.320
[gasps]

158
00:10:22.289 --> 00:10:23.689
<i>Master...</i>

159
00:10:30.429 --> 00:10:33.300
Back when I was mortally
wounded by a demon.

160
00:10:33.332 --> 00:10:35.202
and found myself
teetering on the edge

161
00:10:35.235 --> 00:10:36.969
between life and death...

162
00:10:38.003 --> 00:10:39.738
he stayed by my side.

163
00:10:42.408 --> 00:10:45.144
He did the same
for every Corps member

164
00:10:45.177 --> 00:10:47.079
who was
on the brink of death...

165
00:10:49.381 --> 00:10:50.883
like a father.

166
00:10:53.085 --> 00:10:55.387
- Yes. I know.

167
00:10:55.421 --> 00:10:58.991
- Muzan not only took
my brother from me.

168
00:10:59.024 --> 00:11:00.993
but our father as well.

169
00:11:01.026 --> 00:11:03.162
That bastard.

170
00:11:03.195 --> 00:11:04.396
Damn him!

171
00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:07.234
I swear I'll make him suffer!

172
00:11:07.267 --> 00:11:09.435
I'll send him
straight to hell!

173
00:11:10.237 --> 00:11:11.937
- You're not alone.

174
00:11:16.175 --> 00:11:19.378
Trust me.
We all feel the same.

175
00:11:20.179 --> 00:11:22.781
[walls rumbling]

176
00:11:26.452 --> 00:11:29.054
<i>Forgive me. Master.</i>

177
00:11:30.323 --> 00:11:32.524
<i>I couldn't protect you.</i>

178
00:11:35.928 --> 00:11:37.830
- [grunts]

179
00:11:39.965 --> 00:11:41.133
[sword rings]

180
00:11:44.837 --> 00:11:47.706
[demons snarling]

181
00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:51.010
- There's no end
to you lowlifes. huh.

182
00:11:54.013 --> 00:11:56.316
That's just fine by me.

183
00:11:56.349 --> 00:11:58.251
I'll kill all of you!

184
00:11:58.285 --> 00:12:04.224
<i>♪ ♪</i>

185
00:12:04.257 --> 00:12:05.524
[sword rings]

186
00:12:06.326 --> 00:12:07.860
- Yaah!

187
00:12:07.893 --> 00:12:09.229
Make way!

188
00:12:09.262 --> 00:12:10.896
I'm comin' through!

189
00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:13.465
- [demons snarl]
- [Inosuke whoops]

190
00:12:13.499 --> 00:12:16.535
Whole lotta fallin'
happening here!

191
00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:21.006
Pretty rude to just drop me
in here outta nowhere!

192
00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:22.309
Though. I've been itching

193
00:12:22.342 --> 00:12:24.109
to see how
my training's paid off.

194
00:12:24.143 --> 00:12:25.577
so with that in mind.

195
00:12:25.611 --> 00:12:28.047
let's test it out
on you chumps!

196
00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.715
[laughs]

197
00:12:29.748 --> 00:12:30.916
Let's go!

198
00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:32.818
[demons groan]

199
00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:38.090
[Genya panting]

200
00:12:38.123 --> 00:12:39.792
<i>Where am I?</i>

201
00:12:39.825 --> 00:12:42.661
<i>The demon headquarters?</i>
<i>Where are the others?</i>

202
00:12:43.462 --> 00:12:45.365
<i>Big Brother.</i>

203
00:12:45.398 --> 00:12:48.767
<i>I hope you're safe. too.</i>

204
00:12:52.604 --> 00:12:54.840
<i>- I just heard a sound.</i>

205
00:12:54.873 --> 00:12:57.377
<i>Could it be</i>
<i>that</i> he's <i>somewhere nearby?</i>

206
00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:00.213
[demons snarl]

207
00:13:03.015 --> 00:13:04.650
- You'll regret this.

208
00:13:05.751 --> 00:13:10.055
I won't forgive you.
not in a million years.

209
00:13:20.733 --> 00:13:23.303
<i>[reverential music]</i>

210
00:13:23.336 --> 00:13:28.507
<i>♪ ♪</i>

211
00:13:34.381 --> 00:13:35.981
<i>- I smell blood.</i>

212
00:13:44.757 --> 00:13:46.892
What is this place?

213
00:13:50.662 --> 00:13:53.832
[wood scrapes]

214
00:13:53.866 --> 00:13:54.833
<i>[tone rings]</i>

215
00:13:54.867 --> 00:13:57.636
- [chewing]

216
00:13:57.669 --> 00:14:00.139
<i>[tense music]</i>

217
00:14:03.809 --> 00:14:04.810
Hmm?

218
00:14:06.145 --> 00:14:07.946
Oh. my. You're here?

219
00:14:08.847 --> 00:14:11.217
Ohh! And you're a girl. too!

220
00:14:11.251 --> 00:14:15.621
[gasps] What a young and
tasty morsel we have! Heh!

221
00:14:15.654 --> 00:14:19.892
I'll have to properly
thank Nakime for this later.

222
00:14:22.262 --> 00:14:24.830
[Shinobu panting]

223
00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.274
[crying]

224
00:14:35.674 --> 00:14:37.076
- Shinobu...

225
00:14:37.109 --> 00:14:40.280
you must leave
the Demon Slayer Corps.

226
00:14:42.014 --> 00:14:45.751
I know that you've
trained really hard...

227
00:14:45.784 --> 00:14:48.120
and you're fighting
to make a difference.

228
00:14:49.255 --> 00:14:51.657
But I don't think you'll...

229
00:14:57.096 --> 00:15:01.667
I want you to live the life
of a happy. normal girl.

230
00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:04.870
to be able to see
your own hair turn gray.

231
00:15:07.207 --> 00:15:10.109
Really. you've done enough.

232
00:15:10.142 --> 00:15:12.212
- No! Can't stop now!

233
00:15:12.245 --> 00:15:15.548
I will avenge you
if it's the last thing I do!

234
00:15:15.582 --> 00:15:17.983
This demon. I need to know.

235
00:15:18.016 --> 00:15:20.553
I have to know
what it looked like!

236
00:15:20.587 --> 00:15:21.887
Please. Big Sister.

237
00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.857
I'm begging you. tell me!

238
00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.758
I could never live
a normal life

239
00:15:26.792 --> 00:15:29.161
knowing someone
did this to you!

240
00:15:29.194 --> 00:15:30.996
Please!

241
00:15:32.164 --> 00:15:33.899
- [sighs]

242
00:15:35.535 --> 00:15:36.869
<i>[Kanae] It was a demon...</i>

243
00:15:36.902 --> 00:15:39.938
<i>with a bloodstained pattern</i>
<i>on his head.</i>

244
00:15:41.106 --> 00:15:44.577
- I must say. it's very nice
to meet you. miss!

245
00:15:44.611 --> 00:15:47.679
You may refer to me as Doma.

246
00:15:47.713 --> 00:15:51.683
Ah. what a wonderful night.

247
00:15:52.718 --> 00:15:55.988
<i>- Such a warm smile</i>
<i>and gentle voice.</i>

248
00:15:56.021 --> 00:15:59.691
<i>There's a soft.</i>
<i>benevolent presence to him.</i>

249
00:16:00.792 --> 00:16:01.960
[girl. raspy] Please...

250
00:16:01.994 --> 00:16:03.296
h-help me.

251
00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:05.398
Please help me!

252
00:16:05.431 --> 00:16:07.166
- Shh!

253
00:16:07.199 --> 00:16:09.469
Can't you see
that we're talking?

254
00:16:09.502 --> 00:16:10.969
[metal scrapes]

255
00:16:13.206 --> 00:16:14.340
Huh?

256
00:16:14.374 --> 00:16:16.409
- Are you all right?

257
00:16:16.442 --> 00:16:19.312
- Wow! That was fast.

258
00:16:19.345 --> 00:16:20.979
Are you a Hashira?

259
00:16:21.013 --> 00:16:23.583
- [panting]

260
00:16:23.616 --> 00:16:25.017
[squelch]

261
00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:25.784
[gasps]

262
00:16:25.817 --> 00:16:27.253
[Shinobu gasps]

263
00:16:27.287 --> 00:16:28.288
<i>[ominous music]</i>

264
00:16:28.321 --> 00:16:29.556
[blood splatters]

265
00:16:29.589 --> 00:16:31.190
- Oh. don't worry about that!

266
00:16:31.224 --> 00:16:33.626
You can just
leave her right there.

267
00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:35.861
I'll make a proper meal
of her later.

268
00:16:39.198 --> 00:16:40.466
- And this demon...

269
00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.469
the weapon he used...

270
00:16:43.503 --> 00:16:45.405
it was a pair of sharp fans.

271
00:16:45.438 --> 00:16:48.241
[metal clinks]

272
00:16:48.274 --> 00:16:51.843
- As the founder of
the Eternal Paradise Faith.

273
00:16:51.877 --> 00:16:53.178
it is my sworn duty

274
00:16:53.213 --> 00:16:56.882
to see that all my followers
attain happiness.

275
00:16:56.915 --> 00:16:59.751
I'll be sure
to consume her completely.

276
00:17:01.521 --> 00:17:02.821
<i>- There's no doubt.</i>

277
00:17:02.854 --> 00:17:06.058
<i>This is the demon</i>
<i>who killed my sister.</i>

278
00:17:06.892 --> 00:17:08.794
Attaining happiness?

279
00:17:08.827 --> 00:17:10.697
For who. exactly?

280
00:17:10.729 --> 00:17:14.434
This girl was horrified.
crying out for help.

281
00:17:14.467 --> 00:17:16.068
- And that's why I saved her.

282
00:17:16.935 --> 00:17:19.838
Her suffering
has come to an end.

283
00:17:19.871 --> 00:17:23.309
No more pain. No more fear.

284
00:17:24.344 --> 00:17:26.912
Everyone is afraid of death.

285
00:17:26.945 --> 00:17:30.015
so I help them
by consuming them.

286
00:17:30.048 --> 00:17:34.721
This way. they get to live on
within me for all eternity.

287
00:17:34.786 --> 00:17:37.357
I take in their entire being--

288
00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:42.094
blood. desires. even
the last bit of their sinew--

289
00:17:42.127 --> 00:17:45.231
and help
their souls transcend.

290
00:17:45.265 --> 00:17:48.434
- What you're spouting
is sheer nonsense.

291
00:17:48.468 --> 00:17:50.836
And to say it with such glee.

292
00:17:50.869 --> 00:17:53.038
You truly make me sick.

293
00:17:53.071 --> 00:17:54.641
- Huh?

294
00:17:54.674 --> 00:17:59.345
I can't believe you'd say that
after we'd only just met.

295
00:17:59.379 --> 00:18:00.846
Oh. I see!

296
00:18:00.879 --> 00:18:02.881
Aw. you poor thing.

297
00:18:02.914 --> 00:18:05.851
Did something
unfortunate happen?

298
00:18:05.884 --> 00:18:07.420
Let's hear it.

299
00:18:07.453 --> 00:18:09.054
Go on. tell me.

300
00:18:10.122 --> 00:18:13.426
"Unfortunate" doesn't begin
to describe it!

301
00:18:13.459 --> 00:18:16.862
You were the one who killed
my Big Sister. weren't you?!

302
00:18:16.895 --> 00:18:19.699
Does the haori I'm wearing
mean nothing to you?!

303
00:18:19.732 --> 00:18:21.501
- Huh?

304
00:18:21.534 --> 00:18:24.102
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

305
00:18:24.136 --> 00:18:30.443
<i>♪ ♪</i>

306
00:18:31.444 --> 00:18:32.612
[slice]

307
00:18:32.645 --> 00:18:34.247
- That's right.

308
00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.617
It belonged to the girl
who used Flower Breathing.

309
00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:40.453
Such a sweet. gentle child.

310
00:18:41.621 --> 00:18:44.290
The sun came up
and cut our time short.

311
00:18:44.324 --> 00:18:45.491
I remember.

312
00:18:45.525 --> 00:18:47.159
It's a shame I didn't get

313
00:18:47.192 --> 00:18:48.227
to eat-- her.

314
00:18:49.928 --> 00:18:52.831
<i>Insect Breathing</i>
<i>Dance of the Bee Sting...</i>

315
00:18:52.864 --> 00:18:54.233
<i>True Flutter!</i>

316
00:18:55.435 --> 00:18:57.035
- A marvelous thrust!

317
00:18:57.069 --> 00:18:59.205
I hardly even saw it!

318
00:19:01.441 --> 00:19:03.008
Blood Demon Art...

319
00:19:03.909 --> 00:19:06.178
Frozen Lotus.

320
00:19:07.213 --> 00:19:08.648
<i>- So cold.</i>

321
00:19:08.681 --> 00:19:11.116
<i>It feels like</i>
<i>my lungs are bursting!</i>

322
00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.287
- Hmm. Look at that!

323
00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.388
You are fast!

324
00:19:15.421 --> 00:19:17.956
Unfortunately for you.

325
00:19:17.989 --> 00:19:21.026
those thrusts aren't enough
to kill a demon.

326
00:19:24.497 --> 00:19:26.499
Aim for here.

327
00:19:26.532 --> 00:19:28.867
You need to chop off my head.

328
00:19:31.169 --> 00:19:34.407
- My thrusts alone
may not be enough.

329
00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.941
But what of this?

330
00:19:36.776 --> 00:19:37.943
[scrapes]

331
00:19:38.711 --> 00:19:40.145
- [groans]

332
00:19:40.178 --> 00:19:44.283
<i>- Time to see whether this</i>
<i>toxin works on an Upper Rank.</i>

333
00:19:45.852 --> 00:19:47.052
<i>Sister...</i>

334
00:19:47.085 --> 00:19:50.456
<i>lend me your strength.</i>
<i>please.</i>

335
00:19:51.457 --> 00:19:52.592
- [gags]

336
00:19:52.625 --> 00:19:54.427
This poison...

337
00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.530
it's clearly far stronger
than the strain you used

338
00:19:57.563 --> 00:19:59.298
up on Rui's mountain.

339
00:19:59.332 --> 00:20:00.400
[groans]

340
00:20:00.433 --> 00:20:03.736
<i>- So they did</i>
<i>exchange information.</i>

341
00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:05.971
<i>This is the drawback</i>
<i>to using poison.</i>

342
00:20:06.004 --> 00:20:07.740
- He told me that...

343
00:20:07.774 --> 00:20:10.108
you've been
changing the concoction...

344
00:20:10.142 --> 00:20:12.612
for each demon you face.

345
00:20:12.645 --> 00:20:13.613
[groans]

346
00:20:13.646 --> 00:20:16.616
[coughs]

347
00:20:16.649 --> 00:20:18.917
[wheezes]

348
00:20:20.952 --> 00:20:22.455
Oh. my.

349
00:20:22.488 --> 00:20:23.523
it would seem that I've

350
00:20:23.556 --> 00:20:26.859
already neutralized
all of your poison.

351
00:20:26.893 --> 00:20:28.227
How rude of me.

352
00:20:28.261 --> 00:20:31.631
And after you'd made it
just for me.

353
00:20:31.664 --> 00:20:34.032
That sword of yours...

354
00:20:34.065 --> 00:20:37.837
it makes quite an interesting
sound when you sheath it.

355
00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:41.940
Is that where you change
what poison you use?

356
00:20:41.973 --> 00:20:44.544
Yay! This is fun!

357
00:20:44.577 --> 00:20:48.414
Who knew being poisoned
was so invigorating?!

358
00:20:48.448 --> 00:20:50.249
It's almost addictive.

359
00:20:50.283 --> 00:20:52.150
What'll the next formula
be like?

360
00:20:52.184 --> 00:20:55.254
[chuckles] Come on.
let's give it a try!

361
00:21:01.461 --> 00:21:03.429
- Very well. then.

362
00:21:03.463 --> 00:21:04.897
I'll oblige.

363
00:21:04.931 --> 00:21:06.131
See...

364
00:21:09.502 --> 00:21:13.004
I'd already anticipated
this would happen.

365
00:21:13.038 --> 00:21:14.440
- [laughs]

366
00:21:14.474 --> 00:21:16.609
Is your next batch set?

367
00:21:16.642 --> 00:21:18.478
I'm ready whenever you are.

368
00:21:22.815 --> 00:21:25.685
I know I just said
to give it a try...

369
00:21:27.118 --> 00:21:30.323
but you could at least
change up your offense.

370
00:21:32.425 --> 00:21:35.193
[laughing]

371
00:21:36.762 --> 00:21:37.996
- [scoffs]

372
00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:46.405
- What's this?

373
00:21:46.439 --> 00:21:49.242
You seem to be
slower than earlier.

374
00:21:49.275 --> 00:21:50.543
So sad.

375
00:21:50.576 --> 00:21:53.713
<i>- Insect Breathing</i>
<i>Dance of the Horsefly...</i>

376
00:21:53.746 --> 00:21:56.249
<i>Enticing Slash!</i>

377
00:22:03.422 --> 00:22:06.659
- Oh. my.
You were able to land a hit.

378
00:22:06.692 --> 00:22:11.029
The way you got through
all my defenses. it's amazing!

379
00:22:11.062 --> 00:22:12.665
I'm truly impressed!

380
00:22:12.698 --> 00:22:15.868
It's almost enough
to bring a tear to my eye.

381
00:22:15.902 --> 00:22:18.204
Come on.
What are you waiting for?

382
00:22:18.237 --> 00:22:22.073
Hurry up and attack me again
before I stop the poison.

383
00:22:22.107 --> 00:22:24.310
Please? You're doing so well!

384
00:22:24.343 --> 00:22:26.679
Maybe the next attack
kills me!

385
00:22:26.712 --> 00:22:27.813
- [scoffs]

386
00:22:31.617 --> 00:22:32.585
- [laughs]

387
00:22:32.618 --> 00:22:34.754
Yes! That's the spirit!

388
00:22:38.324 --> 00:22:42.595
<i>Ever since I was a child.</i>
<i>I was kind and clever.</i>

389
00:22:42.628 --> 00:22:45.431
<i>I always helped</i>
<i>those who were in need</i>

390
00:22:45.464 --> 00:22:48.734
<i>and led them</i>
<i>to the path of happiness.</i>

391
00:22:48.768 --> 00:22:51.069
<i>It was my duty. after all.</i>

392
00:22:52.438 --> 00:22:55.675
[father] His eyes have
the colors of a rainbow.

393
00:22:55.708 --> 00:22:59.946
And this gray hair
is proof of his innocence.

394
00:22:59.979 --> 00:23:02.615
This child is truly special.

395
00:23:02.648 --> 00:23:06.084
- Surely he can hear
the voices of the gods.

396
00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:11.824
<i>- My parents were</i>
<i>hopelessly naive simpletons.</i>

397
00:23:11.857 --> 00:23:14.961
<i>You'd have to be.</i>
<i>in order to found a religion</i>

398
00:23:14.994 --> 00:23:17.830
<i>like the Eternal</i>
<i>Paradise Faith.</i>

399
00:23:17.863 --> 00:23:19.765
<i>I pitied them.</i>

400
00:23:19.799 --> 00:23:23.336
<i>so I always played along</i>
<i>with their make-believe ideas.</i>

401
00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:27.940
<i>I never once heard</i>
<i>the voice of the gods.</i>

402
00:23:27.974 --> 00:23:30.876
<i>At first.</i>
<i>I didn't know how to deal</i>

403
00:23:30.910 --> 00:23:35.146
<i>with the hordes of people</i>
<i>worshipping and praying to me.</i>

404
00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:38.618
<i>Seeing these grownups</i>
<i>come crying to a child.</i>

405
00:23:38.651 --> 00:23:41.754
<i>saying they were suffering.</i>
<i>pleading for help.</i>

406
00:23:41.787 --> 00:23:45.358
<i>made me worry</i>
<i>if they were sick in the head.</i>

407
00:23:46.425 --> 00:23:48.327
<i>After nearly</i>
<i>putting me to sleep</i>

408
00:23:48.361 --> 00:23:51.464
<i>with their personal stories.</i>
<i>they would bow to me.</i>

409
00:23:51.497 --> 00:23:54.667
<i>asking to be guided</i>
<i>to Paradise.</i>

410
00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:56.535
<i>I cried.</i>

411
00:23:57.503 --> 00:24:00.006
<i>"You poor things." I thought.</i>

412
00:24:00.039 --> 00:24:02.708
<i>"Paradise doesn't even exist."</i>

413
00:24:02.742 --> 00:24:07.279
<i>It's just a fairy tale</i>
<i>concocted by deluded humans.</i>

414
00:24:08.114 --> 00:24:10.983
<i>There are no gods or buddhas.</i>

415
00:24:11.017 --> 00:24:13.653
<i>These people</i>
<i>had lived for decades.</i>

416
00:24:13.686 --> 00:24:17.556
<i>yet they still couldn't grasp</i>
<i>that simple truth.</i>

417
00:24:17.590 --> 00:24:20.960
<i>When you die.</i>
<i>you return to nothingness.</i>

418
00:24:20.993 --> 00:24:22.895
<i>All feeling ceases.</i>

419
00:24:22.928 --> 00:24:25.231
<i>Your heart stops.</i>

420
00:24:25.264 --> 00:24:27.233
<i>Your brain stops.</i>

421
00:24:27.266 --> 00:24:29.735
<i>You rot and</i>
<i>return to the earth.</i>

422
00:24:29.769 --> 00:24:33.305
<i>Such is the fate</i>
<i>of every living creature.</i>

423
00:24:35.341 --> 00:24:39.045
<i>To be too foolish</i>
<i>to accept reality...</i>

424
00:24:39.078 --> 00:24:41.714
<i>what a hard life that must be.</i>

425
00:24:41.747 --> 00:24:45.918
<i>I want to bring happiness</i>
<i>to these pitiful people.</i>

426
00:24:45.951 --> 00:24:47.720
<i>I want to save them.</i>

427
00:24:48.721 --> 00:24:50.790
<i>I truly believe...</i>

428
00:24:50.823 --> 00:24:52.958
<i>that is my purpose here.</i>

429
00:24:57.997 --> 00:24:59.131
[metal rings]

430
00:24:59.165 --> 00:25:01.867
Aww. still nothing.

431
00:25:01.901 --> 00:25:03.369
And that was number five.

432
00:25:03.402 --> 00:25:05.137
What will you do?

433
00:25:05.171 --> 00:25:07.940
The toxin's
getting less effective.

434
00:25:07.973 --> 00:25:11.944
How many more times
do you think you can adapt it?

435
00:25:11.977 --> 00:25:13.679
Oh! Are you out of breath now?

436
00:25:13.713 --> 00:25:16.382
- [panting]
- Look at all that sweat.

437
00:25:16.415 --> 00:25:17.583
Are you all right?

438
00:25:17.616 --> 00:25:20.953
<i>- So this is the power</i>
<i>of an Upper Rank.</i>

439
00:25:22.021 --> 00:25:24.323
<i>None of my poisons</i>
<i>are working.</i>

440
00:25:25.324 --> 00:25:28.394
<i>He's adapting too fast</i>
<i>to keep up with!</i>

441
00:25:29.261 --> 00:25:30.262
[mist hisses]

442
00:25:30.296 --> 00:25:32.765
Your alveoli must be dead now.

443
00:25:32.798 --> 00:25:35.067
[ice crackles]

444
00:25:35.101 --> 00:25:36.302
Painful.

445
00:25:36.335 --> 00:25:38.037
You did breathe it in...

446
00:25:38.070 --> 00:25:40.473
my Blood Demon Art.

447
00:25:41.607 --> 00:25:44.577
<i>- He turns his frozen blood</i>
<i>into mist</i>

448
00:25:44.610 --> 00:25:46.979
<i>and disperses it</i>
<i>with his fans.</i>

449
00:25:47.012 --> 00:25:50.549
<i>Even breathing around him</i>
<i>is dangerous now.</i>

450
00:25:57.189 --> 00:25:58.157
[scrapes]

451
00:25:58.190 --> 00:25:59.458
<i>This time...</i>

452
00:25:59.492 --> 00:26:02.428
<i>I'll increase the dose</i>
<i>with multiple strikes!</i>

453
00:26:03.230 --> 00:26:04.463
<i>Insect Breathing...</i>

454
00:26:04.497 --> 00:26:06.098
<i>Dance of the Dragonfly...</i>

455
00:26:06.132 --> 00:26:08.134
<i>[energetic music]</i>

456
00:26:08.167 --> 00:26:13.206
<i>♪ ♪</i>

457
00:26:13.240 --> 00:26:15.541
<i>Compound Eye Hexagon!</i>

458
00:26:18.077 --> 00:26:19.345
- I can't believe it.

459
00:26:19.378 --> 00:26:21.447
Such blazing speed.

460
00:26:21.480 --> 00:26:25.518
You might be the fastest
Hashira I've ever met!

461
00:26:27.186 --> 00:26:28.954
- [winces]

462
00:26:28.988 --> 00:26:30.223
<i>He...</i>

463
00:26:30.257 --> 00:26:31.190
<i>got me.</i>

464
00:26:31.224 --> 00:26:32.992
[groans]

465
00:26:33.025 --> 00:26:34.593
- Forget the poison.

466
00:26:34.627 --> 00:26:37.429
Why not try to decapitate me?

467
00:26:37.463 --> 00:26:39.865
With your speed.
you might have won.

468
00:26:40.866 --> 00:26:43.035
[laughs] Maybe not.

469
00:26:43.068 --> 00:26:45.871
I mean. you are small.

470
00:26:45.905 --> 00:26:47.473
- [shudders]

471
00:26:48.908 --> 00:26:52.444
<i>Why</i> are <i>my hands</i>
<i>so small. I wonder?</i>

472
00:26:53.813 --> 00:26:57.383
<i>How come I was never</i>
<i>able to grow taller?</i>

473
00:26:58.818 --> 00:27:02.021
<i>If my stature were</i>
<i>just a little bigger.</i>

474
00:27:02.054 --> 00:27:06.259
<i>could I have been able</i>
<i>to behead and defeat a demon?</i>

475
00:27:06.293 --> 00:27:08.994
<i>The longer</i>
<i>your arms and legs are.</i>

476
00:27:09.028 --> 00:27:10.663
<i>the more muscles you have.</i>

477
00:27:10.696 --> 00:27:13.699
<i>which means more strength</i>
<i>in your attacks.</i>

478
00:27:16.535 --> 00:27:19.471
<i>My sister was also</i>
<i>of small frame.</i>

479
00:27:19.505 --> 00:27:21.707
<i>but she was taller than I.</i>

480
00:27:23.542 --> 00:27:26.812
<i>How I envy Mr. Himejima.</i>

481
00:27:26.846 --> 00:27:29.381
<i>Seeing someone like him</i>
<i>come to their rescue</i>

482
00:27:29.415 --> 00:27:31.450
<i>would give anyone relief.</i>

483
00:27:35.288 --> 00:27:38.190
<i>I know what my sister</i>
<i>really wanted to say</i>

484
00:27:38.225 --> 00:27:40.960
<i>but didn't have the heart to.</i>

485
00:27:44.396 --> 00:27:46.165
- Oh. no.

486
00:27:46.198 --> 00:27:48.467
Have our games come to an end?

487
00:27:48.500 --> 00:27:50.002
That's too bad.

488
00:27:51.003 --> 00:27:53.138
[metal clinks]

489
00:27:53.172 --> 00:27:56.876
<i>- "I don't think you'll win</i>
<i>against that demon."</i>

490
00:27:56.909 --> 00:27:59.411
<i>That's what you</i>
<i>were going to say.</i>

491
00:27:59.445 --> 00:28:02.081
<i>but you stopped yourself.</i>
<i>didn't you?</i>

492
00:28:02.114 --> 00:28:04.817
[Kanae]
Pull yourself together.

493
00:28:09.989 --> 00:28:11.891
This is no time for tears.

494
00:28:13.058 --> 00:28:15.027
<i>- Sister.</i>

495
00:28:15.060 --> 00:28:16.862
- Stand up.

496
00:28:16.896 --> 00:28:18.063
- [crying] I can't.

497
00:28:18.097 --> 00:28:19.899
I've lost so much blood.

498
00:28:19.932 --> 00:28:24.103
My left lung is punctured.
and I can't even breathe.

499
00:28:24.136 --> 00:28:26.239
- You can. and you will.

500
00:28:26.273 --> 00:28:27.473
Stand up.

501
00:28:27.506 --> 00:28:30.243
You are a Hashira. Shinobu!

502
00:28:30.277 --> 00:28:31.844
- [crying]

503
00:28:31.877 --> 00:28:35.315
- If you've made up your mind
to defeat him. then do so.

504
00:28:35.348 --> 00:28:37.750
No excuses.

505
00:28:37.783 --> 00:28:41.654
Win by whatever means you can.

506
00:28:41.687 --> 00:28:45.591
Remember your promise
to me and Kanao.

507
00:28:47.360 --> 00:28:49.495
<i>- Kanao.</i>

508
00:28:52.265 --> 00:28:54.166
[Doma] Forgive me.

509
00:28:54.199 --> 00:28:56.535
You must be suffering
right now.

510
00:28:56.568 --> 00:28:59.171
- [shuddering]

511
00:29:00.839 --> 00:29:03.842
- I know that you
have it in you.

512
00:29:03.876 --> 00:29:05.477
Do your best.

513
00:29:06.379 --> 00:29:07.646
- Huh?

514
00:29:08.981 --> 00:29:11.550
- [shuddering]

515
00:29:11.583 --> 00:29:13.386
Wait. are you...

516
00:29:13.420 --> 00:29:14.687
standing up?

517
00:29:14.720 --> 00:29:16.323
[gasps]

518
00:29:16.356 --> 00:29:17.756
Scary.

519
00:29:17.790 --> 00:29:20.125
Are you actually a human?

520
00:29:20.159 --> 00:29:24.930
I slashed your collarbone.
your lungs. and your ribs.

521
00:29:24.964 --> 00:29:26.999
At your diminutive size

522
00:29:27.032 --> 00:29:29.835
and the amount
of blood you've lost.

523
00:29:29.868 --> 00:29:32.004
how are you
not dead right now?

524
00:29:32.037 --> 00:29:33.138
- [coughs]

525
00:29:33.172 --> 00:29:34.441
- See? Right there!

526
00:29:34.473 --> 00:29:37.576
There clearly is blood
gurgling in your lungs.

527
00:29:37.609 --> 00:29:40.679
The pain must be unimaginable.

528
00:29:40.713 --> 00:29:43.482
Surrender. and I'll put
an end to your suffering.

529
00:29:43.515 --> 00:29:44.883
It'll be quick!

530
00:29:45.718 --> 00:29:47.820
It's too late for you.

531
00:29:47.853 --> 00:29:49.356
so just let go.

532
00:29:49.389 --> 00:29:52.091
<i>- I'll make a go</i>
<i>for his neck this time</i>

533
00:29:52.124 --> 00:29:55.594
<i>and put everything I have</i>
<i>left into this strike!</i>

534
00:29:55.627 --> 00:29:58.130
Insect Breathing...

535
00:29:58.163 --> 00:30:00.099
Dance of the Centipede...

536
00:30:00.132 --> 00:30:01.700
- Hmm?

537
00:30:01.734 --> 00:30:03.902
- Hundred-legged Zigzag.

538
00:30:03.936 --> 00:30:06.406
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

539
00:30:06.439 --> 00:30:08.408
<i>♪ ♪</i>

540
00:30:08.441 --> 00:30:10.042
- [gasps]

541
00:30:19.985 --> 00:30:21.153
Huh?

542
00:30:26.658 --> 00:30:30.129
<i>It feels like</i>
<i>she's everywhere at once.</i>

543
00:30:30.162 --> 00:30:32.631
<i>Just her movement</i>
<i>destroyed the bridge.</i>

544
00:30:33.732 --> 00:30:35.301
<i>[centipede chitters]</i>

545
00:30:35.335 --> 00:30:36.568
<i>- So fast.</i>

546
00:30:36.602 --> 00:30:38.204
<i>I can't follow her.</i>

547
00:30:40.373 --> 00:30:41.341
<i>[ice crackles]</i>

548
00:30:41.374 --> 00:30:44.310
<i>♪ ♪</i>

549
00:30:44.344 --> 00:30:45.245
<i>From below?</i>

550
00:30:45.278 --> 00:30:46.645
[gasps]

551
00:30:49.349 --> 00:30:50.883
- [grunts]

552
00:30:50.916 --> 00:30:57.689
<i>♪ ♪</i>

553
00:30:58.757 --> 00:31:01.927
<i>[Shinobu]</i>
<i>Back when I was a child...</i>

554
00:31:01.960 --> 00:31:04.196
<i>I thought of happiness</i>
<i>like a road.</i>

555
00:31:04.230 --> 00:31:07.032
<i>one that stretched on</i>
<i>into the distance</i>

556
00:31:07.066 --> 00:31:08.934
<i>with no end in sight.</i>

557
00:31:08.967 --> 00:31:10.636
<i>[laughter]</i>

558
00:31:10.669 --> 00:31:12.604
[blood splatters]

559
00:31:12.638 --> 00:31:14.807
<i>It wasn't</i>
<i>until it was destroyed</i>

560
00:31:14.840 --> 00:31:17.176
<i>that I finally realized</i>

561
00:31:17.210 --> 00:31:21.146
<i>the road beneath my feet was</i>
<i>but a thin sheet of glass.</i>

562
00:31:23.949 --> 00:31:28.620
<i>However. some haven't</i>
<i>had the glass broken yet.</i>

563
00:31:29.489 --> 00:31:31.757
<i>All I wanted</i>
<i>after being saved</i>

564
00:31:31.790 --> 00:31:34.227
<i>was to become stronger</i>

565
00:31:34.260 --> 00:31:38.897
<i>so that someday</i>
<i>I could protect those people.</i>

566
00:31:40.533 --> 00:31:44.304
<i>So we made a promise...</i>

567
00:31:46.105 --> 00:31:50.943
<i>to vanquish the demons.</i>
<i>as many as we could.</i>

568
00:31:50.976 --> 00:31:52.212
<i>together.</i>

569
00:31:54.947 --> 00:31:57.950
<i>In hopes that the pain</i>
<i>we suffered</i>

570
00:31:57.983 --> 00:32:00.652
<i>would never be felt</i>
<i>by another.</i>

571
00:32:08.861 --> 00:32:11.063
<i>Even if I'm weak...</i>

572
00:32:14.567 --> 00:32:17.836
<i>even if I can't</i>
<i>decapitate demons.</i>

573
00:32:17.870 --> 00:32:22.575
<i>if I can take down just one.</i>
<i>I can save dozens of lives.</i>

574
00:32:22.609 --> 00:32:24.577
<i>And if that demon's</i>
<i>an Upper Rank.</i>

575
00:32:24.611 --> 00:32:27.413
<i>it could mean</i>
<i>saving hundreds!</i>

576
00:32:29.148 --> 00:32:32.751
<i>It's not a matter</i>
<i>of can or cannot.</i>

577
00:32:32.784 --> 00:32:35.288
<i>This is something</i>
<i>I have to do.</i>

578
00:32:36.289 --> 00:32:38.190
[earrings clinking]

579
00:32:40.560 --> 00:32:42.094
- Are you angry?

580
00:32:43.896 --> 00:32:47.433
<i>- Yes. I am angry. Tanjiro.</i>

581
00:32:47.467 --> 00:32:48.867
<i>I'm furious.</i>

582
00:32:49.801 --> 00:32:54.274
<i>In fact. I'm always angry.</i>

583
00:32:54.307 --> 00:32:56.074
<i>How could I not be?</i>

584
00:32:58.478 --> 00:33:01.013
<i>My parents were killed.</i>

585
00:33:01.847 --> 00:33:05.184
<i>My older sister was killed.</i>

586
00:33:05.218 --> 00:33:08.321
<i>My Tsuguko. other than Kanao.</i>
<i>were killed.</i>

587
00:33:09.755 --> 00:33:11.591
<i>And those poor girls...</i>

588
00:33:11.624 --> 00:33:14.227
<i>if it weren't for the demons.</i>

589
00:33:14.260 --> 00:33:17.729
<i>if it weren't for the demons</i>
<i>that killed their loved ones.</i>

590
00:33:17.763 --> 00:33:21.200
<i>they'd be living happily</i>
<i>with their families.</i>

591
00:33:23.469 --> 00:33:26.838
<i>It's all so infuriating.</i>

592
00:33:26.872 --> 00:33:29.107
<i>Stop messing with me.</i>
<i>damn it!</i>

593
00:33:29.141 --> 00:33:34.012
<i>Why the hell isn't my poison</i>
<i>working on this prick?</i>

594
00:33:35.047 --> 00:33:36.516
<i>You bastard!</i>

595
00:33:36.549 --> 00:33:38.050
- [sighs]

596
00:33:38.083 --> 00:33:40.486
[ice crackling]

597
00:33:46.725 --> 00:33:47.694
- [winces]

598
00:33:47.726 --> 00:33:48.661
- I'm moved!

599
00:33:48.695 --> 00:33:50.430
You did your best.

600
00:33:50.463 --> 00:33:52.665
Even though you're so weak!

601
00:33:52.699 --> 00:33:54.634
You must have worked
so incredibly hard

602
00:33:54.667 --> 00:33:56.835
to get to this point.

603
00:33:56.868 --> 00:33:59.037
You're weaker
than your sister.

604
00:33:59.071 --> 00:34:01.641
and yet you
somehow outlived her.

605
00:34:01.674 --> 00:34:02.741
[crunching]

606
00:34:02.774 --> 00:34:05.245
It's a miracle
you survived this long.

607
00:34:06.279 --> 00:34:07.746
- [coughs]

608
00:34:07.779 --> 00:34:09.047
Even when hope is gone.

609
00:34:09.081 --> 00:34:12.218
humans always fight
to the bitter end.

610
00:34:12.252 --> 00:34:13.986
Humans are so foolish!

611
00:34:14.019 --> 00:34:17.657
But that's what makes them
so beautiful.

612
00:34:17.690 --> 00:34:20.759
I deem you worthy
of becoming part of me.

613
00:34:20.792 --> 00:34:23.762
You and I
shall share eternity!

614
00:34:23.795 --> 00:34:26.898
[sniffles]

615
00:34:26.932 --> 00:34:29.569
Do you have any last words?

616
00:34:29.602 --> 00:34:31.471
I'm listening.

617
00:34:31.504 --> 00:34:34.474
- [shudders]

618
00:34:35.841 --> 00:34:38.777
Rot in hell. you bastard.

619
00:34:42.682 --> 00:34:43.750
- [gasps]

620
00:34:43.782 --> 00:34:45.451
Master!

621
00:34:45.485 --> 00:34:47.853
<i>[ominous music]</i>

622
00:34:47.886 --> 00:34:50.256
[bones crack]

623
00:34:50.290 --> 00:34:53.259
- [shudders]

624
00:34:53.293 --> 00:34:55.894
[cracking continues]

625
00:35:00.832 --> 00:35:03.969
[clang echoes]

626
00:35:05.305 --> 00:35:06.706
[sword clatters]

627
00:35:06.739 --> 00:35:09.776
[gasps]

628
00:35:09.808 --> 00:35:13.111
[screams]

629
00:35:14.447 --> 00:35:16.382
<i>[resolute music]</i>

630
00:35:16.416 --> 00:35:19.485
<i>[Zenitsu] I can't shake</i>
<i>the feeling he's here.</i>

631
00:35:19.519 --> 00:35:21.086
<i>He must be.</i>

632
00:35:21.119 --> 00:35:23.723
<i>He's got a score to settle</i>
<i>with me. too.</i>

633
00:35:23.756 --> 00:35:30.929
<i>♪ ♪</i>

634
00:35:30.962 --> 00:35:32.130
<i>The people we love.</i>

635
00:35:32.164 --> 00:35:36.101
<i>the people we hold dear</i>
<i>are so precious.</i>

636
00:35:36.134 --> 00:35:39.104
<i>We take for granted</i>
<i>that they'll always be there.</i>

637
00:35:39.905 --> 00:35:40.939
<i>However...</i>

638
00:35:40.972 --> 00:35:43.509
<i>that's just</i>
<i>a selfish delusion.</i>

639
00:35:43.543 --> 00:35:45.611
- Flower Breathing...

640
00:35:45.645 --> 00:35:48.046
<i>[Zenitsu] Because the thought</i>
<i>of living without them</i>

641
00:35:48.080 --> 00:35:49.749
<i>is simply unbearable.</i>

642
00:35:49.782 --> 00:35:51.116
- Fourth Form...

643
00:35:51.917 --> 00:35:54.420
Crimson Hanagoromo!

644
00:35:55.921 --> 00:35:57.357
[ice tinkling]

645
00:35:57.390 --> 00:35:58.890
[gasps]

646
00:36:00.892 --> 00:36:03.995
- Wow.
You nearly got me there.

647
00:36:07.433 --> 00:36:10.336
<i>[Zenitsu] They'll always</i>
<i>be alive and close by...</i>

648
00:36:11.337 --> 00:36:14.307
<i>it's a naive thought.</i>
<i>I know.</i>

649
00:36:14.340 --> 00:36:16.442
<i>But we all want</i>
<i>to believe it.</i>

650
00:36:19.746 --> 00:36:21.547
- Would you mind
holding off your attacks

651
00:36:21.581 --> 00:36:23.014
for just a second?

652
00:36:23.048 --> 00:36:24.883
I'm trying to absorb her.

653
00:36:24.916 --> 00:36:27.320
[flesh crackling]

654
00:36:28.987 --> 00:36:31.591
- [shuddering]

655
00:36:33.693 --> 00:36:35.628
- How strange.

656
00:36:35.661 --> 00:36:37.963
You're not taking the bait.
are you?

657
00:36:38.997 --> 00:36:40.299
What she did earlier.

658
00:36:40.333 --> 00:36:43.436
that motion she made
with her fingers.

659
00:36:43.469 --> 00:36:47.072
was that her
warning you of my powers?

660
00:36:47.105 --> 00:36:50.643
I'm impressed she thought
to do that so quickly.

661
00:36:50.676 --> 00:36:52.512
Good job. You did it!

662
00:36:52.545 --> 00:36:54.647
Too bad it doesn't matter.

663
00:36:57.015 --> 00:37:00.152
Well. in case
you were wondering.

664
00:37:00.185 --> 00:37:03.890
your Master was tastier
than I imagined.

665
00:37:03.922 --> 00:37:05.691
[slurps]

666
00:37:05.725 --> 00:37:07.360
And now you're here.

667
00:37:07.393 --> 00:37:10.962
It's just one feast
after another. it seems.

668
00:37:10.996 --> 00:37:15.601
Ah. this truly is...

669
00:37:15.635 --> 00:37:17.936
a wonderful night.

670
00:37:17.969 --> 00:37:20.573
- [shuddering]

671
00:37:31.116 --> 00:37:33.319
- You can't hide.

672
00:37:33.352 --> 00:37:34.620
Come out.

673
00:37:35.621 --> 00:37:38.357
Have some dignity and face me.

674
00:37:38.391 --> 00:37:39.625
- [chuckles]

675
00:37:39.659 --> 00:37:43.229
Sounds like someone ought
to teach you some manners.

676
00:37:43.262 --> 00:37:45.431
Did you forget
that I'm your senior?

677
00:37:45.465 --> 00:37:49.469
You look a little stronger
than the last time I saw you.

678
00:37:49.502 --> 00:37:54.407
It's too bad you still reek
of being a pathetic weakling.

679
00:37:59.177 --> 00:38:03.616
It's been a while.
hasn't it. Zenitsu?

680
00:38:03.649 --> 00:38:05.318
[laughs]

681
00:38:06.219 --> 00:38:10.021
- Kaigaku.
you don't get my respect.

682
00:38:10.055 --> 00:38:12.023
You're a demon.

683
00:38:12.057 --> 00:38:14.125
You'll be treated as such.

684
00:38:15.828 --> 00:38:18.196
[running footsteps echoing]

685
00:38:21.767 --> 00:38:22.802
[note twangs]

686
00:38:22.835 --> 00:38:24.337
- [yelps]

687
00:38:25.136 --> 00:38:27.306
<i>[tense music]</i>

688
00:38:27.340 --> 00:38:30.075
<i>Water Breathing Ninth Form...</i>

689
00:38:31.544 --> 00:38:34.145
<i>Splashing Water Flow.</i>
<i>Turbulent!</i>

690
00:38:36.582 --> 00:38:37.750
- Stay focused!

691
00:38:37.783 --> 00:38:39.117
- All right!

692
00:38:40.219 --> 00:38:42.388
<i>This place is insane.</i>

693
00:38:42.421 --> 00:38:44.857
<i>The building keeps shifting</i>
<i>and rearranging itself.</i>

694
00:38:44.891 --> 00:38:46.926
<i>as if it's alive!</i>

695
00:38:46.959 --> 00:38:50.596
<i>I can tell that it's</i>
<i>trying to separate us!</i>

696
00:38:50.630 --> 00:38:52.965
<i>We have to regroup</i>
<i>with the other Corps members</i>

697
00:38:52.999 --> 00:38:55.635
<i>and stay together</i>
<i>'til we reach Muzan!</i>

698
00:38:59.605 --> 00:39:01.072
- Caw!

699
00:39:01.974 --> 00:39:03.676
Caw!

700
00:39:03.709 --> 00:39:05.143
Attention!

701
00:39:05.176 --> 00:39:07.380
Shinobu Kocho is dead!

702
00:39:07.413 --> 00:39:10.683
She fought valiantly
against Upper Two

703
00:39:10.716 --> 00:39:12.451
but was defeated!

704
00:39:19.492 --> 00:39:21.260
- [shudders]

705
00:39:25.231 --> 00:39:28.801
<i>[sentimental music]</i>

706
00:39:28.834 --> 00:39:35.441
<i>♪ ♪</i>

707
00:39:44.050 --> 00:39:46.184
[shudders]

708
00:39:49.455 --> 00:39:51.424
- [squawks]

709
00:39:53.659 --> 00:39:54.760
<i>- [Giyu] Strange.</i>

710
00:39:54.794 --> 00:39:57.530
<i>There's a piece of paper</i>
<i>wrapped around its neck.</i>

711
00:39:57.563 --> 00:39:59.799
<i>How are the crows</i>
<i>already here?</i>

712
00:40:00.866 --> 00:40:04.203
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

713
00:40:04.236 --> 00:40:06.072
- Shinobu is dead.

714
00:40:06.104 --> 00:40:08.474
But we must push forward.

715
00:40:08.507 --> 00:40:11.744
Think only of what
must be done for victory.

716
00:40:11.777 --> 00:40:12.778
- Right.
- Right.

717
00:40:15.081 --> 00:40:16.415
- And what about the others?

718
00:40:16.449 --> 00:40:18.851
I need reports
on their whereabouts.

719
00:40:20.353 --> 00:40:21.988
[Kanata]
Center of the 40th vertical

720
00:40:22.021 --> 00:40:23.656
and 12th horizontal levels.

721
00:40:23.689 --> 00:40:25.558
[demons snarling]

722
00:40:25.591 --> 00:40:27.460
The Corps members
are fighting off

723
00:40:27.493 --> 00:40:30.696
what appears to be
at least ten demons.

724
00:40:30.730 --> 00:40:32.598
[tone chimes]

725
00:40:37.370 --> 00:40:39.170
However. more than 30 demons

726
00:40:39.205 --> 00:40:42.041
are moving in their direction
from behind the walls.

727
00:40:42.074 --> 00:40:48.146
<i>♪ ♪</i>

728
00:40:48.179 --> 00:40:50.282
<i>[Kiriya]</i>
<i>Using Mr. Yushiro's eyes.</i>

729
00:40:50.316 --> 00:40:52.652
<i>we're able to see</i>
<i>Blood Demon Arts.</i>

730
00:40:52.685 --> 00:40:55.788
<i>something that isn't possible</i>
<i>to do with the human eye.</i>

731
00:40:56.722 --> 00:40:58.958
<i>Each red light</i>
<i>is a Blood Demon Art.</i>

732
00:40:58.991 --> 00:41:02.495
<i>The more intense they glow.</i>
<i>the more potent their power.</i>

733
00:41:03.329 --> 00:41:04.630
<i>And this place...</i>

734
00:41:04.664 --> 00:41:07.066
<i>the entire area.</i>
<i>buildings and all..</i>

735
00:41:07.099 --> 00:41:10.369
<i>must also be</i>
<i>a Blood Demon Art.</i>

736
00:41:10.403 --> 00:41:13.239
<i>There's seemingly</i>
<i>no end in sight to it.</i>

737
00:41:15.441 --> 00:41:17.576
<i>What incredible power.</i>

738
00:41:18.911 --> 00:41:20.212
<i>A demon labyrinth</i>

739
00:41:20.246 --> 00:41:22.882
<i>with the ability</i>
<i>to branch out endlessly.</i>

740
00:41:26.252 --> 00:41:27.820
<i>And here we lie</i>
<i>at its center.</i>

741
00:41:27.853 --> 00:41:31.457
<i>trapped within the walls</i>
<i>of this infinite castle.</i>

742
00:41:31.490 --> 00:41:33.325
- This one's finished.
- ...goes over there.

743
00:41:33.359 --> 00:41:34.360
- Okay. Goes right there.

744
00:41:34.393 --> 00:41:35.394
- Bring it over here.

745
00:41:35.428 --> 00:41:36.729
<i>- However...</i>
- Yes. that's right.

746
00:41:36.762 --> 00:41:38.898
<i>- ...it's not as if we've</i>
<i>been caught off guard.</i>

747
00:41:38.931 --> 00:41:43.502
<i>My father prepared</i>
<i>for this day meticulously.</i>

748
00:41:43.536 --> 00:41:45.705
<i>With Gyomei's cooperation.</i>

749
00:41:45.738 --> 00:41:47.740
<i>he had the Hashira</i>
<i>within arm's reach</i>

750
00:41:47.773 --> 00:41:49.408
<i>to mobilize at any time.</i>

751
00:41:49.442 --> 00:41:52.311
<i>To prevent the Corps members</i>
<i>from being isolated.</i>

752
00:41:52.344 --> 00:41:55.181
<i>he sent the Kasugai Crows</i>
<i>to gather them into groups</i>

753
00:41:55.214 --> 00:41:56.549
<i>and waited.</i>

754
00:41:56.582 --> 00:42:00.920
<i>He enlisted the aid of</i>
<i>Ms. Tamayo and Mr. Yushiro.</i>

755
00:42:00.953 --> 00:42:02.154
<i>And finally.</i>

756
00:42:02.188 --> 00:42:05.257
<i>to ensure that their plan</i>
<i>would succeed.</i>

757
00:42:05.291 --> 00:42:08.661
<i>my sisters and our parents</i>

758
00:42:08.694 --> 00:42:10.863
<i>readily sacrificed</i>
<i>their lives.</i>

759
00:42:14.166 --> 00:42:17.636
We cannot lose.
no matter what.

760
00:42:18.637 --> 00:42:24.176
<i>♪ ♪</i>

761
00:42:24.211 --> 00:42:26.011
<i>Amongst the Blood Demon Arts.</i>

762
00:42:26.045 --> 00:42:27.413
<i>there are</i>
<i>five traces of power</i>

763
00:42:27.446 --> 00:42:29.181
<i>that tower over the rest.</i>

764
00:42:29.216 --> 00:42:31.584
<i>as if flaunting</i>
<i>their strength.</i>

765
00:42:31.617 --> 00:42:34.153
<i>These must be Upper Ranks.</i>

766
00:42:34.186 --> 00:42:36.522
<i>One of them</i>
<i>is at the same spot</i>

767
00:42:36.555 --> 00:42:38.624
<i>where Shinobu</i>
<i>was last seen fighting.</i>

768
00:42:39.325 --> 00:42:40.659
- Found another!

769
00:42:40.693 --> 00:42:43.996
Upper Six and Zenitsu have
just encountered each other!

770
00:42:44.029 --> 00:42:45.631
- An Upper Rank!

771
00:42:45.664 --> 00:42:46.665
Is he alone?

772
00:42:46.699 --> 00:42:49.368
- He is.
It looks to be a one-on-one.

773
00:42:49.401 --> 00:42:52.205
[Kiriya] A Hinoe can't beat
an Upper Rank by themself.

774
00:42:52.239 --> 00:42:53.572
Send backup!

775
00:42:59.111 --> 00:43:00.379
- [scoffs]

776
00:43:00.412 --> 00:43:02.481
What. you frozen in fear?

777
00:43:02.515 --> 00:43:04.517
Guess some things
never change.

778
00:43:04.550 --> 00:43:07.286
Once a coward.
always a coward.

779
00:43:07.319 --> 00:43:09.822
Did you ever
become a Hashira?

780
00:43:09.855 --> 00:43:11.891
[chuckles] Guess not.

781
00:43:11.924 --> 00:43:13.893
That's too bad.

782
00:43:13.926 --> 00:43:15.895
Got any new techniques?

783
00:43:15.928 --> 00:43:18.397
Or still just First Form?

784
00:43:18.430 --> 00:43:20.533
For an Upper Rank
bottom feeder

785
00:43:20.566 --> 00:43:22.635
who's nothing more
than a spare blade.

786
00:43:22.668 --> 00:43:25.037
you're sure acting
awfully proud.

787
00:43:26.071 --> 00:43:27.606
- Wow.

788
00:43:27.640 --> 00:43:28.707
[laughs]

789
00:43:28.741 --> 00:43:32.411
Who taught you to talk
like that? New friends?

790
00:43:32.444 --> 00:43:35.314
- Why the hell
did you become a demon?

791
00:43:35.347 --> 00:43:36.216
- [laughs]

792
00:43:36.249 --> 00:43:37.516
You'd never understan--

793
00:43:37.550 --> 00:43:40.085
- You were supposed
to succeed Thunder Breathing.

794
00:43:40.119 --> 00:43:41.654
but you tarnished it!

795
00:43:42.922 --> 00:43:44.224
- Huh?

796
00:43:44.257 --> 00:43:46.625
- After you became a demon...

797
00:43:46.659 --> 00:43:48.527
he...

798
00:43:49.328 --> 00:43:51.730
he committed seppuku!

799
00:43:52.765 --> 00:43:54.200
Even worse...

800
00:43:54.234 --> 00:43:56.735
[crying]
he did it by himself.

801
00:43:57.837 --> 00:43:59.805
He was all alone.

802
00:44:01.040 --> 00:44:02.275
Because of that.

803
00:44:02.309 --> 00:44:04.443
no one was there
to put him out his misery.

804
00:44:04.476 --> 00:44:07.379
He bled out
and died a painful death.

805
00:44:07.413 --> 00:44:09.415
It's your fault.

806
00:44:09.448 --> 00:44:12.852
Gramps died the most
agonizing death possible!

807
00:44:12.885 --> 00:44:14.920
All because
the Thunder Breathing ranks

808
00:44:14.954 --> 00:44:16.021
produced a demon!

809
00:44:17.990 --> 00:44:20.327
- Why the hell should I care?

810
00:44:20.359 --> 00:44:23.062
Gramps died? So what.

811
00:44:23.095 --> 00:44:24.430
Want me to cry?

812
00:44:24.463 --> 00:44:26.899
Did you expect me
to give a damn?

813
00:44:26.932 --> 00:44:28.067
Well. I don't.

814
00:44:28.100 --> 00:44:29.602
In fact.
I don't care for anyone

815
00:44:29.635 --> 00:44:31.804
who doesn't appreciate me.

816
00:44:31.837 --> 00:44:33.505
No matter what.

817
00:44:33.539 --> 00:44:35.441
this is who I am.

818
00:44:35.474 --> 00:44:38.345
Take the side
of whoever knows my worth.

819
00:44:38.377 --> 00:44:39.645
[laughs]

820
00:44:39.678 --> 00:44:43.015
If the old geezer
really did die in agony.

821
00:44:43.048 --> 00:44:44.617
then I couldn't be happier.

822
00:44:44.650 --> 00:44:47.786
I slaved away
for that ungrateful bastard.

823
00:44:47.820 --> 00:44:50.223
And what does he do
to repay me?

824
00:44:50.257 --> 00:44:51.924
He makes you my co-successor

825
00:44:51.957 --> 00:44:54.126
instead of just letting me
carry the torch.

826
00:44:54.159 --> 00:44:56.161
I hope he rots!

827
00:44:56.195 --> 00:44:58.397
Former Hashira or not.

828
00:44:58.430 --> 00:45:01.800
I would never shed a tear
over some senile geezer.

829
00:45:01.834 --> 00:45:04.770
[laughs]

830
00:45:04.803 --> 00:45:07.340
- [sighs]

831
00:45:07.374 --> 00:45:10.009
Gramps knew exactly
what he was doing.

832
00:45:10.042 --> 00:45:13.579
We were made co-successors
because we're weak.

833
00:45:13.612 --> 00:45:15.748
I was only able
to use the First Form.

834
00:45:15.781 --> 00:45:18.617
while you could use
everything but First Form.

835
00:45:18.651 --> 00:45:21.254
I can't help
but feel sorry for Gramps

836
00:45:21.288 --> 00:45:23.722
that he has
two useless successors!

837
00:45:23.756 --> 00:45:25.624
- Don't lump us together.

838
00:45:25.658 --> 00:45:28.193
I'm nothing like you!

839
00:45:28.228 --> 00:45:31.063
Thunder Breathing
Fourth Form...

840
00:45:31.096 --> 00:45:32.431
Distant Thunder!

841
00:45:36.168 --> 00:45:37.603
[gasps]

842
00:45:40.340 --> 00:45:42.808
- You're so slow. scum.

843
00:45:42.841 --> 00:45:44.210
- [groans]

844
00:45:44.244 --> 00:45:45.211
[wood clatters]

845
00:45:45.245 --> 00:45:46.979
[panting]

846
00:45:48.281 --> 00:45:49.481
<i>What the hell?</i>

847
00:45:49.515 --> 00:45:52.551
<i>He got me.</i>
<i>His speed is unreal.</i>

848
00:45:52.584 --> 00:45:54.954
<i>He never moved like that.</i>

849
00:45:54.987 --> 00:45:56.956
<i>He's changed.</i>

850
00:45:58.391 --> 00:46:00.826
<i>But he's not the only one.</i>

851
00:46:04.496 --> 00:46:07.099
[blood flowing]

852
00:46:10.836 --> 00:46:14.374
<i>There's no shame in kneeling</i>
<i>down before the powerful</i>

853
00:46:14.407 --> 00:46:16.608
<i>if it means surviving.</i>

854
00:46:16.642 --> 00:46:20.779
<i>As long as you're alive.</i>
<i>you can still win.</i>

855
00:46:21.680 --> 00:46:25.117
<i>Only once you die</i>
<i>have you lost.</i>

856
00:46:25.150 --> 00:46:28.520
<i>Even if you have to beg</i>
<i>on your hands and knees.</i>

857
00:46:28.554 --> 00:46:30.357
<i>even if you're without a home</i>

858
00:46:30.390 --> 00:46:32.825
<i>and have to drink</i>
<i>from a puddle.</i>

859
00:46:32.858 --> 00:46:36.729
<i>even if they condemn you</i>
<i>for stealing money.</i>

860
00:46:36.762 --> 00:46:38.564
<i>as long as you're alive.</i>

861
00:46:38.597 --> 00:46:41.500
<i>there's still a future</i>
<i>where you can win.</i>

862
00:46:41.533 --> 00:46:45.238
<i>Believing that is</i>
<i>all that's kept me going.</i>

863
00:46:46.306 --> 00:46:47.307
- [shuddering]

864
00:46:47.340 --> 00:46:49.641
- Forfeit your humanity.

865
00:46:49.675 --> 00:46:53.579
and limitless power
will be within reach.

866
00:46:53.612 --> 00:46:56.882
Should my Lord choose
to acknowledge you.

867
00:46:56.915 --> 00:47:00.085
demon blood shall coarse
through your veins.

868
00:47:02.322 --> 00:47:04.189
- [shuddering]

869
00:47:04.224 --> 00:47:05.958
- The stronger the swordsman.

870
00:47:05.991 --> 00:47:10.129
the longer it takes
for him to become a demon.

871
00:47:10.162 --> 00:47:13.732
It took me three days
to fully transform.

872
00:47:13.766 --> 00:47:17.136
Turning a Breathing
Technique user into a demon

873
00:47:17.169 --> 00:47:18.937
is no small feat.

874
00:47:18.971 --> 00:47:20.072
Doing such a thing

875
00:47:20.105 --> 00:47:23.742
will require an exorbitant
amount of my Lord's blood.

876
00:47:23.776 --> 00:47:26.413
And though it is rare.

877
00:47:26.446 --> 00:47:28.080
some people.
for whatever reason.

878
00:47:28.113 --> 00:47:30.849
are physically incapable
of becoming demons.

879
00:47:30.883 --> 00:47:31.750
- Huh?

880
00:47:31.784 --> 00:47:35.388
- I'm curious to see
how you will fare.

881
00:47:35.422 --> 00:47:38.724
<i>[tense music]</i>

882
00:47:38.757 --> 00:47:41.361
You must appreciate
this blood.

883
00:47:41.394 --> 00:47:46.632
Even holding it as you are now
is an honor you cannot fathom.

884
00:47:46.665 --> 00:47:48.967
Should you spill
a single drop.

885
00:47:49.001 --> 00:47:51.837
I'll have you dismembered
in an instant.

886
00:47:51.870 --> 00:47:54.374
before it touches the ground.

887
00:47:54.407 --> 00:47:57.009
- [shuddering]

888
00:47:59.212 --> 00:48:03.749
<i>Even now. I remember</i>
<i>the terror I felt.</i>

889
00:48:03.782 --> 00:48:07.953
<i>like every cell in my body</i>
<i>was screaming in anguish.</i>

890
00:48:10.689 --> 00:48:14.494
<i>Compared to what I felt then.</i>
<i>this is nothing.</i>

891
00:48:14.527 --> 00:48:16.762
<i>He's just a punk.</i>

892
00:48:16.795 --> 00:48:18.231
<i>He might be stronger.</i>

893
00:48:18.264 --> 00:48:20.300
<i>but he's not on par</i>
<i>with an Upper Rank.</i>

894
00:48:20.333 --> 00:48:25.671
<i>Zenitsu Agatsuma</i>
<i>is and always will be trash.</i>

895
00:48:25.704 --> 00:48:27.574
<i>He's a despicable crybaby</i>

896
00:48:27.606 --> 00:48:30.210
<i>without a shred</i>
<i>of dignity or valor.</i>

897
00:48:30.243 --> 00:48:31.977
- Somebody help!

898
00:48:32.010 --> 00:48:36.682
I fell in a pitfall
and twisted my ankle!

899
00:48:37.484 --> 00:48:38.984
<i>- The disrespect.</i>

900
00:48:39.017 --> 00:48:42.821
<i>As if I'd be co-successor</i>
<i>with that sniveling loser.</i>

901
00:48:42.855 --> 00:48:45.425
- Here you are. Kaigaku.

902
00:48:45.458 --> 00:48:47.327
- Hey. Gramps!

903
00:48:47.360 --> 00:48:48.528
[Kaigaku] Hmm?

904
00:48:48.561 --> 00:48:51.763
- It looks a little big on me.
don't you think?

905
00:48:51.797 --> 00:48:52.965
Maybe I'll grow into it...

906
00:48:52.998 --> 00:48:56.001
<i>- I'm supposed to be</i>
<i>that idiot's equal?</i>

907
00:48:56.034 --> 00:48:57.736
[both laugh]

908
00:48:57.769 --> 00:49:00.406
<i>- That's gotta be</i>
<i>some kind of sick joke.</i>

909
00:49:00.440 --> 00:49:01.907
[grumbles]

910
00:49:01.940 --> 00:49:04.611
The old bastard
deserved to die!

911
00:49:04.643 --> 00:49:06.912
And if you miss him so dearly.

912
00:49:06.945 --> 00:49:09.815
then I'll see to it
you join him!

913
00:49:09.848 --> 00:49:13.719
<i>- I was only ever able</i>
<i>to learn the First Form.</i>

914
00:49:13.752 --> 00:49:15.154
<i>However. you were able</i>

915
00:49:15.187 --> 00:49:17.524
<i>to learn everything</i>
<i>but the First Form.</i>

916
00:49:17.557 --> 00:49:20.360
<i>[sentimental music]</i>

917
00:49:20.393 --> 00:49:22.060
<i>Gramps knew that.</i>

918
00:49:22.094 --> 00:49:24.129
<i>His solution</i>
<i>was having us both</i>

919
00:49:24.163 --> 00:49:26.932
<i>succeed the Thunder</i>
<i>Breathing technique.</i>

920
00:49:29.369 --> 00:49:31.003
<i>But you denied him that.</i>

921
00:49:31.803 --> 00:49:34.139
<i>You became a demon</i>

922
00:49:34.173 --> 00:49:36.108
<i>purely to reject him.</i>

923
00:49:38.411 --> 00:49:39.412
<i>It's coming.</i>

924
00:49:39.445 --> 00:49:42.047
- Thunder Breathing
Second Form...

925
00:49:43.148 --> 00:49:44.284
Rice Spirit!

926
00:49:44.317 --> 00:49:45.351
- [groans]

927
00:49:46.685 --> 00:49:49.721
<i>He attacked five times</i>
<i>in one breath.</i>

928
00:49:49.755 --> 00:49:51.023
- [yells]

929
00:49:51.056 --> 00:49:51.990
- [grunts]

930
00:49:52.024 --> 00:49:53.959
How many people
have you devoured?!

931
00:49:53.992 --> 00:49:57.129
You can't even tell
right from wrong anymore!

932
00:49:57.162 --> 00:49:59.965
- I'm more aware of those
than I've ever been!

933
00:50:01.367 --> 00:50:02.468
What's the matter?

934
00:50:02.502 --> 00:50:06.339
Aren't you supposed to be
the old geezer's favorite?

935
00:50:06.372 --> 00:50:07.906
If you are...

936
00:50:07.940 --> 00:50:10.276
then show me
what he passed down to you!

937
00:50:10.310 --> 00:50:13.912
It's the only technique
you've got. so use it!

938
00:50:16.583 --> 00:50:19.952
Go all out.
Use everything you got.

939
00:50:19.985 --> 00:50:22.322
And don't you dare
hold back for a second!

940
00:50:22.355 --> 00:50:23.656
- [groans]

941
00:50:23.690 --> 00:50:28.727
<i>♪ ♪</i>

942
00:50:28.760 --> 00:50:30.195
Thunder Breathing...

943
00:50:32.632 --> 00:50:34.032
First Form...

944
00:50:34.066 --> 00:50:35.368
- [scoffs]

945
00:50:35.401 --> 00:50:37.903
- Thunderclap and Flash!

946
00:50:42.308 --> 00:50:43.775
- [laughs]

947
00:50:43.809 --> 00:50:46.679
As if a basic attack
like charging me head on

948
00:50:46.713 --> 00:50:48.947
would ever find its mark.

949
00:50:48.981 --> 00:50:50.816
Don't make me laugh!

950
00:50:52.418 --> 00:50:54.320
Thunder Breathing...

951
00:50:54.354 --> 00:50:55.787
Third Form...

952
00:50:55.821 --> 00:50:57.257
Thunder Swarm!

953
00:51:02.794 --> 00:51:05.431
<i>He's attacking me</i>
<i>from every angle at once.</i>

954
00:51:05.465 --> 00:51:06.699
- What's the matter?

955
00:51:06.733 --> 00:51:09.302
Don't tell me
you're done already!

956
00:51:10.603 --> 00:51:12.070
<i>- Thunder Breathing</i>
<i>First Form:</i>

957
00:51:12.104 --> 00:51:15.040
<i>Thunderclap and Flash.</i>
<i>Eightfold!</i>

958
00:51:19.612 --> 00:51:21.247
- That's not gonna work!

959
00:51:22.482 --> 00:51:23.616
Thunder Breathing...

960
00:51:23.650 --> 00:51:25.518
Fifth Form...

961
00:51:28.221 --> 00:51:29.389
Heat Lightning!

962
00:51:29.422 --> 00:51:31.156
- [groans]

963
00:51:31.189 --> 00:51:33.091
- Got ya!

964
00:51:33.125 --> 00:51:36.629
How does the bite of my Blood
Demon Art-enhanced sword feel?

965
00:51:36.663 --> 00:51:39.332
Each strike. on contact.

966
00:51:39.365 --> 00:51:42.635
leaves a wound
that burns your skin.

967
00:51:42.669 --> 00:51:44.870
This proves those
who recognize my talents

968
00:51:44.903 --> 00:51:46.239
and value are right!

969
00:51:46.272 --> 00:51:50.243
And those that dismiss
or condemn me are wrong!

970
00:51:50.276 --> 00:51:52.077
Do you get it now?

971
00:51:52.110 --> 00:51:54.714
This is the power I have!

972
00:51:54.747 --> 00:51:56.982
My power as a demon. that is!

973
00:51:57.015 --> 00:51:59.519
All you know how to do
is use First Form!

974
00:51:59.552 --> 00:52:02.655
Yet that geezer chose
to make you his successor!

975
00:52:02.689 --> 00:52:04.691
And. boy.
what a mistake that was!

976
00:52:04.724 --> 00:52:05.924
- [groans]

977
00:52:11.764 --> 00:52:13.131
So that's it.

978
00:52:13.165 --> 00:52:16.068
This is the path
that you've chosen to take.

979
00:52:17.337 --> 00:52:19.472
I already knew.

980
00:52:19.505 --> 00:52:21.240
I knew. but...

981
00:52:23.242 --> 00:52:26.212
[sword scrapes]

982
00:52:26.245 --> 00:52:29.282
- With this strike.
I'll end this!

983
00:52:29.315 --> 00:52:30.583
You're finished!

984
00:52:30.616 --> 00:52:32.585
Thunder Breathing...

985
00:52:33.619 --> 00:52:35.588
Sixth Form...

986
00:52:39.826 --> 00:52:43.663
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

987
00:52:43.696 --> 00:52:46.332
Rumble and Flash!

988
00:52:46.366 --> 00:52:50.269
That strike I landed will keep
crackling through your flesh.

989
00:52:50.303 --> 00:52:54.474
This is the power that I
gained by becoming a demon.

990
00:52:54.507 --> 00:52:56.007
Get it now?

991
00:52:56.041 --> 00:52:58.076
I've long surpassed
Thunder Breathing!

992
00:53:00.413 --> 00:53:01.947
[laughs]

993
00:53:01.980 --> 00:53:04.082
You and I aren't equals.

994
00:53:04.116 --> 00:53:05.651
and we never have been!

995
00:53:05.685 --> 00:53:08.454
I'm better than all of you.

996
00:53:08.488 --> 00:53:09.921
Guess the old bastard

997
00:53:09.955 --> 00:53:12.458
shouldn't have put his trust
in you after all.

998
00:53:12.492 --> 00:53:15.261
[laughs]

999
00:53:16.895 --> 00:53:19.866
[Gramps] Come on!
be more like Kaigaku!

1000
00:53:19.898 --> 00:53:21.267
He's your senior!

1001
00:53:21.300 --> 00:53:23.569
So follow his example.
you hear?

1002
00:53:23.603 --> 00:53:25.538
- Hang on.
Isn't the First Form

1003
00:53:25.571 --> 00:53:28.274
pretty much the entire basis
of Thunder Breathing?

1004
00:53:28.307 --> 00:53:30.942
- Yeah. and it's
the only one he can't do.

1005
00:53:30.976 --> 00:53:33.212
You know what that means.
don't ya?

1006
00:53:33.246 --> 00:53:35.648
- That even though
he's mastered other forms.

1007
00:53:35.681 --> 00:53:36.982
he's still a weakling?

1008
00:53:37.015 --> 00:53:38.618
- Yup. exactly.

1009
00:53:38.651 --> 00:53:39.951
The way he shows off. though?

1010
00:53:39.985 --> 00:53:41.220
He's got such an ego.

1011
00:53:41.254 --> 00:53:43.756
- No way he becomes a Hashira.

1012
00:53:43.790 --> 00:53:46.626
- Yeah. he'll die before then.

1013
00:53:46.659 --> 00:53:49.262
- What'd I do
to deserve that?!

1014
00:53:50.530 --> 00:53:53.965
- I heard you went and punched
someone from a higher rank.

1015
00:53:53.999 --> 00:53:56.269
Don't go around
makin' trouble. you trash!

1016
00:53:56.302 --> 00:54:00.440
It's embarrassing even being
seen in the same room as you.

1017
00:54:02.875 --> 00:54:06.412
<i>[Zenitsu] I was fully aware</i>
<i>that you hated me. Kaigaku.</i>

1018
00:54:06.446 --> 00:54:08.548
<i>And to be</i>
<i>perfectly honest...</i>

1019
00:54:08.581 --> 00:54:10.783
<i>I hated you. too.</i>

1020
00:54:10.817 --> 00:54:12.452
<i>Even so.</i>

1021
00:54:12.485 --> 00:54:15.555
<i>I couldn't help</i>
<i>but respect you as well.</i>

1022
00:54:15.588 --> 00:54:18.990
<i>You never stopped working</i>
<i>towards your goals.</i>

1023
00:54:19.826 --> 00:54:21.928
<i>Despite our differences.</i>

1024
00:54:21.960 --> 00:54:24.864
<i>I looked up to you</i>
<i>as an example.</i>

1025
00:54:24.897 --> 00:54:27.300
<i>You really were</i>
<i>a special guy.</i>

1026
00:54:28.801 --> 00:54:30.503
<i>It wasn't just me.</i>

1027
00:54:30.536 --> 00:54:33.138
<i>Gramps thought</i>
<i>you were remarkable. too.</i>

1028
00:54:34.039 --> 00:54:35.274
<i>But I guess...</i>

1029
00:54:35.308 --> 00:54:37.610
<i>you weren't satisfied</i>
<i>with that. were you?</i>

1030
00:54:37.643 --> 00:54:40.011
<i>No matter the day.</i>

1031
00:54:40.045 --> 00:54:43.916
<i>the only sound that came</i>
<i>from you was discontent.</i>

1032
00:54:43.950 --> 00:54:45.183
[tinkling]

1033
00:54:45.218 --> 00:54:48.421
<i>It was like the box</i>
<i>where you kept your joy</i>

1034
00:54:48.454 --> 00:54:50.021
<i>had a hole in it.</i>

1035
00:54:51.457 --> 00:54:54.092
<i>And that joy</i>
<i>kept leaking out.</i>

1036
00:54:55.294 --> 00:54:57.563
<i>If the hole isn't mended.</i>

1037
00:54:57.597 --> 00:55:00.466
<i>happiness will always</i>
<i>be out of reach.</i>

1038
00:55:03.001 --> 00:55:06.104
<i>Gramps.</i>
<i>I'm sorry we're fighting.</i>

1039
00:55:07.105 --> 00:55:11.444
<i>But he and I</i>
<i>must walk separate paths.</i>

1040
00:55:18.016 --> 00:55:19.785
[crackles]

1041
00:55:21.254 --> 00:55:22.053
- Huh?

1042
00:55:22.087 --> 00:55:24.857
<i>He's still holding on?</i>

1043
00:55:24.891 --> 00:55:27.860
<i>[resolute music]</i>

1044
00:55:27.894 --> 00:55:34.065
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1045
00:55:34.099 --> 00:55:35.468
What the hell?!

1046
00:55:36.502 --> 00:55:43.843
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1047
00:55:43.876 --> 00:55:46.379
<i>- Brother...</i>

1048
00:55:46.412 --> 00:55:47.580
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

1049
00:55:47.613 --> 00:55:48.581
- [gasps]

1050
00:55:48.614 --> 00:55:55.221
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1051
00:56:07.333 --> 00:56:10.970
<i>- Thunder Breathing</i>
<i>Seventh Form...</i>

1052
00:56:11.003 --> 00:56:12.471
<i>- [roars]</i>

1053
00:56:13.673 --> 00:56:16.676
<i>- ...God of Fire Thunder.</i>

1054
00:56:16.709 --> 00:56:22.080
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1055
00:56:22.915 --> 00:56:24.684
<i>[Kaigaku] That...</i>

1056
00:56:24.717 --> 00:56:27.486
<i>was so fast.</i>

1057
00:56:27.520 --> 00:56:28.721
<i>That move...</i>

1058
00:56:28.754 --> 00:56:29.689
<i>what was it?!</i>

1059
00:56:29.722 --> 00:56:31.624
<i>Unbelievable.</i>

1060
00:56:31.657 --> 00:56:35.061
<i>How come I've never seen</i>
<i>that technique until now?</i>

1061
00:56:35.093 --> 00:56:36.762
Damn you.

1062
00:56:36.796 --> 00:56:37.964
Damn you!

1063
00:56:37.997 --> 00:56:41.400
I always knew that stupid
geezer liked you more than me!

1064
00:56:41.434 --> 00:56:44.537
Why else would he only
teach you that technique?!

1065
00:56:44.570 --> 00:56:46.439
- You're wrong.

1066
00:56:46.472 --> 00:56:47.273
- [gasps]

1067
00:56:47.306 --> 00:56:48.374
<i>[sentimental music]</i>

1068
00:56:48.407 --> 00:56:51.377
- Gramps was never
that kind of person.

1069
00:56:51.410 --> 00:56:55.247
This technique
is something I made.

1070
00:56:55.281 --> 00:56:59.018
I created it all by myself.

1071
00:56:59.051 --> 00:57:01.387
My hope was...

1072
00:57:01.420 --> 00:57:04.657
that one day.
I'd be able to use it

1073
00:57:04.690 --> 00:57:06.592
to fight by your side.

1074
00:57:10.161 --> 00:57:12.598
<i>- How is this even possible?</i>

1075
00:57:12.632 --> 00:57:15.868
<i>Thunder Breathing</i>
<i>only has six techniques.</i>

1076
00:57:15.901 --> 00:57:19.639
<i>and yet</i> he <i>was able</i>
<i>to create a seventh</i> ?

1077
00:57:19.672 --> 00:57:24.175
<i>Him? The one who can</i>
<i>only use the First Form?</i>

1078
00:57:24.210 --> 00:57:27.780
<i>He's inferior to me</i>
<i>in every way!</i>

1079
00:57:27.813 --> 00:57:29.315
[growls]

1080
00:57:29.348 --> 00:57:30.816
<i>I can't accept it.</i>

1081
00:57:30.850 --> 00:57:32.251
<i>I won't accept it!</i>

1082
00:57:32.284 --> 00:57:34.920
<i>This must be some</i>
<i>kind of twisted joke!</i>

1083
00:57:34.954 --> 00:57:38.791
<i>Someone like me</i>
<i>losing to him?!</i>

1084
00:57:39.892 --> 00:57:42.294
<i>I must be going insane.</i>

1085
00:57:44.063 --> 00:57:48.134
<i>Wait.</i>
<i>with his strength depleted.</i>

1086
00:57:48.166 --> 00:57:50.436
<i>I can still have</i>
<i>the last laugh.</i>

1087
00:57:50.469 --> 00:57:53.205
<i>This fall will kill him.</i>
<i>and he can't stop it!</i>

1088
00:57:53.239 --> 00:57:56.509
<i>I'll be taking him</i>
<i>to hell with me.</i>

1089
00:57:56.542 --> 00:57:58.044
<i>[laughs]</i>

1090
00:57:58.077 --> 00:57:59.645
[Yushiro]
Those who never give to others

1091
00:57:59.679 --> 00:58:02.214
are never able
to receive in return.

1092
00:58:02.248 --> 00:58:03.983
- [gasps]

1093
00:58:04.016 --> 00:58:05.818
- People who have
nothing but desire

1094
00:58:05.851 --> 00:58:08.421
are no different than those
who have nothing at all.

1095
00:58:08.454 --> 00:58:12.491
And one cannot create
anything out of nothing.

1096
00:58:13.492 --> 00:58:16.429
Dying alone is pathetic.
wouldn't you say?

1097
00:58:21.100 --> 00:58:22.168
- [sputters]

1098
00:58:22.200 --> 00:58:24.437
[gags]

1099
00:58:34.647 --> 00:58:36.148
- [gasps]

1100
00:58:36.182 --> 00:58:38.684
[birds chirping]

1101
00:58:38.718 --> 00:58:39.985
Where am I?

1102
00:58:46.992 --> 00:58:48.194
[gasps]

1103
00:58:48.227 --> 00:58:49.462
Gramps!

1104
00:58:52.598 --> 00:58:53.632
I'm sorry!

1105
00:58:53.666 --> 00:58:56.302
I-I couldn't
get along with Kaigaku!

1106
00:58:56.335 --> 00:58:58.637
I even tried
writing him letters.

1107
00:58:58.671 --> 00:59:01.307
but-- but he never
wrote me back. and...

1108
00:59:01.340 --> 00:59:03.342
If it weren't for me.

1109
00:59:03.375 --> 00:59:06.112
he might not have ended up
the way he did.

1110
00:59:06.145 --> 00:59:08.681
I'm really sorry! Forgive me!

1111
00:59:08.714 --> 00:59:11.817
I wasn't able to pay you back
for everything.

1112
00:59:11.851 --> 00:59:15.020
I really wanted you
to see me as a Hashira.

1113
00:59:15.054 --> 00:59:16.922
to make you proud.

1114
00:59:16.956 --> 00:59:18.290
I'm sorry.

1115
00:59:18.324 --> 00:59:20.059
I failed you. Gramps!

1116
00:59:20.092 --> 00:59:22.862
<i>[singers vocalizing]</i>

1117
00:59:22.895 --> 00:59:26.065
[sobs] I understand
if you hate me now.

1118
00:59:26.098 --> 00:59:29.435
Please. just say something.
anything!

1119
00:59:31.238 --> 00:59:32.138
Damn it!

1120
00:59:32.171 --> 00:59:34.540
What's this grabbing my leg?

1121
00:59:34.573 --> 00:59:35.808
[panting]

1122
00:59:35.841 --> 00:59:37.843
Gramps! I just...

1123
00:59:37.877 --> 00:59:39.845
I need-- [gasps]

1124
00:59:39.879 --> 00:59:41.580
[grunts]

1125
00:59:41.614 --> 00:59:42.848
Damn it.

1126
00:59:42.882 --> 00:59:44.884
[grunting]

1127
00:59:44.917 --> 00:59:46.619
- Zenitsu.

1128
00:59:46.652 --> 00:59:47.987
- [gasps]

1129
00:59:53.926 --> 00:59:55.394
Listen to me. lad.

1130
00:59:55.427 --> 00:59:57.897
You are my pride and joy.

1131
00:59:59.098 --> 01:00:00.866
- [gasps]

1132
01:00:00.900 --> 01:00:04.470
[cries]

1133
01:00:04.503 --> 01:00:07.072
<i>[stirring music]</i>

1134
01:00:07.106 --> 01:00:13.712
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1135
01:00:21.086 --> 01:00:23.422
[Murata] Well?
Can you save him?

1136
01:00:23.455 --> 01:00:25.124
He's someone that I know.

1137
01:00:25.157 --> 01:00:26.559
I can't watch him die.

1138
01:00:26.592 --> 01:00:28.327
Please tell me there's a way!

1139
01:00:28.360 --> 01:00:30.563
- Keep your voice down.
You're not helping.

1140
01:00:30.596 --> 01:00:32.998
Just watch out
for enemy ambushes.

1141
01:00:33.032 --> 01:00:35.901
Least then. you'll actually
be doing something useful.

1142
01:00:35.935 --> 01:00:36.969
- [grumbles]

1143
01:00:37.002 --> 01:00:39.872
'Scuse me?! And just
who the hell are you. huh?!

1144
01:00:39.905 --> 01:00:42.875
I better not find out
you're a lower rank than I am!

1145
01:00:42.908 --> 01:00:43.776
<i>- I'm a demon.</i>

1146
01:00:43.809 --> 01:00:47.346
<i>I don't care</i>
<i>about your hierarchy.</i>

1147
01:00:47.379 --> 01:00:49.081
This'll slow
the Blood Demon Art.

1148
01:00:49.114 --> 01:00:51.284
but if these cracks
keep spreading.

1149
01:00:51.318 --> 01:00:53.886
it'll travel
all the way to his eyes.

1150
01:00:54.920 --> 01:00:56.722
Hey. can you hear me?

1151
01:00:56.755 --> 01:00:58.390
- [groans]

1152
01:00:58.424 --> 01:01:00.125
[all sigh]

1153
01:01:00.159 --> 01:01:03.095
- Your bedside manner
really sucks! You know that?!

1154
01:01:03.128 --> 01:01:04.663
- I'm also using a hemostatic.

1155
01:01:04.697 --> 01:01:06.532
but I still can't get
the bleeding to stop.

1156
01:01:06.565 --> 01:01:07.800
- What did I say?!

1157
01:01:07.833 --> 01:01:08.968
Don't listen to him!

1158
01:01:09.001 --> 01:01:10.135
You're gonna be fine!

1159
01:01:10.169 --> 01:01:11.503
I swear
you'll pull through this!

1160
01:01:11.537 --> 01:01:12.972
- Yeah. you can do it!

1161
01:01:13.005 --> 01:01:14.307
- Fight on! Fight on!

1162
01:01:14.341 --> 01:01:16.742
- The only reason
you're alive right now

1163
01:01:16.775 --> 01:01:18.477
is because
the Upper Rank you fought

1164
01:01:18.510 --> 01:01:21.281
still hadn't mastered
his own techniques.

1165
01:01:21.314 --> 01:01:23.350
That was lucky for you.

1166
01:01:23.382 --> 01:01:25.517
If you'd fought him
a year from now.

1167
01:01:25.551 --> 01:01:27.354
you would have died instantly.

1168
01:01:27.386 --> 01:01:28.921
- [grumbles]

1169
01:01:28.954 --> 01:01:31.224
Could you stop
with the doom and gloom?

1170
01:01:31.258 --> 01:01:33.360
Consider his feelings!

1171
01:01:33.425 --> 01:01:36.962
[panting]

1172
01:01:39.632 --> 01:01:42.968
Hey. don't pretend like
I'm the one in the wrong here.

1173
01:01:43.769 --> 01:01:45.104
- [footsteps echoing]
- What?

1174
01:01:45.137 --> 01:01:46.373
What are you pointing at?

1175
01:01:46.405 --> 01:01:49.242
- Your screaming let
the demons know we're here.

1176
01:01:49.276 --> 01:01:51.143
[all scream]

1177
01:01:51.176 --> 01:01:52.878
- Don't say I didn't warn you.

1178
01:01:52.912 --> 01:01:54.281
- [snarls]

1179
01:01:54.314 --> 01:01:56.448
- Hey. it was Yushiro. right?

1180
01:01:56.482 --> 01:01:58.884
Take care of Agatsuma.

1181
01:01:58.918 --> 01:02:00.085
Charge!

1182
01:02:02.087 --> 01:02:05.325
- Murata. please take care
of them quickly. okay?

1183
01:02:05.358 --> 01:02:07.693
- I am gonna give you
such an earful later!

1184
01:02:07.726 --> 01:02:08.794
- Damn.

1185
01:02:08.827 --> 01:02:10.397
[demon snarls]

1186
01:02:10.429 --> 01:02:12.965
- Water Breathing
Second Form...

1187
01:02:12.998 --> 01:02:14.267
Water Wheel!

1188
01:02:14.301 --> 01:02:16.001
[yells]

1189
01:02:16.035 --> 01:02:17.337
[demons groan]

1190
01:02:17.370 --> 01:02:18.737
[Murata]
We're gonna head them off!

1191
01:02:18.771 --> 01:02:20.439
Follow my lead. everyone!

1192
01:02:20.472 --> 01:02:22.608
[all yell]

1193
01:02:22.641 --> 01:02:24.311
- [running footsteps recede]
- [gasps]

1194
01:02:24.344 --> 01:02:25.611
[grumbles]

1195
01:02:29.982 --> 01:02:32.352
<i>[ominous music]</i>

1196
01:02:32.385 --> 01:02:37.390
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1197
01:02:37.424 --> 01:02:38.724
<i>This is bad.</i>

1198
01:02:38.757 --> 01:02:40.459
They're gonna run into <i>him</i> .

1199
01:02:40.492 --> 01:02:43.729
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1200
01:02:43.762 --> 01:02:46.532
<i>- We haven't encountered</i>
<i>any Upper Ranks.</i>

1201
01:02:46.565 --> 01:02:48.834
<i>Are we still</i>
<i>that far from Muzan?</i>

1202
01:02:48.867 --> 01:02:51.070
<i>I hope the others</i>
<i>are all right.</i>

1203
01:02:52.071 --> 01:02:53.239
[gasps]

1204
01:02:54.274 --> 01:02:55.774
<i>Ms. Shinobu.</i>

1205
01:02:56.675 --> 01:02:58.978
<i>We're going to win</i>
<i>this battle...</i>

1206
01:02:59.011 --> 01:03:01.613
<i>for you. for everyone.</i>

1207
01:03:03.182 --> 01:03:04.351
[gasps]

1208
01:03:04.384 --> 01:03:06.453
- That jolt. what was that?

1209
01:03:06.485 --> 01:03:08.187
- M-Mr. Giyu!

1210
01:03:08.221 --> 01:03:09.955
- Stay there! Keep calm.

1211
01:03:12.791 --> 01:03:14.727
<i>- Is someone else fighting?</i>

1212
01:03:14.760 --> 01:03:17.029
<i>Are we about to lose</i>
<i>another comrade?</i>

1213
01:03:17.062 --> 01:03:19.232
<i>[tense music]</i>

1214
01:03:19.265 --> 01:03:22.701
[rumbling footsteps]

1215
01:03:22.735 --> 01:03:25.637
<i>No. it's something else...</i>

1216
01:03:25.671 --> 01:03:27.506
<i>and it's coming this way.</i>

1217
01:03:28.341 --> 01:03:30.075
[sniffs]

1218
01:03:30.109 --> 01:03:32.278
<i>This-- This scent...</i>

1219
01:03:32.312 --> 01:03:34.314
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

1220
01:03:34.347 --> 01:03:40.320
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1221
01:03:40.353 --> 01:03:41.620
- [rumble]
- Above us!

1222
01:03:41.653 --> 01:03:42.955
Get back. Tanjiro!

1223
01:03:44.156 --> 01:03:45.190
- [winces]

1224
01:03:47.327 --> 01:03:49.595
- Long time no see.

1225
01:03:50.963 --> 01:03:54.300
It's commendable
you got this far.

1226
01:03:54.334 --> 01:03:57.303
Especially for a puny insect.

1227
01:03:58.505 --> 01:04:00.139
Don't you agree...

1228
01:04:00.172 --> 01:04:01.374
Tanjiro?!

1229
01:04:01.408 --> 01:04:02.908
- [winces]

1230
01:04:02.941 --> 01:04:03.909
[inhales]

1231
01:04:03.942 --> 01:04:06.812
Akaza!

1232
01:04:08.047 --> 01:04:10.417
<i>[foreboding music]</i>

1233
01:04:10.450 --> 01:04:13.185
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1234
01:04:13.219 --> 01:04:15.888
[liquid flowing]

1235
01:04:20.393 --> 01:04:26.999
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1236
01:04:32.338 --> 01:04:34.973
- [panting]

1237
01:04:35.007 --> 01:04:38.110
[winces]

1238
01:04:39.111 --> 01:04:40.579
<i>This place...</i>

1239
01:04:40.612 --> 01:04:42.848
<i>if I had to guess.</i>
<i>this fleshy cocoon</i>

1240
01:04:42.881 --> 01:04:45.150
<i>is breaking down</i>
<i>and disposing the drug</i>

1241
01:04:45.184 --> 01:04:47.986
<i>that's rescinding</i>
<i>his demon form.</i>

1242
01:04:49.255 --> 01:04:50.823
<i>Muzan Kibutsuji...</i>

1243
01:04:50.856 --> 01:04:55.594
<i>I had sworn to destroy you</i>
<i>by any means necessary.</i>

1244
01:04:56.429 --> 01:04:57.796
<i>Yet at this moment.</i>

1245
01:04:57.830 --> 01:05:00.599
<i>I am powerless to do so.</i>

1246
01:05:02.535 --> 01:05:05.137
[gasping]

1247
01:05:08.341 --> 01:05:09.641
Soon enough...

1248
01:05:09.675 --> 01:05:11.710
I'll be absorbed as well.

1249
01:05:12.512 --> 01:05:14.314
Please. someone...

1250
01:05:14.347 --> 01:05:16.748
anyone. come quickly!

1251
01:05:17.550 --> 01:05:19.219
I beg you!

1252
01:05:19.252 --> 01:05:22.255
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1253
01:05:25.624 --> 01:05:28.660
[growling and grunting]

1254
01:05:28.694 --> 01:05:30.796
- [overlapping chatter]
- Yeah. I've got that one.

1255
01:05:30.829 --> 01:05:32.764
- Speed is important.
but accuracy is more so.

1256
01:05:32.798 --> 01:05:36.668
<i>[Kiriya] According to Father.</i>
<i>if Muzan should die.</i>

1257
01:05:36.702 --> 01:05:38.804
<i>the other demons</i>
<i>will also perish.</i>

1258
01:05:38.837 --> 01:05:40.473
- Uh. that one is...
- Can you help me?

1259
01:05:40.507 --> 01:05:44.877
<i>- By that logic. it's clear</i>
<i>that Muzan is still alive.</i>

1260
01:05:45.677 --> 01:05:47.012
<i>At this very moment.</i>

1261
01:05:47.045 --> 01:05:50.149
<i>Ms. Tamayo must be</i>
<i>suppressing his powers.</i>

1262
01:05:51.183 --> 01:05:52.452
<i>If she weren't.</i>

1263
01:05:52.485 --> 01:05:55.888
<i>he would surely be aware</i>
<i>of Yushiro's watchful gaze.</i>

1264
01:05:56.922 --> 01:05:59.191
<i>Before Muzan's powers</i>
<i>are fully restored.</i>

1265
01:05:59.225 --> 01:06:02.928
<i>we must do whatever it takes</i>
<i>to see that he's defeated.</i>

1266
01:06:04.663 --> 01:06:06.031
<i>I have to wonder. though.</i>

1267
01:06:06.064 --> 01:06:09.935
<i>Inside of this</i>
<i>"Infinite Castle..."</i>

1268
01:06:09.968 --> 01:06:12.938
<i>will we really</i>
<i>be able to find him</i>

1269
01:06:12.971 --> 01:06:14.907
<i>and put an end to it all?</i>

1270
01:06:16.074 --> 01:06:18.744
[sighs]

1271
01:06:20.179 --> 01:06:22.649
- No need to be nervous.

1272
01:06:22.681 --> 01:06:25.117
You're doing a fine job.
my child.

1273
01:06:26.653 --> 01:06:30.689
Muzan will surely
reveal himself once more.

1274
01:06:30.722 --> 01:06:33.326
just as he did
when he found me.

1275
01:06:35.662 --> 01:06:37.930
When it comes to this man.

1276
01:06:37.963 --> 01:06:40.165
that's simply his nature.

1277
01:06:41.166 --> 01:06:43.168
- [gasps]

1278
01:06:43.202 --> 01:06:44.337
[shudders]

1279
01:06:44.370 --> 01:06:46.606
- Excuse me. The one
on the top actually goes here.

1280
01:06:46.639 --> 01:06:48.106
<i>- I understand. Father...</i>

1281
01:06:48.140 --> 01:06:50.008
<i>I will see to it</i>
<i>our plan succeeds.</i>

1282
01:06:50.042 --> 01:06:51.843
- Something like that?
- Move it back down.

1283
01:06:51.877 --> 01:06:53.879
- [growls and yelling]
- <i>[Kiriya] We must find him</i>

1284
01:06:53.912 --> 01:06:56.216
<i>before the Corps members'</i>
<i>strength is fully depleted</i>

1285
01:06:56.249 --> 01:06:59.151
<i>and settle this</i>
<i>once and for all!</i>

1286
01:06:59.184 --> 01:07:00.819
[Gyomei grunts]

1287
01:07:00.852 --> 01:07:02.754
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

1288
01:07:02.788 --> 01:07:04.923
- [growls]

1289
01:07:04.957 --> 01:07:05.991
[yells]

1290
01:07:08.228 --> 01:07:09.596
[all grunt]

1291
01:07:09.629 --> 01:07:11.297
[Hasegawa] Protect them!

1292
01:07:11.331 --> 01:07:12.699
- Everybody. group up!

1293
01:07:12.731 --> 01:07:14.066
We have to form a wall.

1294
01:07:14.099 --> 01:07:16.101
get their attention
off the Hashira!

1295
01:07:16.134 --> 01:07:18.638
- Please. sir.
go on ahead without us!

1296
01:07:18.671 --> 01:07:21.274
- You as well! We got this!

1297
01:07:21.307 --> 01:07:22.475
- Are you certain?

1298
01:07:24.677 --> 01:07:27.213
- [gags]
- [both yell]

1299
01:07:30.916 --> 01:07:33.686
- We are!
Just defeat Kibutsuji!

1300
01:07:33.720 --> 01:07:34.886
- Please. sir!

1301
01:07:34.920 --> 01:07:36.955
- Very well. then.

1302
01:07:36.989 --> 01:07:40.125
I will put my faith
in your efforts here.

1303
01:07:40.158 --> 01:07:41.527
Tokito!

1304
01:07:41.561 --> 01:07:42.662
- [grunts]

1305
01:07:42.695 --> 01:07:43.929
[Shimamoto] All right!

1306
01:07:43.962 --> 01:07:47.165
Let's show them the fruits
of our Hashira training!

1307
01:07:47.199 --> 01:07:48.401
- Right!
- Right!

1308
01:07:48.434 --> 01:07:50.670
[demons growling]

1309
01:07:50.703 --> 01:07:55.675
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1310
01:07:55.708 --> 01:07:58.378
<i>[Kiriya]</i>
<i>Everyone. thank you.</i>

1311
01:07:58.411 --> 01:07:59.811
<i>I know Father would be proud</i>

1312
01:07:59.845 --> 01:08:01.813
<i>to see you</i>
<i>giving it your all.</i>

1313
01:08:02.814 --> 01:08:09.422
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1314
01:08:11.790 --> 01:08:12.759
- [shudders]

1315
01:08:12.791 --> 01:08:14.092
- [Kiriya] Stop that.
- [gasps]

1316
01:08:14.126 --> 01:08:17.397
- You must keep
your hands moving.

1317
01:08:17.430 --> 01:08:19.565
Right now. we need to focus.

1318
01:08:21.467 --> 01:08:22.568
- Yes.

1319
01:08:25.705 --> 01:08:29.275
- Master Kiriya.
he's quite impressive.

1320
01:08:29.309 --> 01:08:31.744
It's clear
he's still in mourning

1321
01:08:31.778 --> 01:08:33.646
over the loss of the Master.

1322
01:08:33.680 --> 01:08:36.516
yet his duty is unwavering.

1323
01:08:36.549 --> 01:08:40.286
He's led the Demon Slayer
Corps rather splendidly.

1324
01:08:41.654 --> 01:08:44.357
Wouldn't you agree.
Mr. Rengoku?

1325
01:08:45.391 --> 01:08:46.992
- I would. indeed.

1326
01:08:48.294 --> 01:08:51.063
These children are
still young in years.

1327
01:08:51.096 --> 01:08:54.267
but their resolve
is anything but childish.

1328
01:08:55.535 --> 01:08:57.903
I swear to protect them.

1329
01:08:57.936 --> 01:09:00.972
just as Kyojuro did before me.

1330
01:09:01.006 --> 01:09:03.609
I will risk my own life
to do so.

1331
01:09:07.747 --> 01:09:10.283
[Nezuko murmurs]

1332
01:09:10.316 --> 01:09:12.918
[wincing]

1333
01:09:16.589 --> 01:09:20.259
<i>- I didn't think</i>
<i>she would suffer this much.</i>

1334
01:09:20.293 --> 01:09:24.564
<i>The Master was working</i>
<i>with a demon named Tamayo.</i>

1335
01:09:24.597 --> 01:09:26.932
<i>who delivered this antidote.</i>

1336
01:09:26.965 --> 01:09:30.001
<i>I've administered it</i>
<i>as she instructed.</i>

1337
01:09:31.371 --> 01:09:32.672
<i>Even so...</i>

1338
01:09:32.705 --> 01:09:37.410
<i>will Nezuko be able to turn</i>
<i>back into a human. I wonder.</i>

1339
01:09:37.443 --> 01:09:40.879
<i>If Nezuko does</i>
<i>become human again.</i>

1340
01:09:40.912 --> 01:09:44.082
<i>Muzan's grand scheme</i>
<i>will collapse.</i>

1341
01:09:44.116 --> 01:09:46.252
<i>His thousand-year quest</i>
<i>for a vessel</i>

1342
01:09:46.285 --> 01:09:50.323
<i>which can resist the sun</i>
<i>will be no more.</i>

1343
01:09:50.356 --> 01:09:53.058
<i>and all of the progress</i>
<i>he's made</i>

1344
01:09:53.091 --> 01:09:55.994
<i>will be wound back</i>
<i>like a clock.</i>

1345
01:09:57.330 --> 01:10:01.501
<i>In the many years that we've</i>
<i>had to endure this nightmare.</i>

1346
01:10:01.534 --> 01:10:03.369
<i>Nezuko is the only demon</i>

1347
01:10:03.403 --> 01:10:06.572
<i>who has been able to live</i>
<i>in the sunlight.</i>

1348
01:10:06.606 --> 01:10:09.475
<i>[tender music]</i>

1349
01:10:09.509 --> 01:10:12.110
[heart beating]

1350
01:10:15.314 --> 01:10:16.682
[inhales]

1351
01:10:17.784 --> 01:10:19.552
[sighs]

1352
01:10:22.187 --> 01:10:24.223
<i>"The final battle..."</i>

1353
01:10:24.257 --> 01:10:27.427
<i>these words echo in my mind.</i>

1354
01:10:29.295 --> 01:10:30.863
[swallows]

1355
01:10:30.897 --> 01:10:32.765
<i>And each time they do.</i>

1356
01:10:32.799 --> 01:10:36.168
<i>I can't help but tremble</i>
<i>as my heart beats louder.</i>

1357
01:10:37.403 --> 01:10:42.341
<i>This battle may finally reach</i>
<i>its conclusion tonight.</i>

1358
01:10:42.375 --> 01:10:47.346
<i>I never dreamed that I'd be</i>
<i>alive to witness it myself.</i>

1359
01:10:48.381 --> 01:10:52.218
<i>Tanjiro. I sometimes</i>
<i>think back to the day</i>

1360
01:10:52.251 --> 01:10:55.621
<i>when you brought</i>
<i>your demon sister to me.</i>

1361
01:10:55.655 --> 01:10:59.991
<i>Ever since then. it feels</i>
<i>like a giant wheel of fate</i>

1362
01:11:00.025 --> 01:11:02.595
<i>has been slowly turning.</i>

1363
01:11:02.628 --> 01:11:04.497
<i>Perhaps it would be best</i>

1364
01:11:04.530 --> 01:11:06.933
<i>to compare</i>
<i>the sum of our battles</i>

1365
01:11:06.965 --> 01:11:10.035
<i>to a giant. dormant machine.</i>

1366
01:11:10.068 --> 01:11:12.438
<i>You and Nezuko</i>
<i>are the small cogs</i>

1367
01:11:12.472 --> 01:11:16.809
<i>that have joined together and</i>
<i>awoken it from its slumber.</i>

1368
01:11:16.843 --> 01:11:19.144
<i>What was once</i>
<i>frozen in place...</i>

1369
01:11:19.177 --> 01:11:21.614
<i>has now been set into motion.</i>

1370
01:11:21.647 --> 01:11:24.217
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1371
01:11:24.250 --> 01:11:27.587
- [wincing]
- Don't give up. Nezuko.

1372
01:11:29.020 --> 01:11:31.691
<i>Keep up the fight. Tanjiro!</i>

1373
01:11:32.725 --> 01:11:34.159
<i>You both</i>
<i>have to pull through.</i>

1374
01:11:34.192 --> 01:11:35.828
<i>no matter what!</i>

1375
01:11:35.862 --> 01:11:37.697
<i>- Hinokami Kagura...</i>

1376
01:11:37.730 --> 01:11:39.465
<i>Fire Wheel!</i>

1377
01:11:39.499 --> 01:11:41.968
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

1378
01:11:42.000 --> 01:11:43.269
<i>Go through!</i>

1379
01:11:43.302 --> 01:11:44.837
<i>If I can't even</i>
<i>sever his arm.</i>

1380
01:11:44.871 --> 01:11:46.506
<i>I'll never sever his head!</i>

1381
01:11:46.539 --> 01:11:48.508
[screams]

1382
01:11:53.379 --> 01:11:54.280
<i>I got one!</i>

1383
01:11:54.313 --> 01:11:56.916
<i>I was able to dodge</i>
<i>his attack. too.</i>

1384
01:11:56.949 --> 01:11:58.651
<i>I can do this!</i>

1385
01:11:58.684 --> 01:12:00.553
<i>I couldn't aim for his head.</i>

1386
01:12:00.586 --> 01:12:02.153
<i>but this time. for sure!</i>

1387
01:12:03.121 --> 01:12:04.757
<i>Hinokami Kagura...</i>

1388
01:12:04.790 --> 01:12:05.791
<i>Fake Rainbow!</i>

1389
01:12:12.999 --> 01:12:16.134
[panting]

1390
01:12:18.437 --> 01:12:20.273
- Huh?

1391
01:12:21.607 --> 01:12:22.742
<i>[Giyu] Tanjiro...</i>

1392
01:12:22.775 --> 01:12:26.012
<i>you've really sharpened</i>
<i>your skills. haven't you?</i>

1393
01:12:26.044 --> 01:12:28.314
<i>It wouldn't be</i>
<i>an exaggeration</i>

1394
01:12:28.347 --> 01:12:31.517
<i>to say he's at the level</i>
<i>of a Hashira now.</i>

1395
01:12:31.551 --> 01:12:36.522
<i>To think that he'd do this</i>
<i>well against Upper Three.</i>

1396
01:12:36.556 --> 01:12:38.925
<i>[singer vocalizing]</i>

1397
01:12:38.958 --> 01:12:41.694
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1398
01:12:41.727 --> 01:12:43.796
<i>That day...</i>

1399
01:12:43.829 --> 01:12:47.065
<i>I remember a boy who felt</i>
<i>completely helpless</i>

1400
01:12:47.098 --> 01:12:50.036
<i>as he collapsed</i>
<i>onto the cold snow.</i>

1401
01:12:50.068 --> 01:12:52.572
<i>begging through tears</i>
<i>for his sister's life.</i>

1402
01:12:52.605 --> 01:13:00.178
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1403
01:13:00.212 --> 01:13:02.815
<i>But you are helpless</i>
<i>no longer.</i>

1404
01:13:02.848 --> 01:13:06.285
<i>You have the strength to</i>
<i>fight not only for your life</i>

1405
01:13:06.319 --> 01:13:09.322
<i>but also</i>
<i>for what's precious to you.</i>

1406
01:13:10.623 --> 01:13:12.959
- "This boy is not weak.

1407
01:13:12.992 --> 01:13:15.160
Don't insult him."

1408
01:13:15.193 --> 01:13:19.398
I must admit that Kyojuro
was right when he said that.

1409
01:13:19.432 --> 01:13:22.635
You are certainly not weak.

1410
01:13:22.668 --> 01:13:25.304
In fact. I commend you.

1411
01:13:27.206 --> 01:13:28.173
<i>[rousing music]</i>

1412
01:13:28.207 --> 01:13:30.543
Technique Development.

1413
01:13:30.576 --> 01:13:34.447
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1414
01:13:34.480 --> 01:13:37.717
Now let's kick things off.
shall we?

1415
01:13:38.718 --> 01:13:40.686
It's time we had some fun.

1416
01:13:41.954 --> 01:13:43.022
[gasps]

1417
01:13:43.055 --> 01:13:46.392
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1418
01:13:46.425 --> 01:13:48.193
[rumbling]

1419
01:13:48.227 --> 01:13:54.800
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1420
01:14:09.081 --> 01:14:10.383
- [exhales]

1421
01:14:12.818 --> 01:14:14.185
- [chuckles]

1422
01:14:16.589 --> 01:14:18.524
[grunts]

1423
01:14:23.529 --> 01:14:24.597
[chuckles]

1424
01:14:27.099 --> 01:14:28.934
<i>- Water Breathing...</i>

1425
01:14:28.968 --> 01:14:30.102
<i>Third Form...</i>

1426
01:14:30.136 --> 01:14:31.570
<i>Flowing Dance.</i>

1427
01:14:32.738 --> 01:14:34.674
- You're a Water Hashira!

1428
01:14:34.707 --> 01:14:36.442
How lucky for me!

1429
01:14:36.475 --> 01:14:39.412
It's been 50 years
since I fought one.

1430
01:14:41.013 --> 01:14:42.715
[growls]

1431
01:14:47.219 --> 01:14:50.489
Destructive Death: Disorder!

1432
01:14:52.258 --> 01:14:55.294
Water Breathing
Eleventh Form...

1433
01:14:56.095 --> 01:14:57.029
Dead Calm.

1434
01:14:57.063 --> 01:14:59.965
<i>[singer vocalizes]</i>

1435
01:15:02.234 --> 01:15:04.970
- I've never seen
that move before.

1436
01:15:05.004 --> 01:15:07.440
Perhaps the last
Water Hashira I killed

1437
01:15:07.473 --> 01:15:09.975
never had a chance to use it!

1438
01:15:10.009 --> 01:15:11.677
<i>- Hinokami Kagura...</i>

1439
01:15:11.711 --> 01:15:13.245
<i>Raging Sun!</i>

1440
01:15:14.947 --> 01:15:16.549
<i>[gasps] He vanished.</i>

1441
01:15:17.550 --> 01:15:18.451
<i>Behind me!</i>

1442
01:15:18.484 --> 01:15:20.553
<i>Fake Rai-- Kagura--</i>

1443
01:15:21.454 --> 01:15:24.623
<i>- Water Breathing</i>
<i>Second Form...</i>

1444
01:15:24.657 --> 01:15:26.492
<i>Water Wheel.</i>

1445
01:15:27.727 --> 01:15:29.195
- [snarls]

1446
01:15:29.228 --> 01:15:30.396
[roars]

1447
01:15:32.498 --> 01:15:33.532
[yells]

1448
01:15:38.170 --> 01:15:39.772
<i>- Hinokami Kagura...</i>

1449
01:15:41.040 --> 01:15:42.341
<i>Flame Dance!</i>

1450
01:15:42.374 --> 01:15:44.777
<i>- Destructive Death:</i>
<i>Leg Type.</i>

1451
01:15:44.810 --> 01:15:46.879
<i>Crown Splitter!</i>

1452
01:15:46.912 --> 01:15:49.782
<i>- I blocked it with my sword!</i>

1453
01:15:49.815 --> 01:15:50.916
[gags]

1454
01:15:54.053 --> 01:15:56.088
<i>His move barely grazed me.</i>

1455
01:15:56.122 --> 01:15:58.390
<i>and it still did</i>
<i>this kind of damage?</i>

1456
01:15:58.424 --> 01:16:00.726
- [rumble]
- [gasps]

1457
01:16:01.727 --> 01:16:02.928
- [laughs]

1458
01:16:02.962 --> 01:16:04.530
How marvelous!

1459
01:16:06.132 --> 01:16:08.334
That elegant sword skill
you're using.

1460
01:16:08.367 --> 01:16:09.668
it's magnificent!

1461
01:16:09.702 --> 01:16:11.170
I must know now.

1462
01:16:11.203 --> 01:16:12.471
What is your name?

1463
01:16:12.505 --> 01:16:14.640
I want to remember you!

1464
01:16:16.609 --> 01:16:19.378
- I don't have a name
to give to a demon like you!

1465
01:16:19.411 --> 01:16:22.581
I hate talking.
so don't speak to me!

1466
01:16:23.382 --> 01:16:24.617
- Is that so?

1467
01:16:24.650 --> 01:16:27.419
You're not much
for small talk. are you?

1468
01:16:27.453 --> 01:16:29.889
Well. I happen
to quite enjoy it!

1469
01:16:29.922 --> 01:16:31.957
So I'll ask you again...

1470
01:16:31.991 --> 01:16:33.893
What is your name?

1471
01:16:40.132 --> 01:16:43.369
Destructive Death: Leg Type...

1472
01:16:43.402 --> 01:16:45.604
Explosive Fury!

1473
01:16:45.638 --> 01:16:47.306
[laughs]

1474
01:16:49.608 --> 01:16:52.545
[yells]

1475
01:16:53.946 --> 01:16:55.047
- [winces]

1476
01:16:57.082 --> 01:16:58.083
[groans]

1477
01:16:58.117 --> 01:16:59.819
- Mr. Giyu!

1478
01:17:01.654 --> 01:17:02.788
- I see.

1479
01:17:02.822 --> 01:17:03.923
That's his name.

1480
01:17:03.956 --> 01:17:05.858
Thank you for letting me know.

1481
01:17:09.328 --> 01:17:10.863
- Hinokami Kagura...

1482
01:17:10.896 --> 01:17:14.033
- Destructive Death:
Eight-layered Demon Core!

1483
01:17:14.066 --> 01:17:16.402
- ...Burning Bones.
Summer Sun!

1484
01:17:19.206 --> 01:17:20.439
[groans]

1485
01:17:23.042 --> 01:17:25.878
[panting]

1486
01:17:28.047 --> 01:17:31.318
[footsteps echoing]

1487
01:17:31.350 --> 01:17:32.985
- Excellent form.

1488
01:17:33.018 --> 01:17:37.022
To improve this much in such
a short time is impressive.

1489
01:17:37.056 --> 01:17:39.292
I'll give you my praise.

1490
01:17:39.326 --> 01:17:40.926
It seems obvious to me

1491
01:17:40.960 --> 01:17:43.896
that Kyojuro must have
really inspired you.

1492
01:17:43.929 --> 01:17:48.167
The night we met. you were
merely a weak. mournful child

1493
01:17:48.200 --> 01:17:50.069
crumpled on the ground.

1494
01:17:50.102 --> 01:17:52.504
not even worthy
of being killed.

1495
01:17:52.538 --> 01:17:54.573
But just look at you now!

1496
01:17:54.607 --> 01:17:56.609
This leap
in your abilities...

1497
01:17:56.642 --> 01:17:58.978
it's like you've been reborn!

1498
01:17:59.011 --> 01:18:01.013
My heart won't stop racing.

1499
01:18:01.046 --> 01:18:03.415
I'm truly overjoyed!

1500
01:18:03.449 --> 01:18:05.851
[chuckles]

1501
01:18:05.885 --> 01:18:10.290
The night Kyojuro died.
I was glad that it happened.

1502
01:18:10.323 --> 01:18:11.790
- Huh?

1503
01:18:11.824 --> 01:18:13.726
- How tragic
would it have been

1504
01:18:13.759 --> 01:18:16.662
if he had never
gotten any stronger?

1505
01:18:16.695 --> 01:18:18.898
Such a stubborn man.
not letting go

1506
01:18:18.931 --> 01:18:22.101
of those worthless values
of staying human.

1507
01:18:23.370 --> 01:18:25.905
- How dare you.

1508
01:18:30.743 --> 01:18:32.312
[shudders]

1509
01:18:32.345 --> 01:18:33.313
Shut up.

1510
01:18:33.346 --> 01:18:35.147
Just shut up!

1511
01:18:39.252 --> 01:18:42.521
Don't you dare
even speak his name!

1512
01:18:42.554 --> 01:18:44.523
- What's the matter?

1513
01:18:44.556 --> 01:18:47.126
I'm only paying the man
a compliment.

1514
01:18:47.159 --> 01:18:48.694
I'm being sincere.

1515
01:18:48.727 --> 01:18:50.763
These are
high words of praise.

1516
01:18:50.796 --> 01:18:51.830
- You're wrong.

1517
01:18:51.864 --> 01:18:54.401
All you're doing
is insulting him.

1518
01:18:54.433 --> 01:18:58.537
You're just spitting
on his memory. on all of us!

1519
01:18:59.471 --> 01:19:02.242
- You couldn't
be more wrong. Tanjiro.

1520
01:19:02.275 --> 01:19:03.509
As you'll recall.

1521
01:19:03.542 --> 01:19:07.479
the only thing I despise
is weak human beings.

1522
01:19:07.513 --> 01:19:10.182
Only a feeble weakling
is deserving of my scorn

1523
01:19:10.216 --> 01:19:12.151
and no one else.

1524
01:19:12.184 --> 01:19:14.354
That's right.

1525
01:19:14.387 --> 01:19:17.556
The mere sight of them
makes my skin crawl.

1526
01:19:17.589 --> 01:19:19.758
They make me retch!

1527
01:19:19.792 --> 01:19:21.660
Through the laws of nature.

1528
01:19:21.694 --> 01:19:23.363
they are weeded out
from this world.

1529
01:19:23.396 --> 01:19:25.931
just as they should be!

1530
01:19:25.965 --> 01:19:30.002
- Everything you just said
is wrong!

1531
01:19:30.035 --> 01:19:31.870
- Huh?

1532
01:19:31.904 --> 01:19:34.606
- The fact you're
even alive right now.

1533
01:19:34.640 --> 01:19:36.976
isn't that proof enough?

1534
01:19:37.009 --> 01:19:40.779
As an infant.
we're all helpless.

1535
01:19:40.813 --> 01:19:43.749
We can't live
without someone else's help.

1536
01:19:43.782 --> 01:19:46.485
You're no different. Akaza.

1537
01:19:46.518 --> 01:19:48.821
Even if you don't remember.

1538
01:19:48.854 --> 01:19:50.756
there was a time
when you were protected

1539
01:19:50.789 --> 01:19:53.692
and cared for by someone.
I know it!

1540
01:19:53.726 --> 01:19:56.595
That's why you're alive.

1541
01:19:56.628 --> 01:20:00.566
<i>[stirring music]</i>

1542
01:20:00.599 --> 01:20:04.003
The strong should aid
and protect the weak.

1543
01:20:04.036 --> 01:20:06.038
And in turn.
the weak become strong

1544
01:20:06.071 --> 01:20:09.409
and aid and protect those
weaker than themselves.

1545
01:20:09.442 --> 01:20:12.611
That is the law of nature!

1546
01:20:12.644 --> 01:20:16.715
Akaza. I can't tolerate
your way of thinking.

1547
01:20:16.749 --> 01:20:20.986
Here on out. I won't
let you do as you please!

1548
01:20:21.020 --> 01:20:25.991
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1549
01:20:26.025 --> 01:20:27.860
<i>[Akaza] I get it now.</i>

1550
01:20:30.195 --> 01:20:32.031
<i>I have a disgust for this boy</i>

1551
01:20:32.064 --> 01:20:34.600
<i>that's almost</i>
<i>primal in nature.</i>

1552
01:20:35.402 --> 01:20:37.102
<i>Even if he's stronger.</i>

1553
01:20:37.136 --> 01:20:39.038
<i>that feeling hasn't faded.</i>

1554
01:20:43.742 --> 01:20:45.911
- No matter who they are.

1555
01:20:45.944 --> 01:20:49.048
everyone begins life
as a newborn.

1556
01:20:49.081 --> 01:20:53.286
We learn by getting help
from those around us.

1557
01:20:53.319 --> 01:20:55.888
We are not competing
with others.

1558
01:20:55.921 --> 01:21:00.226
The only opponent
you have in life is yourself.

1559
01:21:00.260 --> 01:21:02.362
Just focus
on becoming stronger

1560
01:21:02.395 --> 01:21:04.797
than you were yesterday.

1561
01:21:04.830 --> 01:21:09.235
If you can stay this path
for a decade or even two.

1562
01:21:09.269 --> 01:21:11.203
that would be commendable.

1563
01:21:11.237 --> 01:21:12.704
And before you know it.

1564
01:21:12.738 --> 01:21:15.341
you will be
helping others in turn.

1565
01:21:16.342 --> 01:21:18.911
- [shudders]

1566
01:21:21.947 --> 01:21:23.216
- [gasps]

1567
01:21:23.249 --> 01:21:24.583
<i>What was that?</i>

1568
01:21:24.616 --> 01:21:26.718
<i>He just swung his fist</i>
<i>at nothing.</i>

1569
01:21:32.658 --> 01:21:34.260
- Tanjiro...

1570
01:21:35.462 --> 01:21:38.097
you still repulse me
to my core.

1571
01:21:38.997 --> 01:21:41.434
<i>Destructive Death:</i>
<i>Crushing Type.</i>

1572
01:21:41.468 --> 01:21:44.203
<i>Ten Thousand Leaves</i>
<i>Flashing Willow!</i>

1573
01:21:44.237 --> 01:21:46.138
<i>[singer vocalizing]</i>

1574
01:21:47.340 --> 01:21:49.275
<i>- This speed. it's blinding!</i>

1575
01:21:49.309 --> 01:21:51.810
<i>No. it's not just his speed.</i>

1576
01:21:51.844 --> 01:21:55.248
<i>It's his precision.</i>
<i>his aura. and also...</i>

1577
01:21:59.618 --> 01:22:02.322
- Destructive Death:
Leg Type.

1578
01:22:02.355 --> 01:22:03.289
<i>- Below?</i>

1579
01:22:05.657 --> 01:22:07.893
- Flying Planet
Thousand Wheels!

1580
01:22:12.565 --> 01:22:13.732
- [gasps]

1581
01:22:13.765 --> 01:22:16.135
<i>Even if I could</i>
<i>anticipate his strikes.</i>

1582
01:22:16.168 --> 01:22:19.439
<i>they're so powerful. I can't</i>
<i>completely deflect them.</i>

1583
01:22:19.472 --> 01:22:21.207
<i>His techniques</i>
<i>are so precise.</i>

1584
01:22:21.241 --> 01:22:24.377
<i>they can pierce through any</i>
<i>opening. no matter how small.</i>

1585
01:22:26.011 --> 01:22:27.079
- [growls]

1586
01:22:27.112 --> 01:22:29.982
<i>- It's like a magnet</i>
<i>is attracting his attacks</i>

1587
01:22:30.015 --> 01:22:32.318
<i>straight toward</i>
<i>my weak points!</i>

1588
01:22:32.352 --> 01:22:35.221
<i>But how? What's happening?</i>

1589
01:22:35.255 --> 01:22:38.224
<i>What could be causing</i>
<i>this behavior?</i>

1590
01:22:38.258 --> 01:22:40.226
<i>Come on. think.</i>

1591
01:22:41.594 --> 01:22:43.128
<i>What's the answer?</i>

1592
01:22:43.162 --> 01:22:46.665
<i>There must be a clue</i>
<i>in what Akaza's said or done.</i>

1593
01:22:46.698 --> 01:22:47.933
- [growls]

1594
01:22:47.966 --> 01:22:49.502
[yells]

1595
01:22:49.536 --> 01:22:53.939
<i>- Hinokami Kagura:</i>
<i>Solar Heat Haze!</i>

1596
01:23:03.115 --> 01:23:05.451
- [laughs]
What an interesting move.

1597
01:23:05.485 --> 01:23:09.455
I dodged it at first. but then
the blade seemed to extend.

1598
01:23:09.489 --> 01:23:12.358
I don't know what kind
of swing you put behind it.

1599
01:23:12.392 --> 01:23:13.493
but the tip of your blade

1600
01:23:13.526 --> 01:23:15.628
wavered like it
was in a heat haze.

1601
01:23:15.662 --> 01:23:16.995
How fascinating!

1602
01:23:17.029 --> 01:23:18.231
- [gasps]

1603
01:23:20.199 --> 01:23:21.434
- [yells]

1604
01:23:24.169 --> 01:23:26.872
<i>[tense music]</i>

1605
01:23:27.940 --> 01:23:30.108
<i>- Hinokami Kagura...</i>

1606
01:23:30.142 --> 01:23:31.176
<i>Dance!</i>

1607
01:23:32.412 --> 01:23:33.580
- [grunts]

1608
01:23:33.613 --> 01:23:34.813
<i>- My sword...</i>

1609
01:23:35.714 --> 01:23:37.217
<i>he'll break it!</i>

1610
01:23:41.753 --> 01:23:43.922
- That was a strong headbutt!

1611
01:23:45.525 --> 01:23:47.759
- Damn you! Let go of me!

1612
01:23:48.595 --> 01:23:50.162
<i>No good.</i>

1613
01:23:50.195 --> 01:23:52.864
<i>I can't get him</i>
<i>to loosen his grip!</i>

1614
01:24:03.443 --> 01:24:04.743
- [chuckles]

1615
01:24:04.776 --> 01:24:06.546
- Mr. Giyu!

1616
01:24:06.579 --> 01:24:09.848
[Giyu sighs]

1617
01:24:09.881 --> 01:24:12.751
You're starting
to get on my nerves.

1618
01:24:12.784 --> 01:24:15.954
Thanks to you.
my back is killing me now.

1619
01:24:15.988 --> 01:24:19.325
I'm not fond of being
hurled like a ragdoll.

1620
01:24:19.359 --> 01:24:21.159
I'm gonna make you pay.

1621
01:24:23.895 --> 01:24:25.163
<i>Personally...</i>

1622
01:24:25.197 --> 01:24:28.601
<i>I'd rather not draw</i>
<i>my sword if I can help it.</i>

1623
01:24:28.635 --> 01:24:29.868
<i>and I have a hard time</i>

1624
01:24:29.901 --> 01:24:33.373
<i>justifying using deadly force</i>
<i>if unnecessary.</i>

1625
01:24:33.406 --> 01:24:37.277
<i>But at this moment.</i>
<i>I'm against an opponent</i>

1626
01:24:37.310 --> 01:24:39.579
<i>that demands</i>
<i>everything from me.</i>

1627
01:24:39.612 --> 01:24:41.013
<i>In the short time</i>
<i>we've fought.</i>

1628
01:24:41.046 --> 01:24:43.982
<i>my senses have been</i>
<i>pushed past their limits.</i>

1629
01:24:44.016 --> 01:24:47.453
<i>My dormant senses</i>
<i>have been rudely awakened.</i>

1630
01:24:47.487 --> 01:24:51.557
<i>and are dragging me forward</i>
<i>towards the enemy.</i>

1631
01:24:51.591 --> 01:24:55.295
<i>I now know how much it</i>
<i>expands one's potential</i>

1632
01:24:55.328 --> 01:24:57.195
<i>to have one's back</i>
<i>against the wall</i>

1633
01:24:57.230 --> 01:25:01.099
<i>with their sword raised</i>
<i>in the face of death.</i>

1634
01:25:01.133 --> 01:25:03.403
- [gasps]

1635
01:25:04.437 --> 01:25:05.538
Mr. Giyu.

1636
01:25:09.709 --> 01:25:13.246
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

1637
01:25:13.279 --> 01:25:16.416
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1638
01:25:22.388 --> 01:25:25.458
<i>- A mark appeared. and</i>
<i>his movements have gotten...</i>

1639
01:25:25.491 --> 01:25:26.958
- Faster!

1640
01:25:31.297 --> 01:25:34.933
<i>- Water Breathing</i>
<i>Fourth Form: Striking Tide!</i>

1641
01:25:35.735 --> 01:25:36.703
- [sighs]

1642
01:25:36.736 --> 01:25:37.704
[chuckles]

1643
01:25:37.737 --> 01:25:39.572
- [winces]

1644
01:25:45.645 --> 01:25:48.914
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1645
01:25:48.947 --> 01:25:50.916
<i>- They're both so fast!</i>

1646
01:25:50.949 --> 01:25:53.252
<i>Mr. Giyu's speed</i>
<i>increased with the mark.</i>

1647
01:25:53.286 --> 01:25:55.854
<i>but Akaza</i>
<i>adapted to it instantly!</i>

1648
01:25:58.224 --> 01:26:01.126
- Don't tell me
that's all you're capable of!

1649
01:26:01.159 --> 01:26:02.894
- [growls]

1650
01:26:02.928 --> 01:26:05.331
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1651
01:26:09.968 --> 01:26:11.437
- Show me more!

1652
01:26:11.471 --> 01:26:13.639
Don't you dare hold back!

1653
01:26:13.673 --> 01:26:20.145
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1654
01:26:25.385 --> 01:26:28.321
- [breathes deeply]

1655
01:26:42.602 --> 01:26:46.138
Tenth Form: Constant Flux.

1656
01:26:53.780 --> 01:26:55.314
[yells]

1657
01:26:55.348 --> 01:27:00.620
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1658
01:27:00.653 --> 01:27:01.987
[Akaza winces]

1659
01:27:03.222 --> 01:27:06.759
- Seventh Form:
Drop Ripple Thrust!

1660
01:27:06.793 --> 01:27:09.161
- Destructive Death: Disorder.

1661
01:27:12.231 --> 01:27:15.401
[distant rumbles echoing]

1662
01:27:15.435 --> 01:27:17.603
[footsteps echo]

1663
01:27:19.839 --> 01:27:22.708
- Mr. Giyu! Akaza.

1664
01:27:24.710 --> 01:27:26.978
<i>Calm down!</i>

1665
01:27:27.012 --> 01:27:29.282
[sword clanging]

1666
01:27:30.616 --> 01:27:32.485
<i>Think. Don't panic.</i>

1667
01:27:32.518 --> 01:27:35.655
<i>Whatever you do.</i>
<i>don't lose focus.</i>

1668
01:27:35.688 --> 01:27:37.022
- [yells]

1669
01:27:37.055 --> 01:27:38.758
<i>- Why is it</i>
<i>that Akaza's attacks</i>

1670
01:27:38.791 --> 01:27:40.426
<i>are always so accurate?</i>

1671
01:27:41.561 --> 01:27:42.994
<i>How is he able to respond</i>

1672
01:27:43.028 --> 01:27:44.963
<i>to attacks</i>
<i>from his blind spots?</i>

1673
01:27:46.399 --> 01:27:47.400
<i>Think!</i>

1674
01:27:48.801 --> 01:27:50.570
[breathes deeply]

1675
01:27:51.938 --> 01:27:53.972
<i>- Your fighting spirit</i>
<i>has been tempered</i>

1676
01:27:54.005 --> 01:27:55.808
<i>like quality steel.</i>

1677
01:27:55.842 --> 01:27:57.108
<i>Your name?</i>

1678
01:27:57.910 --> 01:27:59.846
- [gasps]

1679
01:27:59.879 --> 01:28:02.113
<i>Back when he</i>
<i>fought Mr. Rengoku.</i>

1680
01:28:02.147 --> 01:28:06.819
<i>I remember Akaza using</i>
<i>the words "fighting spirit."</i>

1681
01:28:06.853 --> 01:28:09.154
<i>What did he mean by that?</i>

1682
01:28:09.187 --> 01:28:12.090
<i>Is he able to sense things</i>
<i>through fighting spirit?</i>

1683
01:28:12.123 --> 01:28:15.528
<i>The same way I can</i>
<i>sense things through scent?</i>

1684
01:28:15.561 --> 01:28:24.504
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1685
01:28:24.537 --> 01:28:28.708
[shudders]

1686
01:28:29.775 --> 01:28:31.210
- Wherever the enemy's
aiming at.

1687
01:28:31.244 --> 01:28:34.012
I get this weird
tingling feeling.

1688
01:28:34.045 --> 01:28:35.214
- So that's how you knew

1689
01:28:35.248 --> 01:28:37.350
Gyutaro was attacking you
from behind.

1690
01:28:37.383 --> 01:28:39.852
You sure are incredible.
Inosuke.

1691
01:28:39.886 --> 01:28:41.354
- [laughs]

1692
01:28:41.387 --> 01:28:44.824
Well. my skin is tougher
than most people's.

1693
01:28:44.857 --> 01:28:46.659
And whether it's
from behind or not.

1694
01:28:46.692 --> 01:28:47.827
if someone's looking at me.

1695
01:28:47.860 --> 01:28:49.762
I know just
where they're looking.

1696
01:28:49.795 --> 01:28:50.997
- Could you show me?

1697
01:28:51.029 --> 01:28:52.698
- [laughs]

1698
01:28:52.732 --> 01:28:53.733
Sure thing!

1699
01:28:54.734 --> 01:28:56.335
- [grunts]

1700
01:28:58.638 --> 01:28:59.605
- It's my right shoulder.

1701
01:28:59.639 --> 01:29:01.841
- [gasps] You really got it!
That's amazing!

1702
01:29:01.874 --> 01:29:05.011
- It's even easier to know
if someone's looking at me

1703
01:29:05.043 --> 01:29:06.579
if they have killing intent.

1704
01:29:06.612 --> 01:29:10.081
Since anyone
who could harm me is bad news.

1705
01:29:10.115 --> 01:29:12.018
killing intent
kinda feels like

1706
01:29:12.050 --> 01:29:14.253
it's stabbing me
through the skin. you know.

1707
01:29:14.287 --> 01:29:16.255
<i>[Tanjiro] That's right.</i>

1708
01:29:16.289 --> 01:29:19.157
<i>Inosuke was able</i>
<i>to sense the invisible</i>

1709
01:29:19.190 --> 01:29:21.961
<i>using only</i>
<i>his honed sense of touch.</i>

1710
01:29:21.994 --> 01:29:23.930
<i>Think back.</i>

1711
01:29:23.963 --> 01:29:25.965
<i>What else did we</i>
<i>talk about...</i>

1712
01:29:25.998 --> 01:29:27.934
<i>that day?</i>

1713
01:29:27.967 --> 01:29:29.635
- Where things get real tricky

1714
01:29:29.669 --> 01:29:32.038
is when someone who
doesn't have killing intent

1715
01:29:32.070 --> 01:29:34.340
or hostility
is looking at me.

1716
01:29:34.373 --> 01:29:36.542
- Like that tiny hag!
- Huh?

1717
01:29:36.576 --> 01:29:38.109
- That old hag

1718
01:29:38.143 --> 01:29:41.647
from the house with
the wisteria mark was sneaky.

1719
01:29:41.681 --> 01:29:43.316
Before I knew it...

1720
01:29:43.349 --> 01:29:44.350
Huh?

1721
01:29:45.284 --> 01:29:47.420
...she'd be sitting
right behind me.

1722
01:29:47.453 --> 01:29:48.921
- holding rice balls!
- Whoa!

1723
01:29:48.955 --> 01:29:49.922
[jabbers]

1724
01:29:49.956 --> 01:29:51.958
- Calling her a hag
isn't nice.

1725
01:29:51.991 --> 01:29:52.959
She's elderly!

1726
01:29:52.992 --> 01:29:53.960
- Elderly hag!

1727
01:29:53.993 --> 01:29:55.126
- Stop that!

1728
01:29:55.160 --> 01:29:56.963
- Well. that got me thinking.

1729
01:29:56.996 --> 01:30:00.566
If I could hide my killing
intent. then I'd be a ninja!

1730
01:30:00.600 --> 01:30:03.336
I'd be able
to sneak up on anybody!

1731
01:30:03.369 --> 01:30:04.070
[laughs]

1732
01:30:04.102 --> 01:30:05.237
- Sure.

1733
01:30:05.271 --> 01:30:07.807
But. Inosuke.
she was only sneaky

1734
01:30:07.840 --> 01:30:10.776
'cause she didn't have
the intent of harming you.

1735
01:30:10.810 --> 01:30:12.143
And I think beheading a demon

1736
01:30:12.177 --> 01:30:15.414
without killing intent
would be impossible.

1737
01:30:15.448 --> 01:30:16.816
- Hmm.

1738
01:30:16.849 --> 01:30:19.418
Yeah. you're probably right.

1739
01:30:19.452 --> 01:30:22.321
A halfhearted strike
without any killing intent

1740
01:30:22.355 --> 01:30:25.825
would never be strong enough
to cut through a demon's neck.

1741
01:30:26.892 --> 01:30:29.095
<i>- It was</i>
<i>a casual conversation.</i>

1742
01:30:29.127 --> 01:30:32.331
<i>but I think Inosuke</i>
<i>was onto something.</i>

1743
01:30:32.365 --> 01:30:33.566
- [yells]
- [groans]

1744
01:30:33.599 --> 01:30:37.036
<i>- What is it that Akaza</i>
<i>supposedly senses?</i>

1745
01:30:37.069 --> 01:30:39.639
<i>What does he mean</i>
<i>by "fighting spirit"?</i>

1746
01:30:39.672 --> 01:30:41.007
<i>Is it killing intent?</i>

1747
01:30:41.040 --> 01:30:42.475
<i>Is it the will to fight.</i>

1748
01:30:42.508 --> 01:30:46.245
<i>the time spent training.</i>
<i>or maybe the amount?</i>

1749
01:30:46.278 --> 01:30:47.647
<i>Is it like the way</i>

1750
01:30:47.680 --> 01:30:50.216
<i>I can anticipate</i>
<i>movements through scent?</i>

1751
01:30:51.250 --> 01:30:53.386
<i>There must be</i>
<i>something I can do...</i>

1752
01:30:53.419 --> 01:30:55.788
<i>to disrupt his compass!</i>

1753
01:30:58.824 --> 01:31:00.760
<i>[stirring music]</i>

1754
01:31:05.898 --> 01:31:08.300
Hinokami Kagura: Dance!

1755
01:31:10.236 --> 01:31:13.239
- Just one problem
with your attack.

1756
01:31:13.272 --> 01:31:15.408
You're wide open!

1757
01:31:17.777 --> 01:31:18.878
<i>- His fist!</i>

1758
01:31:27.185 --> 01:31:29.755
[winces]

1759
01:31:29.789 --> 01:31:32.224
[panting]

1760
01:31:32.258 --> 01:31:36.062
<i>Fighting spirit.</i>
<i>instincts. compass.</i>

1761
01:31:36.095 --> 01:31:37.830
<i>perception...</i>

1762
01:31:37.863 --> 01:31:39.632
<i>striking with killing intent.</i>

1763
01:31:39.665 --> 01:31:43.669
<i>sensing the invisible.</i>
<i>executing the impossible.</i>

1764
01:31:43.703 --> 01:31:45.471
<i>I see.</i>

1765
01:31:47.273 --> 01:31:48.808
<i>So that's it.</i>

1766
01:31:51.711 --> 01:31:54.313
[birds chirping]

1767
01:31:56.115 --> 01:31:58.718
[children laughing]

1768
01:32:00.920 --> 01:32:02.755
- Hey! [laughs]

1769
01:32:02.788 --> 01:32:04.623
[children laughing]

1770
01:32:04.657 --> 01:32:06.025
- Again! Again!

1771
01:32:06.058 --> 01:32:08.160
- Um. Father.
what do you think about

1772
01:32:08.194 --> 01:32:11.263
when you dance
the Hinokami Kagura?

1773
01:32:11.297 --> 01:32:13.132
If it's too tiring for you.

1774
01:32:13.165 --> 01:32:15.267
I can take your place
next year.

1775
01:32:15.301 --> 01:32:19.038
I don't want you
to overwork yourself.

1776
01:32:19.071 --> 01:32:21.807
- Thank you. Tanjiro.

1777
01:32:21.841 --> 01:32:24.477
But to be honest.
I haven't found the Kagura

1778
01:32:24.510 --> 01:32:28.047
to be the least bit tiring
over the last few years.

1779
01:32:28.080 --> 01:32:30.516
I can't quite explain it.

1780
01:32:30.549 --> 01:32:31.650
but back when I learned it

1781
01:32:31.684 --> 01:32:34.053
from your grandfather
years ago.

1782
01:32:34.086 --> 01:32:35.654
even though I was younger.

1783
01:32:35.688 --> 01:32:37.857
healthier.
and stronger than now.

1784
01:32:37.890 --> 01:32:41.160
I found it to be
far more tiring back then.

1785
01:32:41.193 --> 01:32:43.395
[children laugh]

1786
01:32:43.429 --> 01:32:44.730
<i>[sentimental music]</i>

1787
01:32:44.764 --> 01:32:47.500
<i>[Tanjiro] For generations.</i>
<i>the Kagura was performed</i>

1788
01:32:47.533 --> 01:32:50.536
<i>by the Kamado family</i>
<i>at the start of each year.</i>

1789
01:32:50.569 --> 01:32:52.705
<i>It was an exhausting</i>
<i>performance</i>

1790
01:32:52.738 --> 01:32:55.674
<i>that would last</i>
<i>from sunset 'til dawn.</i>

1791
01:32:57.042 --> 01:32:58.477
<i>There are 12 different forms</i>

1792
01:32:58.511 --> 01:33:01.248
<i>that must be repeated</i>
<i>over and over again</i>

1793
01:33:01.280 --> 01:33:04.083
<i>thousands of times</i>
<i>before daybreak.</i>

1794
01:33:04.116 --> 01:33:07.052
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1795
01:33:07.086 --> 01:33:08.387
- I think my exhaustion

1796
01:33:08.420 --> 01:33:11.290
was the result
of unnecessary movement.

1797
01:33:11.323 --> 01:33:14.193
Using the correct movements
and breathing patterns

1798
01:33:14.227 --> 01:33:15.761
are vital to the dance.

1799
01:33:15.795 --> 01:33:19.398
It's what allows you
to produce maximum strength

1800
01:33:19.431 --> 01:33:21.367
while using minimal actions.

1801
01:33:21.400 --> 01:33:24.336
Once you've mastered
your breathing and movement.

1802
01:33:24.370 --> 01:33:27.873
your mind
will become transparent.

1803
01:33:27.907 --> 01:33:30.476
- Transparent?

1804
01:33:30.509 --> 01:33:32.378
- But before any of that.

1805
01:33:32.411 --> 01:33:34.513
you must memorize
the moves of the dance

1806
01:33:34.547 --> 01:33:37.883
and slowly ingrain them
into your muscle memory.

1807
01:33:37.917 --> 01:33:41.453
In doing so. you'll open up
your five senses

1808
01:33:41.487 --> 01:33:44.056
and become aware of the shape
of your own body.

1809
01:33:44.089 --> 01:33:45.891
vessel by vessel.

1810
01:33:47.493 --> 01:33:50.629
That was
the truly strenuous part.

1811
01:33:50.663 --> 01:33:51.931
All you can think is that.

1812
01:33:51.964 --> 01:33:55.668
even if you go on struggling.
you'll never succeed.

1813
01:33:55.701 --> 01:33:58.103
After you've learned
all these things

1814
01:33:58.137 --> 01:33:59.538
and committed them to memory.

1815
01:33:59.572 --> 01:34:02.808
you'll understand how to
remove what you don't need.

1816
01:34:02.842 --> 01:34:06.979
only leaving behind in your
body what is required of you.

1817
01:34:07.012 --> 01:34:09.381
closing off the rest.

1818
01:34:09.415 --> 01:34:11.550
- Closing?

1819
01:34:11.584 --> 01:34:13.719
- You know how people
often close their eyes

1820
01:34:13.752 --> 01:34:16.388
when they're trying
to hear better?

1821
01:34:16.422 --> 01:34:18.023
In that same way.

1822
01:34:18.057 --> 01:34:21.126
you'll pick out the things you
need the most in the movement

1823
01:34:21.160 --> 01:34:23.629
while eliminating the rest.

1824
01:34:23.662 --> 01:34:26.665
Eventually. you'll be
able to open and close

1825
01:34:26.699 --> 01:34:29.068
the vessels and
muscles in your body.

1826
01:34:29.101 --> 01:34:30.769
as if it were second nature.

1827
01:34:30.803 --> 01:34:34.807
the same way you blink
without a second thought.

1828
01:34:34.840 --> 01:34:36.408
When that happens.

1829
01:34:36.442 --> 01:34:41.214
a path illuminated
by a bright light will open.

1830
01:34:41.248 --> 01:34:43.949
If your mind is
as clear as possible.

1831
01:34:43.983 --> 01:34:47.620
you'll begin to see the
Transparent World before you.

1832
01:34:47.653 --> 01:34:49.822
But this domain
can only be reached

1833
01:34:49.855 --> 01:34:51.924
by pushing yourself
past your limits.

1834
01:34:51.957 --> 01:34:54.627
despite the suffering
that may be required.

1835
01:34:54.660 --> 01:34:57.230
- Will I ever get to see it?

1836
01:34:57.264 --> 01:35:02.134
- If you work tirelessly.
then that's for you to decide.

1837
01:35:02.167 --> 01:35:03.168
There.

1838
01:35:03.202 --> 01:35:04.203
All done.

1839
01:35:04.237 --> 01:35:05.604
- Thank you.

1840
01:35:08.974 --> 01:35:11.977
<i>[Tanjiro] Ten days</i>
<i>before my father died.</i>

1841
01:35:12.011 --> 01:35:14.513
<i>an incident where a bear</i>
<i>began attacking people</i>

1842
01:35:14.546 --> 01:35:17.350
<i>happened</i>
<i>on a neighboring mountain.</i>

1843
01:35:17.384 --> 01:35:19.718
<i>We lit bonfires</i>
<i>around the house</i>

1844
01:35:19.752 --> 01:35:22.922
<i>and set up multiple ropes</i>
<i>lined with bells.</i>

1845
01:35:34.700 --> 01:35:35.701
- Hmm?

1846
01:35:41.707 --> 01:35:43.209
Tanjiro?

1847
01:35:43.243 --> 01:35:45.878
- [murmurs]

1848
01:35:47.314 --> 01:35:50.049
Yes. Father?

1849
01:35:50.082 --> 01:35:52.285
- Come with me.

1850
01:35:52.319 --> 01:35:54.920
[Tanjiro panting]

1851
01:36:03.829 --> 01:36:04.830
[yelps]

1852
01:36:04.863 --> 01:36:08.234
[panting]

1853
01:36:08.268 --> 01:36:11.804
<i>[tense music]</i>

1854
01:36:11.837 --> 01:36:19.712
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1855
01:36:22.047 --> 01:36:23.749
[gasps]

1856
01:36:23.782 --> 01:36:26.752
[panting]

1857
01:36:33.092 --> 01:36:36.495
- [grunts]

1858
01:36:39.832 --> 01:36:42.701
- I understand
you must be very hungry.

1859
01:36:42.735 --> 01:36:47.973
but I'm afraid I can't
allow you to come any closer.

1860
01:36:48.007 --> 01:36:51.010
If anyone were to try
and cause harm to my family.

1861
01:36:51.043 --> 01:36:54.214
I would be forced
to show you no mercy.

1862
01:36:54.247 --> 01:36:56.715
If you disregard
this warning...

1863
01:36:58.951 --> 01:37:02.621
I'll have no choice
but to take your life.

1864
01:37:03.423 --> 01:37:04.990
- [roars]

1865
01:37:07.026 --> 01:37:08.127
- [gasps]

1866
01:37:13.766 --> 01:37:17.603
<i>- The bear's head. that was</i>
<i>as thick as a human torso.</i>

1867
01:37:17.636 --> 01:37:21.140
<i>dropped to the ground</i>
<i>with the sound of the bells.</i>

1868
01:37:22.541 --> 01:37:24.743
<i>My eyes couldn't follow it.</i>

1869
01:37:24.777 --> 01:37:26.612
<i>but If I'm not mistaken.</i>

1870
01:37:26.645 --> 01:37:29.982
<i>my father slashed it twice</i>
<i>in the blink of an eye.</i>

1871
01:37:31.583 --> 01:37:32.951
<i>He must have.</i>

1872
01:37:32.985 --> 01:37:34.521
<i>His ax wouldn't</i>
<i>have been able</i>

1873
01:37:34.553 --> 01:37:36.955
<i>to cut through otherwise.</i>

1874
01:37:36.989 --> 01:37:41.160
<i>All the while. my father's</i>
<i>scent never wavered.</i>

1875
01:37:41.193 --> 01:37:43.829
<i>Before and after</i>
<i>beheading the bear.</i>

1876
01:37:43.862 --> 01:37:47.966
<i>he emitted no fear.</i>
<i>no killing intent.</i>

1877
01:37:48.000 --> 01:37:53.972
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1878
01:37:54.006 --> 01:37:57.277
- I hope that you
were watching.

1879
01:37:57.310 --> 01:38:00.480
A day might come where you
have to do the same.

1880
01:38:00.513 --> 01:38:02.948
[earrings clink]

1881
01:38:02.981 --> 01:38:05.485
<i>- My father wasn't</i>
<i>the type of person</i>

1882
01:38:05.518 --> 01:38:07.753
<i>to flaunt his strength.</i>

1883
01:38:07.786 --> 01:38:09.955
<i>I realized later on.</i>

1884
01:38:09.988 --> 01:38:15.094
<i>that night. he wanted me</i>
<i>to see it in action.</i>

1885
01:38:15.127 --> 01:38:17.796
<i>the movements necessary</i>
<i>to be able to see</i>

1886
01:38:17.830 --> 01:38:20.732
<i>the Transparent World</i>
<i>he spoke of.</i>

1887
01:38:22.701 --> 01:38:25.170
<i>I'm sure my father.</i>
<i>grandfather.</i>

1888
01:38:25.204 --> 01:38:29.775
<i>and great-grandfather</i>
<i>all learned the same way.</i>

1889
01:38:31.444 --> 01:38:33.779
- Whatever you do.
never give up.

1890
01:38:33.812 --> 01:38:36.516
Always stay calm and focused.

1891
01:38:36.549 --> 01:38:39.918
Any wall you come up against
can be shattered

1892
01:38:39.952 --> 01:38:42.654
if you just work tirelessly.

1893
01:38:43.556 --> 01:38:45.858
- I understand. Father.

1894
01:38:45.891 --> 01:38:49.061
<i>In that moment.</i>
<i>that's why I was able</i>

1895
01:38:49.094 --> 01:38:52.764
<i>to dodge Akaza's</i>
<i>inescapable blow to my side.</i>

1896
01:38:55.335 --> 01:38:56.969
<i>If I hadn't moved in time.</i>

1897
01:38:57.002 --> 01:39:00.205
<i>I'm positive that strike</i>
<i>would have killed me.</i>

1898
01:39:00.240 --> 01:39:02.975
<i>When I was alternating moves</i>
<i>with Mr. Giyu.</i>

1899
01:39:03.008 --> 01:39:05.378
<i>weaving my attacks</i>
<i>in between each of his...</i>

1900
01:39:05.411 --> 01:39:09.482
<i>I was protected from being</i>
<i>hit by those lethal blows.</i>

1901
01:39:09.516 --> 01:39:11.150
<i>But in that instant.</i>

1902
01:39:11.183 --> 01:39:14.587
<i>even Mr. Giyu</i>
<i>couldn't make it in time.</i>

1903
01:39:14.621 --> 01:39:17.689
<i>However. for whatever reason.</i>

1904
01:39:17.723 --> 01:39:20.593
<i>I knew dodging</i> was <i>possible.</i>

1905
01:39:20.627 --> 01:39:23.396
<i>and for just a split-second.</i>

1906
01:39:23.429 --> 01:39:26.064
<i>I was able to see it...</i>

1907
01:39:26.098 --> 01:39:28.667
<i>that world...</i>

1908
01:39:30.169 --> 01:39:32.372
<i>[singer vocalizing]</i>

1909
01:39:32.405 --> 01:39:34.706
<i>- ...the Transparent World.</i>

1910
01:39:34.740 --> 01:39:37.109
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1911
01:39:37.142 --> 01:39:41.447
<i>Even his body</i>
<i>started to look transparent.</i>

1912
01:39:41.481 --> 01:39:45.851
<i>The same as when Hantengu was</i>
<i>hiding inside his own heart.</i>

1913
01:39:45.884 --> 01:39:49.021
<i>I don't know if I saw him</i>
<i>or smelled him.</i>

1914
01:39:53.058 --> 01:39:54.726
<i>Dodge.</i>

1915
01:39:54.760 --> 01:39:58.231
<i>I used only the senses</i>
<i>that would let me do that.</i>

1916
01:39:58.264 --> 01:39:59.599
<i>Without thinking.</i>

1917
01:39:59.632 --> 01:40:03.236
<i>my body moved faster</i>
<i>than ever before.</i>

1918
01:40:03.269 --> 01:40:04.604
<i>When I'm inside</i>

1919
01:40:04.637 --> 01:40:07.240
<i>the Transparent World</i>
<i>my father spoke of.</i>

1920
01:40:07.273 --> 01:40:10.410
<i>my battle instincts</i>
<i>improve drastically.</i>

1921
01:40:12.478 --> 01:40:14.780
<i>I can see</i>
<i>my opponent's lungs</i>

1922
01:40:14.813 --> 01:40:17.617
<i>and the blood moving</i>
<i>throughout their body.</i>

1923
01:40:17.650 --> 01:40:20.085
<i>I can see</i>
<i>my own muscles contracting</i>

1924
01:40:20.118 --> 01:40:22.988
<i>Faster and</i>
<i>clearer than before.</i>

1925
01:40:26.626 --> 01:40:28.661
<i>If I close off</i>
<i>the fighting spirit</i>

1926
01:40:28.695 --> 01:40:31.029
<i>that Akaza must be</i>
<i>detecting me with.</i>

1927
01:40:31.063 --> 01:40:33.600
<i>I can go for his neck.</i>

1928
01:40:33.633 --> 01:40:35.401
- [roars]

1929
01:40:41.307 --> 01:40:42.275
- [chuckles]

1930
01:40:42.308 --> 01:40:43.476
- [winces]

1931
01:40:46.246 --> 01:40:49.315
<i>See it. See it.</i>

1932
01:40:49.349 --> 01:40:52.017
[exhales]

1933
01:40:52.050 --> 01:40:53.785
- It looks like you've thrown

1934
01:40:53.819 --> 01:40:56.088
about every last
Water Form at me.

1935
01:40:56.121 --> 01:40:59.891
Enough is enough.
wouldn't you say?

1936
01:40:59.925 --> 01:41:01.728
I'm putting an end to this.

1937
01:41:01.760 --> 01:41:04.896
but you have my respect
for lasting so long!

1938
01:41:05.698 --> 01:41:08.066
<i>- What?</i>

1939
01:41:08.100 --> 01:41:10.536
<i>In the middle</i>
<i>of my downswing...</i>

1940
01:41:11.903 --> 01:41:14.139
<i>he hit it from the side...</i>

1941
01:41:15.040 --> 01:41:17.809
<i>and snapped my sword!</i>

1942
01:41:17.843 --> 01:41:19.312
- Goodbye. Giyu.

1943
01:41:19.345 --> 01:41:20.713
- [gags]

1944
01:41:20.747 --> 01:41:24.450
<i>[chorus vocalizes]</i>

1945
01:41:31.658 --> 01:41:34.227
<i>[stirring music]</i>

1946
01:41:34.260 --> 01:41:41.867
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1947
01:41:43.436 --> 01:41:47.039
- [exhales]

1948
01:41:49.375 --> 01:41:52.911
<i>- He stopped the attack</i>
<i>by cutting off his fist.</i>

1949
01:41:52.944 --> 01:41:54.880
<i>His breathing is different</i>

1950
01:41:54.913 --> 01:41:56.549
<i>and his appearance.</i>

1951
01:41:57.617 --> 01:42:00.185
<i>I've been saved by Tanjiro.</i>

1952
01:42:01.587 --> 01:42:03.489
<i>- All of the cells</i>
<i>in my body.</i>

1953
01:42:03.523 --> 01:42:05.090
<i>down to the ones in my hair.</i>

1954
01:42:05.123 --> 01:42:09.961
<i>are screaming at me to kill</i>
<i>him as soon as possible.</i>

1955
01:42:09.995 --> 01:42:13.333
<i>I don't know what kind of</i>
<i>change he underwent. but...</i>

1956
01:42:14.500 --> 01:42:16.235
<i>he's dangerous.</i>

1957
01:42:17.704 --> 01:42:19.572
<i>- His focus is on Tanjiro.</i>

1958
01:42:20.906 --> 01:42:22.575
<i>Now's my chance.</i>

1959
01:42:26.978 --> 01:42:29.682
<i>Technique Development:</i>
<i>Final Form.</i>

1960
01:42:29.716 --> 01:42:32.884
<i>Blue Silver</i>
<i>Chaotic Afterglow!</i>

1961
01:42:35.854 --> 01:42:38.190
<i>- His attack speed</i>
<i>boosted again!</i>

1962
01:42:38.224 --> 01:42:40.626
<i>And the force has increased!</i>

1963
01:42:40.660 --> 01:42:42.395
<i>My only chance now...</i>

1964
01:42:42.428 --> 01:42:44.564
<i>is with Dead Calm.</i>

1965
01:42:44.597 --> 01:42:47.165
<i>[singers vocalize]</i>

1966
01:42:47.199 --> 01:42:53.639
<i>♪ ♪</i>

1967
01:43:06.084 --> 01:43:09.222
<i>- This must be what Father</i>
<i>was talking about.</i>

1968
01:43:09.255 --> 01:43:13.158
<i>This is it.</i>
<i>the Transparent World.</i>

1969
01:43:21.267 --> 01:43:22.968
<i>Strange.</i>

1970
01:43:23.001 --> 01:43:24.737
<i>It feels like...</i>

1971
01:43:24.771 --> 01:43:27.407
<i>time is passing by so slowly.</i>

1972
01:43:29.107 --> 01:43:33.446
<i>Or maybe their movements</i>
<i>just</i> look <i>slower now.</i>

1973
01:43:37.216 --> 01:43:39.117
- [gags]

1974
01:43:39.151 --> 01:43:41.587
<i>[Giyu] It's no use.</i>

1975
01:43:41.621 --> 01:43:44.824
<i>A hundred strikes at once</i>
<i>is unavoidable.</i>

1976
01:43:44.857 --> 01:43:46.492
<i>Even with Dead Calm.</i>

1977
01:43:46.526 --> 01:43:49.928
<i>I still wasn't able</i>
<i>to block all of 'em.</i>

1978
01:43:51.196 --> 01:43:52.899
- Stand proud. Giyu.

1979
01:43:52.931 --> 01:43:55.835
Most wouldn't have
been able to survive that.

1980
01:43:55.868 --> 01:43:58.671
You must have evaded
my fatal blows.

1981
01:43:59.672 --> 01:44:01.207
There's no need for you to die

1982
01:44:01.240 --> 01:44:03.609
like Kyojuro and Tanjiro did.

1983
01:44:03.643 --> 01:44:07.246
Give up your pride
and become a demon. Giyu.

1984
01:44:07.280 --> 01:44:08.180
- [shudders]

1985
01:44:08.214 --> 01:44:10.115
<i>Tanjiro's behind him...</i>

1986
01:44:10.148 --> 01:44:12.318
<i>and he hasn't noticed?</i>

1987
01:44:12.351 --> 01:44:15.020
- Even you can't deny...
<i>- Is he masking his presence?</i>

1988
01:44:15.053 --> 01:44:16.121
<i>Now's our chance.</i>

1989
01:44:16.154 --> 01:44:17.523
- ...to the death.

1990
01:44:17.557 --> 01:44:19.191
<i>- Tanjiro. do it!</i>

1991
01:44:19.225 --> 01:44:22.060
<i>If you have the strength.</i>
<i>behead him!</i>

1992
01:44:22.093 --> 01:44:23.995
<i>Before he notices you!</i>

1993
01:44:24.029 --> 01:44:25.665
<i>Go for it!</i>

1994
01:44:25.698 --> 01:44:26.998
- Akaza!

1995
01:44:27.032 --> 01:44:29.569
Prepare to be decapitated!

1996
01:44:29.602 --> 01:44:30.470
- Huh?

1997
01:44:35.274 --> 01:44:38.544
<i>- He willingly</i>
<i>gave himself away!</i>

1998
01:44:38.578 --> 01:44:40.580
<i>- He's still alive?</i>

1999
01:44:40.613 --> 01:44:42.482
<i>I never would have</i>
<i>thought someone like him</i>

2000
01:44:42.515 --> 01:44:44.917
<i>could survive</i>
<i>an attack like that.</i>

2001
01:44:44.951 --> 01:44:47.920
<i>Well. it doesn't matter.</i>
<i>After all.</i>

2002
01:44:47.954 --> 01:44:49.655
<i>my Destructive Death:</i>
<i>Compass Needle</i>

2003
01:44:49.689 --> 01:44:51.624
<i>can detect any attack.</i>

2004
01:44:51.657 --> 01:44:54.927
<i>The stronger my opponent's</i>
<i>fighting spirit is.</i>

2005
01:44:54.961 --> 01:44:57.897
<i>the greater</i>
<i>my Compass Needle's reaction.</i>

2006
01:44:57.930 --> 01:44:59.599
<i>[stirring music]</i>

2007
01:44:59.632 --> 01:45:00.700
[shudders]

2008
01:45:00.733 --> 01:45:03.302
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

2009
01:45:03.336 --> 01:45:06.071
<i>What is this odd presence</i>
<i>he's emitting?</i>

2010
01:45:06.104 --> 01:45:07.940
<i>It feels like</i>
<i>he's turned himself</i>

2011
01:45:07.974 --> 01:45:11.244
<i>into some other creature.</i>
<i>It's like...</i>

2012
01:45:12.812 --> 01:45:15.414
<i>His fighting spirit is gone.</i>

2013
01:45:15.448 --> 01:45:16.181
<i>But how?</i>

2014
01:45:16.215 --> 01:45:19.785
<i>I have to calm down. Focus!</i>

2015
01:45:19.819 --> 01:45:21.888
[gasps]

2016
01:45:21.921 --> 01:45:25.691
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2017
01:45:25.725 --> 01:45:27.894
<i>- Hinokami Kagura</i>

2018
01:45:27.927 --> 01:45:30.496
<i>Setting Sun Transformation.</i>

2019
01:45:30.530 --> 01:45:32.732
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2020
01:45:32.765 --> 01:45:35.334
<i>[singer vocalizing]</i>

2021
01:45:35.368 --> 01:45:41.774
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2022
01:45:48.548 --> 01:45:50.249
- [gasps]

2023
01:45:51.884 --> 01:45:54.520
<i>- This can't be possible.</i>

2024
01:45:57.088 --> 01:46:00.860
- [exhales]

2025
01:46:00.893 --> 01:46:03.596
<i>- In the last</i>
<i>several hundred years.</i>

2026
01:46:03.629 --> 01:46:07.667
<i>I've never once seen a human</i>
<i>without any fighting spirit.</i>

2027
01:46:07.700 --> 01:46:11.304
<i>Even newborn children</i>
<i>had traces of it.</i>

2028
01:46:11.337 --> 01:46:15.708
<i>And yet. in that instant.</i>
<i>his fighting spirit vanished</i>

2029
01:46:15.741 --> 01:46:18.377
<i>as if it were never there</i>
<i>to begin with.</i>

2030
01:46:21.914 --> 01:46:23.249
<i>It's as if I was facing</i>

2031
01:46:23.282 --> 01:46:25.585
<i>an anomaly</i>
<i>that shouldn't even exist.</i>

2032
01:46:25.618 --> 01:46:29.055
<i>so my senses were thrown</i>
<i>into confusion.</i>

2033
01:46:29.087 --> 01:46:32.658
<i>My Compass Needle</i>
<i>detected nothing.</i>

2034
01:46:32.692 --> 01:46:33.759
[shards clinking]

2035
01:46:33.793 --> 01:46:37.296
<i>But that's not the biggest</i>
<i>issue at hand here.</i>

2036
01:46:37.330 --> 01:46:39.097
<i>When on the battlefield.</i>

2037
01:46:39.130 --> 01:46:41.567
<i>there's no telling</i>
<i>what could come your way.</i>

2038
01:46:41.601 --> 01:46:44.202
<i>It's vital that you're able</i>
<i>to deal with the unexpected</i>

2039
01:46:44.236 --> 01:46:46.305
<i>at a moment's notice.</i>

2040
01:46:46.339 --> 01:46:48.441
<i>And I'm able to do that!</i>

2041
01:46:49.342 --> 01:46:52.244
<i>Or at least. I thought so.</i>

2042
01:46:53.111 --> 01:46:55.915
<i>But during that short battle.</i>

2043
01:46:55.948 --> 01:46:57.850
<i>he was able</i>
<i>to grasp something</i>

2044
01:46:57.883 --> 01:47:01.020
<i>and use it surpass my speed.</i>

2045
01:47:01.053 --> 01:47:02.187
<i>Whatever it was he learned</i>

2046
01:47:02.221 --> 01:47:03.756
<i>was able to shatter</i>
<i>centuries worth</i>

2047
01:47:03.789 --> 01:47:07.693
<i>of martial arts techniques</i>
<i>with a single head-on attack.</i>

2048
01:47:08.494 --> 01:47:10.096
<i>Within those eyes of his.</i>

2049
01:47:10.128 --> 01:47:12.431
<i>there was no hatred.</i>
<i>no rage.</i>

2050
01:47:12.465 --> 01:47:16.268
<i>no killing intent.</i>
<i>or fighting spirit.</i>

2051
01:47:16.302 --> 01:47:19.238
<i>He must have somehow seen</i>
<i>what I've been looking for.</i>

2052
01:47:19.271 --> 01:47:21.507
<i>the domain that lies within.</i>

2053
01:47:21.540 --> 01:47:23.542
<i>the realm of the highest...</i>

2054
01:47:25.311 --> 01:47:27.880
<i>none other</i>
<i>than the selfless state.</i>

2055
01:47:30.148 --> 01:47:32.318
<i>For some time now.</i>
<i>I've had a vague sense</i>

2056
01:47:32.351 --> 01:47:35.254
<i>that this state</i>
<i>of mind existed.</i>

2057
01:47:35.287 --> 01:47:37.823
<i>and yet. even after</i>
<i>all these centuries.</i>

2058
01:47:37.857 --> 01:47:39.659
<i>I've yet to attain it.</i>

2059
01:47:47.165 --> 01:47:48.834
- [gasps]

2060
01:47:48.868 --> 01:47:50.603
<i>- Not yet!</i>

2061
01:47:50.636 --> 01:47:52.304
<i>I can still fight!</i>

2062
01:47:52.338 --> 01:47:55.241
<i>I will continue</i>
<i>to become stronger!</i>

2063
01:47:55.274 --> 01:47:57.743
<i>[ominous music]</i>

2064
01:47:57.777 --> 01:48:01.113
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2065
01:48:01.147 --> 01:48:04.717
<i>- This is bad.</i>
<i>He's reattaching his head!</i>

2066
01:48:04.750 --> 01:48:07.520
- [grunting]

2067
01:48:09.121 --> 01:48:11.724
[gasps]

2068
01:48:13.292 --> 01:48:15.594
<i>I can't die here.</i>

2069
01:48:17.163 --> 01:48:18.864
<i>Not like this!</i>

2070
01:48:21.834 --> 01:48:24.704
<i>I have to become stronger.</i>

2071
01:48:24.737 --> 01:48:26.639
<i>[gentle music]</i>

2072
01:48:26.672 --> 01:48:30.109
<i>Stronger than anyone else</i>
<i>in the whole world!</i>

2073
01:48:30.142 --> 01:48:32.511
<i>Stronger!</i>

2074
01:48:34.213 --> 01:48:37.550
<i>I have to find a way</i>
<i>to become stronger.</i>

2075
01:48:44.890 --> 01:48:45.891
[thud echoes]

2076
01:48:46.892 --> 01:48:48.094
<i>[Tanjiro] That's it.</i>

2077
01:48:48.127 --> 01:48:49.729
<i>It's over.</i>

2078
01:48:51.597 --> 01:48:52.798
<i>We won!</i>

2079
01:48:53.899 --> 01:48:55.701
[sighs]

2080
01:48:55.735 --> 01:48:57.269
[winces]

2081
01:48:57.303 --> 01:48:59.705
So lightheaded.

2082
01:48:59.739 --> 01:49:01.273
[shudders]

2083
01:49:01.307 --> 01:49:03.375
<i>My muscles are cramping up.</i>

2084
01:49:03.409 --> 01:49:05.845
<i>My body's reached its limit.</i>

2085
01:49:08.414 --> 01:49:09.949
- Tanjiro! Are you all ri--

2086
01:49:09.982 --> 01:49:11.050
[gasps]

2087
01:49:11.083 --> 01:49:14.553
<i>His body hasn't</i>
<i>disintegrated yet.</i>

2088
01:49:14.587 --> 01:49:17.823
<i>Does-- Does this mean...</i>

2089
01:49:17.857 --> 01:49:18.924
Tan--

2090
01:49:21.228 --> 01:49:22.394
- [winces]

2091
01:49:29.769 --> 01:49:32.772
<i>- He's moving.</i>
<i>His body is still intact!</i>

2092
01:49:32.805 --> 01:49:35.341
<i>The severed part</i>
<i>is closing up!</i>

2093
01:49:36.609 --> 01:49:38.310
[gasping]

2094
01:49:38.344 --> 01:49:40.446
<i>I can't see straight.</i>

2095
01:49:45.218 --> 01:49:46.352
[groans]

2096
01:49:51.724 --> 01:49:52.892
[gasping]

2097
01:49:52.925 --> 01:49:55.628
<i>No-- No way!</i>

2098
01:49:55.661 --> 01:49:58.097
<i>Slashing his neck</i>
<i>didn't kill him!</i>

2099
01:49:58.130 --> 01:49:59.899
<i>Is there some kind</i>
<i>of condition.</i>

2100
01:49:59.932 --> 01:50:02.101
<i>like with Gyutaro and Daki?</i>

2101
01:50:02.134 --> 01:50:03.102
<i>That can't be it.</i>

2102
01:50:03.135 --> 01:50:05.404
<i>His head disintegrated.</i>

2103
01:50:05.437 --> 01:50:07.506
<i>yet he hasn't given up!</i>

2104
01:50:07.540 --> 01:50:10.843
<i>Its like</i>
<i>he's trying to evolve!</i>

2105
01:50:13.045 --> 01:50:14.647
- [groans]

2106
01:50:17.149 --> 01:50:18.517
<i>- If we don't do something.</i>

2107
01:50:18.551 --> 01:50:21.353
<i>his head will stop being</i>
<i>his weak point. like Muzan!</i>

2108
01:50:22.255 --> 01:50:24.190
This battle isn't over yet.

2109
01:50:24.224 --> 01:50:25.691
I have to...

2110
01:50:25.724 --> 01:50:27.026
fight.

2111
01:50:27.059 --> 01:50:28.160
- Tanjiro!

2112
01:50:28.194 --> 01:50:29.929
He's fainted.

2113
01:50:29.962 --> 01:50:31.363
Of course he has!

2114
01:50:31.397 --> 01:50:33.966
He's long since
passed his limit.

2115
01:50:38.904 --> 01:50:40.573
[winces]

2116
01:50:43.542 --> 01:50:45.044
<i>Water Breathing...</i>

2117
01:50:45.077 --> 01:50:46.946
Fourth Form...

2118
01:50:46.979 --> 01:50:49.282
<i>[majestic music]</i>

2119
01:50:49.316 --> 01:50:51.016
Striking Tide!

2120
01:50:55.821 --> 01:50:57.423
<i>Ridiculous!</i>

2121
01:50:57.456 --> 01:50:58.591
<i>He lost his head</i>

2122
01:50:58.624 --> 01:51:01.460
<i>and can still</i>
<i>regenerate that quickly?!</i>

2123
01:51:01.493 --> 01:51:04.864
[sword striking]

2124
01:51:13.639 --> 01:51:16.609
[yells]

2125
01:51:20.746 --> 01:51:23.415
[coughs]

2126
01:51:23.449 --> 01:51:25.117
[panting]

2127
01:51:25.150 --> 01:51:27.386
<i>I can't hear</i>
<i>out of my left ear.</i>

2128
01:51:27.419 --> 01:51:29.989
<i>and my right hand</i>
<i>has gone numb.</i>

2129
01:51:30.022 --> 01:51:34.827
<i>I can still grip my sword.</i>
<i>but who knows for how long?</i>

2130
01:51:43.402 --> 01:51:44.904
Wait!

2131
01:51:44.937 --> 01:51:48.741
I-I'm here.

2132
01:51:48.774 --> 01:51:50.709
I'm still alive!

2133
01:51:50.743 --> 01:51:52.811
If you want to kill Tanjiro.

2134
01:51:52.845 --> 01:51:55.481
you'll have
to defeat me first!

2135
01:51:59.219 --> 01:52:01.654
<i>[Akaza]</i>
<i>An indomitable spirit.</i>

2136
01:52:01.687 --> 01:52:02.955
<i>It will never bend.</i>

2137
01:52:02.988 --> 01:52:06.293
<i>no matter what crisis</i>
<i>it finds itself in.</i>

2138
01:52:06.326 --> 01:52:09.662
<i>We don't fight</i>
<i>the way samurai do.</i>

2139
01:52:09.695 --> 01:52:11.830
<i>We don't carry weapons.</i>

2140
01:52:11.864 --> 01:52:15.000
<i>Though we carry</i>
<i>our convictions like swords.</i>

2141
01:52:16.435 --> 01:52:20.506
- Though we carry
our convictions like swords.

2142
01:52:20.539 --> 01:52:25.110
our battles
are waged with our fists.

2143
01:52:26.111 --> 01:52:29.148
<i>- You are such an eyesore.</i>

2144
01:52:31.850 --> 01:52:34.820
[hands grasp]

2145
01:52:38.557 --> 01:52:39.658
[drop echoes]

2146
01:52:39.692 --> 01:52:41.160
[woman] Please stop.

2147
01:52:47.466 --> 01:52:49.001
<i>[Akaza] Who is that?</i>

2148
01:52:54.106 --> 01:52:56.343
- Mr. Hakuji...

2149
01:52:56.376 --> 01:52:58.077
please. that's enough.

2150
01:52:58.110 --> 01:53:01.146
<i>[sentimental music]</i>

2151
01:53:01.180 --> 01:53:03.148
<i>- Let go.</i>

2152
01:53:03.182 --> 01:53:05.285
<i>Let go of my hand.</i>

2153
01:53:05.318 --> 01:53:07.553
<i>Just who are you?</i>

2154
01:53:09.021 --> 01:53:11.523
- Stop.
You don't have to keep going.

2155
01:53:11.557 --> 01:53:14.626
[cries] Let's leave
this place together

2156
01:53:15.428 --> 01:53:17.029
<i>- I can't.</i>

2157
01:53:17.062 --> 01:53:20.766
<i>I've still got unfinished</i>
<i>business with those two.</i>

2158
01:53:22.134 --> 01:53:24.603
- What do you mean by that?

2159
01:53:24.636 --> 01:53:26.872
<i>- I've got</i>
<i>to become stronger.</i>

2160
01:53:26.905 --> 01:53:28.475
<i>I've got to.</i>

2161
01:53:28.507 --> 01:53:31.844
<i>I'll kill anyone</i>
<i>who gets in my way.</i>

2162
01:53:32.644 --> 01:53:34.214
- Why do you want that?

2163
01:53:34.247 --> 01:53:35.415
[sniffles]

2164
01:53:35.448 --> 01:53:38.951
For what reason do you
need to become stronger?

2165
01:53:39.985 --> 01:53:41.388
<i>- Because...</i>

2166
01:53:41.421 --> 01:53:43.956
<i>unless I'm strong enough.</i>

2167
01:53:43.989 --> 01:53:47.260
<i>I won't be able to bring</i>
<i>any more back home to him.</i>

2168
01:53:49.429 --> 01:53:51.797
<i>He needs medicine.</i>

2169
01:53:54.099 --> 01:53:56.602
<i>I must become stronger.</i>

2170
01:53:57.504 --> 01:53:58.670
[growls]

2171
01:53:58.704 --> 01:54:01.173
<i>If I don't.</i>
<i>I won't be able to get away</i>

2172
01:54:01.206 --> 01:54:02.409
<i>with the money I stole.</i>

2173
01:54:02.442 --> 01:54:03.675
[groans]

2174
01:54:03.709 --> 01:54:05.577
<i>If I happen to be caught.</i>

2175
01:54:05.611 --> 01:54:08.415
<i>I won't be able</i>
<i>to defend myself.</i>

2176
01:54:08.448 --> 01:54:11.217
<i>If I'm not strong enough.</i>

2177
01:54:11.251 --> 01:54:12.651
<i>the magistrate</i>
<i>will catch me</i>

2178
01:54:12.684 --> 01:54:15.288
<i>and have me</i>
<i>beaten and lashed.</i>

2179
01:54:18.258 --> 01:54:19.526
- We've already given you

2180
01:54:19.558 --> 01:54:22.661
three tattoos on each arm
for stealing.

2181
01:54:22.694 --> 01:54:25.398
Next time.
we'll chop off your hand.

2182
01:54:25.432 --> 01:54:28.033
- [laughing]

2183
01:54:33.273 --> 01:54:35.007
- Bow your head and repent!

2184
01:54:35.040 --> 01:54:37.343
- If you're gonna chop it off.
then do it!

2185
01:54:37.377 --> 01:54:40.547
Go ahead and take both of 'em
if you're really serious.

2186
01:54:40.579 --> 01:54:42.748
I'll just
use my feet to steal!

2187
01:54:42.781 --> 01:54:44.317
You're not gonna
catch me again.

2188
01:54:44.350 --> 01:54:46.286
so make it count! [spits]

2189
01:54:48.120 --> 01:54:51.657
- To hear this from someone
at such a young age.

2190
01:54:51.690 --> 01:54:54.360
This boy of 11 has
already taken on punishments

2191
01:54:54.394 --> 01:54:57.297
that would make
a grown man faint.

2192
01:54:58.298 --> 01:54:59.965
You are a demon child!

2193
01:54:59.998 --> 01:55:02.134
- Go and call me
whatever names you want!

2194
01:55:02.167 --> 01:55:04.703
"Demon child"
suits me just damn fine!

2195
01:55:04.736 --> 01:55:07.172
They say I already
had teeth when I was born.

2196
01:55:07.206 --> 01:55:08.341
so I guess I am!

2197
01:55:08.374 --> 01:55:09.309
- Be quiet!

2198
01:55:09.342 --> 01:55:10.543
- Dirty little punk!

2199
01:55:10.577 --> 01:55:13.812
- Don't you mean
"Demon Child." you bastard?!

2200
01:55:13.846 --> 01:55:15.381
[winces]

2201
01:55:17.350 --> 01:55:18.717
Hmph.

2202
01:55:22.121 --> 01:55:23.188
[birds squawking]

2203
01:55:23.223 --> 01:55:24.524
- Hakuji!

2204
01:55:24.557 --> 01:55:26.625
Ah! There you are!

2205
01:55:26.658 --> 01:55:28.927
When you were caught
for stealing again.

2206
01:55:28.961 --> 01:55:32.831
word about it made
its way back to your father.

2207
01:55:32.865 --> 01:55:35.468
He hung himself. Hakuji!

2208
01:55:35.502 --> 01:55:36.869
- Huh?

2209
01:55:40.306 --> 01:55:43.510
<i>[father] Dear Hakuji.</i>

2210
01:55:43.543 --> 01:55:45.844
<i>Live an honest life.</i>

2211
01:55:45.878 --> 01:55:48.281
<i>You can still start over.</i>

2212
01:55:49.315 --> 01:55:51.917
[wind blowing]

2213
01:55:55.654 --> 01:55:57.956
<i>[Hakuji] What kind</i>
<i>of world is this?</i>

2214
01:55:57.990 --> 01:56:00.759
<i>Are the poor</i>
<i>not even allowed to live?</i>

2215
01:56:00.792 --> 01:56:03.162
<i>[somber music]</i>

2216
01:56:03.195 --> 01:56:06.031
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2217
01:56:06.064 --> 01:56:07.132
<i>Dad.</i>

2218
01:56:09.402 --> 01:56:11.471
<i>To hell with</i>
<i>this rotten world.</i>

2219
01:56:11.504 --> 01:56:12.572
<i>to all of it!</i>

2220
01:56:12.605 --> 01:56:15.107
[crying]

2221
01:56:15.941 --> 01:56:18.378
<i>Every rotten human.</i>

2222
01:56:18.411 --> 01:56:20.346
<i>they can all burn in hell!</i>

2223
01:56:20.380 --> 01:56:24.183
[screams]

2224
01:56:24.217 --> 01:56:27.320
<i>Why do scumbags like them</i>
<i>get the privilege of living</i>

2225
01:56:27.353 --> 01:56:30.822
<i>when my father had to die</i>
<i>in such a horrible way?</i>

2226
01:56:30.856 --> 01:56:32.958
<i>He was never a burden to me.</i>

2227
01:56:32.991 --> 01:56:35.827
<i>so why would he</i>
<i>feel that way?</i>

2228
01:56:35.861 --> 01:56:38.163
<i>You didn't</i>
<i>do anything wrong. Dad!</i>

2229
01:56:38.197 --> 01:56:39.131
<i>You didn't!</i>

2230
01:56:41.568 --> 01:56:43.369
<i>I never cared</i>
<i>about getting beaten</i>

2231
01:56:43.403 --> 01:56:45.804
<i>after I was caught stealing.</i>

2232
01:56:45.837 --> 01:56:46.972
<i>Even if they beat me</i>

2233
01:56:47.005 --> 01:56:49.442
<i>until every bone</i>
<i>in my body was broken.</i>

2234
01:56:49.475 --> 01:56:53.178
<i>I could take it all for you.</i>
<i>Dad! For centuries. even!</i>

2235
01:56:53.213 --> 01:56:54.414
- Learn your lesson!

2236
01:56:54.447 --> 01:56:55.682
Live an honest life!

2237
01:56:55.714 --> 01:56:56.949
- [grumbles]

2238
01:56:56.982 --> 01:56:59.619
<i>Why don't you shut</i>
<i>the hell up. you scumbag?</i>

2239
01:56:59.652 --> 01:57:01.688
<i>Medicine's expensive.</i>

2240
01:57:01.720 --> 01:57:04.457
<i>The hell do you expect me</i>
<i>to do about that?</i>

2241
01:57:04.490 --> 01:57:09.861
<i>My Dad's only getting thinner</i>
<i>and thinner by the day.</i>

2242
01:57:09.895 --> 01:57:13.999
<i>He's so malnourished.</i>
<i>you can see his bones.</i>

2243
01:57:14.032 --> 01:57:17.470
<i>I just want him to have</i>
<i>something better to eat.</i>

2244
01:57:19.771 --> 01:57:22.408
<i>I would have</i>
<i>happily given my life...</i>

2245
01:57:24.344 --> 01:57:26.512
<i>if it meant saving his.</i>

2246
01:57:32.751 --> 01:57:34.654
<i>I'd have done anything...</i>

2247
01:57:34.687 --> 01:57:36.822
<i>for my father!</i>

2248
01:57:39.592 --> 01:57:41.694
[panting]

2249
01:57:41.728 --> 01:57:43.929
[clapping]

2250
01:57:43.962 --> 01:57:44.697
Huh?

2251
01:57:44.731 --> 01:57:46.266
- Well. well.

2252
01:57:46.299 --> 01:57:48.033
I am quite impressed.

2253
01:57:48.066 --> 01:57:50.068
I was called over
because someone said

2254
01:57:50.102 --> 01:57:51.970
that a child
was about to be killed.

2255
01:57:52.004 --> 01:57:55.575
but you've laid out seven
grownups with your bare fists.

2256
01:57:55.608 --> 01:57:58.043
You've got some talent.
don't ya?

2257
01:57:58.076 --> 01:58:01.648
Not just anyone can take on
that many guys and still win.

2258
01:58:01.681 --> 01:58:04.350
That's the kind of spunk
I like to see.

2259
01:58:06.586 --> 01:58:08.755
<i>- What's going on here?</i>

2260
01:58:08.787 --> 01:58:11.089
<i>Who is this man?</i>

2261
01:58:11.123 --> 01:58:14.026
<i>Could these be my memories?</i>

2262
01:58:14.059 --> 01:58:16.128
- How 'bout you join my dojo?

2263
01:58:16.161 --> 01:58:18.830
I don't have any students
at the moment.

2264
01:58:18.864 --> 01:58:20.767
- Stay out of my way.
you old fart!

2265
01:58:20.799 --> 01:58:22.134
You lookin' to die?!

2266
01:58:22.167 --> 01:58:24.437
- Those tattoos...
- [sputters]

2267
01:58:24.470 --> 01:58:26.239
- you're a criminal from Edo.

2268
01:58:26.272 --> 01:58:28.574
I'm guessing.
after being thrown out.

2269
01:58:28.608 --> 01:58:31.076
you eventually
found your way here.

2270
01:58:31.109 --> 01:58:33.078
I never asked
for your opinion.

2271
01:58:33.111 --> 01:58:35.782
Now shut up and
get the hell out of my way!

2272
01:58:35.814 --> 01:58:36.882
- Hmph!

2273
01:58:36.915 --> 01:58:39.452
All right. Time to be reborn!

2274
01:58:40.453 --> 01:58:41.953
You ready?

2275
01:58:42.789 --> 01:58:43.756
- That's it.

2276
01:58:43.790 --> 01:58:46.292
Drop dead. old man!

2277
01:58:47.727 --> 01:58:49.094
[gags]

2278
01:58:52.398 --> 01:58:53.832
[gags]

2279
01:58:57.337 --> 01:58:59.706
[coughs]

2280
01:58:59.739 --> 01:59:01.541
[thud]

2281
01:59:04.744 --> 01:59:06.078
[birds chirping]

2282
01:59:06.111 --> 01:59:09.014
- I'll give it to ya.
You're tough!

2283
01:59:09.047 --> 01:59:10.849
After that beating
I gave you.

2284
01:59:10.882 --> 01:59:13.018
you came to
in less than an hour.

2285
01:59:13.919 --> 01:59:15.822
The name's Keizo.

2286
01:59:15.854 --> 01:59:17.856
I teach the Soryu Style
of fighting.

2287
01:59:17.889 --> 01:59:20.326
which uses
only your bare hands.

2288
01:59:20.360 --> 01:59:24.029
Like I said. I don't have
any other students.

2289
01:59:24.062 --> 01:59:27.899
so I get by by doing whatever
odd jobs I can for people.

2290
01:59:30.370 --> 01:59:33.105
I have a daughter
who's in rather poor health.

2291
01:59:33.138 --> 01:59:35.941
I'd like you
to help look after her.

2292
01:59:35.974 --> 01:59:39.911
I'd be here if I could.
but I have to work.

2293
01:59:39.945 --> 01:59:42.782
My wife was pushed
to the edge of exhaustion

2294
01:59:42.815 --> 01:59:45.251
and drowned herself.

2295
01:59:45.284 --> 01:59:48.019
Life sure takes a bite
out of you. doesn't it?

2296
01:59:49.522 --> 01:59:50.956
- [groans]

2297
01:59:51.957 --> 01:59:53.992
- If I were
a more capable man.

2298
01:59:54.025 --> 01:59:56.895
my wife and daughter wouldn't
have suffered like this.

2299
01:59:59.931 --> 02:00:02.000
- You said
you knew I was a criminal.

2300
02:00:02.033 --> 02:00:03.168
Are you really all right

2301
02:00:03.201 --> 02:00:05.438
leaving your daughter
around me?

2302
02:00:06.472 --> 02:00:08.274
- Why wouldn't I be?

2303
02:00:08.307 --> 02:00:11.444
I pummeled the criminal
out of you earlier. didn't I?

2304
02:00:11.477 --> 02:00:12.745
It's fine.

2305
02:00:12.779 --> 02:00:15.448
- [stammers]

2306
02:00:15.481 --> 02:00:17.550
<i>They</i> are <i>alike.</i>

2307
02:00:17.583 --> 02:00:19.951
<i>[sentimental music]</i>

2308
02:00:19.985 --> 02:00:25.324
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2309
02:00:25.358 --> 02:00:27.092
<i>I get it now.</i>

2310
02:00:28.059 --> 02:00:31.196
<i>The reason</i>
<i>you disgusted me earlier.</i>

2311
02:00:31.230 --> 02:00:33.299
<i>it was because</i>
<i>you went and dredged up</i>

2312
02:00:33.332 --> 02:00:36.134
<i>memories of</i>
<i>my worthless past.</i>

2313
02:00:39.739 --> 02:00:41.039
- [murmurs]

2314
02:00:41.072 --> 02:00:43.643
- This is my daughter. Koyuki.

2315
02:00:43.676 --> 02:00:45.578
- [coughs]

2316
02:00:46.579 --> 02:00:49.014
<i>- My worthless past.</i>

2317
02:00:51.983 --> 02:00:53.619
<i>Worthless.</i>

2318
02:00:57.723 --> 02:01:00.426
- [coughs]

2319
02:01:02.728 --> 02:01:03.995
Hakuji...

2320
02:01:04.029 --> 02:01:06.933
I'm so sorry.

2321
02:01:06.998 --> 02:01:09.268
- [chuckles]
How are you feeling?

2322
02:01:09.302 --> 02:01:11.102
- [coughs]

2323
02:01:11.136 --> 02:01:13.473
- You okay being up?

2324
02:01:13.506 --> 02:01:15.708
- Mm.

2325
02:01:15.741 --> 02:01:16.843
- Looks like you've got

2326
02:01:16.876 --> 02:01:18.945
more color in your cheeks
this morning.

2327
02:01:18.977 --> 02:01:20.979
[chuckles] That's good.

2328
02:01:21.012 --> 02:01:23.216
- [sighs]

2329
02:01:23.249 --> 02:01:24.015
Huh?

2330
02:01:24.049 --> 02:01:26.486
- Oh. yeah! This boy.

2331
02:01:26.519 --> 02:01:27.954
His name is...

2332
02:01:27.986 --> 02:01:30.690
[chuckles] Well. I've
asked him countless times.

2333
02:01:30.723 --> 02:01:31.824
and he won't say.

2334
02:01:31.858 --> 02:01:33.926
Go on! Get inside.

2335
02:01:33.960 --> 02:01:35.695
- [grumbles]

2336
02:01:35.728 --> 02:01:37.430
- Have a seat.

2337
02:01:37.463 --> 02:01:38.498
- [murmurs]

2338
02:01:38.531 --> 02:01:41.634
- I'll wanna know his name
when I get back. okay?

2339
02:01:45.671 --> 02:01:47.340
[Hakuji sighs]

2340
02:01:47.373 --> 02:01:49.542
- [sighs]

2341
02:01:49.575 --> 02:01:50.643
Mm.

2342
02:01:51.878 --> 02:01:52.912
Hmm?

2343
02:01:52.945 --> 02:01:54.480
U-Um...

2344
02:01:54.514 --> 02:01:58.518
Your-- Your face.

2345
02:01:58.551 --> 02:02:00.185
You're hurt.

2346
02:02:00.219 --> 02:02:02.153
Are you all right?

2347
02:02:03.523 --> 02:02:05.358
<i>[somber music]</i>

2348
02:02:05.391 --> 02:02:07.393
<i>[Akaza]</i>
<i>"I'll make you better."</i>

2349
02:02:07.426 --> 02:02:11.162
<i>"I'll save you.</i>
<i>protect you."</i>

2350
02:02:11.196 --> 02:02:16.235
<i>In that past life. all I did</i>
<i>was spew a bunch of lies.</i>

2351
02:02:16.269 --> 02:02:18.169
<i>I was so pathetic.</i>

2352
02:02:19.839 --> 02:02:22.441
[birds chirping]

2353
02:02:27.547 --> 02:02:30.148
- [coughing]

2354
02:02:32.518 --> 02:02:34.387
[sighs]

2355
02:02:34.420 --> 02:02:36.389
Oh. thank you.

2356
02:02:37.623 --> 02:02:40.593
- You don't have to thank me
every time. you know.

2357
02:02:40.626 --> 02:02:42.428
Just focus on resting.

2358
02:02:43.996 --> 02:02:45.464
- I'm sorry...

2359
02:02:45.498 --> 02:02:47.934
for causing you trouble
like this.

2360
02:02:47.967 --> 02:02:50.201
- It's fine. really.

2361
02:02:51.837 --> 02:02:55.007
Koyuki. want this closed?

2362
02:02:55.041 --> 02:02:56.842
- [murmurs]

2363
02:02:56.876 --> 02:02:59.077
You can leave it open.

2364
02:03:00.846 --> 02:03:03.683
<i>[Hakuji] Koyuki was</i>
<i>very delicate and frail.</i>

2365
02:03:05.051 --> 02:03:07.520
<i>I would change out</i>
<i>her towels and nightgown</i>

2366
02:03:07.553 --> 02:03:11.122
<i>and give her water.</i>
<i>even throughout the night.</i>

2367
02:03:11.156 --> 02:03:13.859
<i>And whenever she needed</i>
<i>to use the lavatory.</i>

2368
02:03:13.893 --> 02:03:15.361
<i>obviously she was too weak</i>

2369
02:03:15.394 --> 02:03:18.129
<i>to be able to go</i>
<i>without needing assistance.</i>

2370
02:03:21.801 --> 02:03:25.304
<i>I was used to taking care of</i>
<i>the sick because of my dad.</i>

2371
02:03:25.338 --> 02:03:28.975
<i>and since I had an almost</i>
<i>inhuman physical endurance.</i>

2372
02:03:29.008 --> 02:03:31.277
<i>it really wasn't</i>
<i>a big deal for me.</i>

2373
02:03:34.145 --> 02:03:36.114
- [sighs]

2374
02:03:36.147 --> 02:03:38.684
Sorry to make you
help me all day.

2375
02:03:45.190 --> 02:03:48.094
<i>- Why do people who are</i>
<i>suffering from illness</i>

2376
02:03:48.126 --> 02:03:51.530
<i>always feel the need</i>
<i>to say they're sorry?</i>

2377
02:03:51.564 --> 02:03:54.033
<i>"Sorry to make you</i>
<i>do things for me."</i>

2378
02:03:54.066 --> 02:03:57.470
<i>"Sorry if my coughing's</i>
<i>bothering you."</i>

2379
02:03:57.503 --> 02:04:00.706
<i>"Sorry I can't put food</i>
<i>on the table like I should."</i>

2380
02:04:02.441 --> 02:04:05.678
<i>They didn't choose</i>
<i>to have to live this way.</i>

2381
02:04:05.711 --> 02:04:08.114
<i>'Course they</i>
<i>wanna breathe normally.</i>

2382
02:04:08.146 --> 02:04:11.517
<i>They can't help it</i>
<i>if they start coughing.</i>

2383
02:04:11.550 --> 02:04:15.554
<i>Out of everyone. they're</i>
<i>the ones suffering the most.</i>

2384
02:04:18.357 --> 02:04:21.192
- Sorry again
to make you do this.

2385
02:04:21.227 --> 02:04:23.262
Because of my sickness

2386
02:04:23.295 --> 02:04:25.898
you're not able
to do your training

2387
02:04:25.931 --> 02:04:28.401
or even go out and have fun.

2388
02:04:28.434 --> 02:04:30.970
- I don't care
about having fun.

2389
02:04:31.003 --> 02:04:33.105
I never have.

2390
02:04:33.139 --> 02:04:34.707
Far as training goes.

2391
02:04:34.740 --> 02:04:37.743
I squeeze it in
whenever I can. so it's fine.

2392
02:04:38.744 --> 02:04:40.579
- You sure?

2393
02:04:40.613 --> 02:04:44.617
Even you need to take
a little break.

2394
02:04:44.650 --> 02:04:48.220
I hear there are fireworks
happening tonight.

2395
02:04:48.254 --> 02:04:50.623
You should go see them.

2396
02:04:51.624 --> 02:04:53.392
- Fireworks. huh?

2397
02:04:53.426 --> 02:04:55.628
If you don't feel
nauseous at night.

2398
02:04:55.661 --> 02:04:59.432
I could carry you on my back
and go see them on the bridge.

2399
02:04:59.465 --> 02:05:00.566
- Huh?

2400
02:05:04.136 --> 02:05:05.905
- If you're
not feeling up to it.

2401
02:05:05.938 --> 02:05:09.175
they'll do fireworks again
next year and after that.

2402
02:05:09.208 --> 02:05:11.577
so we can just go
when you're better.

2403
02:05:13.079 --> 02:05:16.449
- [sighs]

2404
02:05:16.482 --> 02:05:20.319
[crying]

2405
02:05:20.352 --> 02:05:21.821
<i>- There was one thing</i>

2406
02:05:21.854 --> 02:05:24.056
<i>that was hard</i>
<i>about taking care of her.</i>

2407
02:05:24.090 --> 02:05:25.224
<i>and that was whenever</i>

2408
02:05:25.257 --> 02:05:27.193
<i>she would suddenly</i>
<i>break out into tears</i>

2409
02:05:27.226 --> 02:05:29.895
<i>in the middle</i>
<i>of our conversations.</i>

2410
02:05:29.929 --> 02:05:31.630
<i>I can imagine how she felt.</i>

2411
02:05:31.664 --> 02:05:34.300
<i>bedridden and sick</i>
<i>as she was...</i>

2412
02:05:34.333 --> 02:05:36.802
<i>but it still</i>
<i>made me uncomfortable.</i>

2413
02:05:38.104 --> 02:05:40.673
[birds chirping]

2414
02:05:44.710 --> 02:05:45.644
- [growls]

2415
02:05:48.514 --> 02:05:50.282
[groans]

2416
02:05:50.316 --> 02:05:51.884
- [sighs]

2417
02:05:51.917 --> 02:05:53.886
Ah. now I understand.

2418
02:05:53.919 --> 02:05:56.188
The symbol used for "Hakuji."

2419
02:05:56.223 --> 02:05:57.957
it's the same as "komainu."

2420
02:05:57.990 --> 02:05:59.792
Hmph. That makes sense.

2421
02:05:59.825 --> 02:06:02.328
You and I really are
the same after all.

2422
02:06:02.361 --> 02:06:05.364
We only thrive when we
have something to protect.

2423
02:06:05.397 --> 02:06:06.632
Just like the komainu

2424
02:06:06.665 --> 02:06:08.801
who protect the entrance
to the shrines.

2425
02:06:08.834 --> 02:06:12.772
[laughs]

2426
02:06:12.805 --> 02:06:14.006
<i>[gentle music]</i>

2427
02:06:14.039 --> 02:06:17.409
<i>- There was a story as to how</i>
<i>my Master owned this land.</i>

2428
02:06:17.443 --> 02:06:19.078
<i>even though</i>
<i>he wasn't a samurai</i>

2429
02:06:19.111 --> 02:06:20.546
<i>or anything like that.</i>

2430
02:06:20.579 --> 02:06:24.550
<i>He had rescued an elderly man</i>
<i>from a group of bandits.</i>

2431
02:06:24.583 --> 02:06:26.819
<i>The old man.</i>
<i>who had no living heirs.</i>

2432
02:06:26.852 --> 02:06:29.388
<i>was so impressed</i>
<i>by his Soryu technique</i>

2433
02:06:29.421 --> 02:06:31.258
<i>that he left him</i>
<i>not only his land</i>

2434
02:06:31.290 --> 02:06:33.359
<i>but the dojo</i>
<i>that lay upon it.</i>

2435
02:06:36.295 --> 02:06:39.465
<i>However. there were</i>
<i>those with envious eyes</i>

2436
02:06:39.498 --> 02:06:43.169
<i>who wished to have the land</i>
<i>and dojo all to themselves.</i>

2437
02:06:43.202 --> 02:06:45.671
<i>The kenjutsu dojo next door</i>

2438
02:06:45.704 --> 02:06:48.507
<i>started harassing</i>
<i>the Soryu Dojo.</i>

2439
02:06:50.142 --> 02:06:52.378
<i>Because of that.</i>
<i>the Soryu Dojo</i>

2440
02:06:52.411 --> 02:06:54.780
<i>had a hard time</i>
<i>keeping any students.</i>

2441
02:06:54.814 --> 02:07:02.154
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2442
02:07:02.188 --> 02:07:05.024
<i>But now.</i>
<i>thanks to my training here</i>

2443
02:07:05.057 --> 02:07:07.459
<i>and caring for Koyuki.</i>

2444
02:07:07.493 --> 02:07:11.564
<i>my heart has</i>
<i>finally found salvation.</i>

2445
02:07:23.243 --> 02:07:25.044
- [grunts]

2446
02:07:25.077 --> 02:07:26.779
[chuckles]

2447
02:07:27.780 --> 02:07:29.515
- [chuckles]

2448
02:07:30.583 --> 02:07:35.187
<i>Three short years went by.</i>
<i>and I turned 18.</i>

2449
02:07:35.222 --> 02:07:37.723
<i>Koyuki was 16.</i>

2450
02:07:37.756 --> 02:07:39.925
<i>She was almost</i>
<i>never bedridden anymore</i>

2451
02:07:39.959 --> 02:07:42.962
<i>and was now able</i>
<i>to live a normal life.</i>

2452
02:07:44.096 --> 02:07:46.398
- [laughs]

2453
02:07:47.499 --> 02:07:49.501
- Hakuji! Come here.

2454
02:07:50.337 --> 02:07:51.804
- Yes. sir.

2455
02:07:51.837 --> 02:07:53.072
[insects buzzing]

2456
02:07:53.105 --> 02:07:54.406
- This dojo...

2457
02:07:54.440 --> 02:07:57.943
would you be willing to
take it over for me. Hakuji?

2458
02:07:57.977 --> 02:08:02.715
Koyuki's told me that she's
quite fond of you as well.

2459
02:08:02.748 --> 02:08:03.883
- Huh?

2460
02:08:07.052 --> 02:08:10.022
- [murmurs]

2461
02:08:11.523 --> 02:08:14.261
<i>- As someone branded with</i>
<i>the tattoos of a criminal.</i>

2462
02:08:14.294 --> 02:08:18.530
<i>picturing any kind of future</i>
<i>for myself was hard enough.</i>

2463
02:08:18.564 --> 02:08:23.669
<i>But a future in which someone</i>
<i>could like a person like me?</i>

2464
02:08:23.702 --> 02:08:26.739
<i>I couldn't have</i>
<i>even dreamed it.</i>

2465
02:08:27.806 --> 02:08:30.442
<i>My dad asked me</i>
<i>to lead an honest life.</i>

2466
02:08:30.476 --> 02:08:32.711
<i>something I never</i>
<i>thought was possible.</i>

2467
02:08:32.745 --> 02:08:35.948
<i>But perhaps it really is.</i>

2468
02:08:35.981 --> 02:08:39.386
<i>The faint hope</i>
<i>of being able to start over</i>

2469
02:08:39.418 --> 02:08:41.587
<i>began to swell within me</i>

2470
02:08:41.620 --> 02:08:44.690
<i>until it felt like it</i>
<i>was about to burst.</i>

2471
02:08:49.595 --> 02:08:50.863
<i>[gentle music]</i>

2472
02:08:50.896 --> 02:08:53.065
<i>But I could never have</i>
<i>predicted in that moment</i>

2473
02:08:53.098 --> 02:08:55.567
<i>that the two people</i>
<i>I wanted to protect</i>

2474
02:08:55.601 --> 02:08:58.938
<i>more than anything else</i>
<i>in this life...</i>

2475
02:08:58.971 --> 02:09:01.473
<i>would end up</i>
<i>meeting the fate they did.</i>

2476
02:09:01.507 --> 02:09:06.578
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2477
02:09:06.612 --> 02:09:10.582
<i>I had made a trip to Edo</i>
<i>to visit my dad's grave.</i>

2478
02:09:10.616 --> 02:09:13.752
<i>I wanted to let him know</i>
<i>that I was getting married.</i>

2479
02:09:18.190 --> 02:09:19.825
[sighs]

2480
02:09:23.263 --> 02:09:27.499
<i>I returned before even a full</i>
<i>day and night had passed...</i>

2481
02:09:30.270 --> 02:09:33.138
<i>yet a sense of dread</i>
<i>came over me.</i>

2482
02:09:34.006 --> 02:09:36.775
<i>My chest started</i>
<i>to feel tight.</i>

2483
02:09:36.809 --> 02:09:39.745
<i>and a terrible feeling</i>
<i>of nausea overtook me.</i>

2484
02:09:39.778 --> 02:09:42.282
[gagging]

2485
02:09:42.315 --> 02:09:45.584
[man] Someone put poison
in the well!

2486
02:09:45.617 --> 02:09:46.986
The other school was so angry

2487
02:09:47.019 --> 02:09:49.021
they couldn't beat you
or Mr. Keizo.

2488
02:09:49.054 --> 02:09:51.391
they went and did this
out of spite!

2489
02:09:51.424 --> 02:09:53.959
It's atrocious. unthinkable!

2490
02:09:53.993 --> 02:09:56.028
They even killed Koyuki!

2491
02:09:56.061 --> 02:09:59.366
<i>[somber music]</i>

2492
02:09:59.399 --> 02:10:01.600
<i>- Why? Why is it</i>

2493
02:10:01.633 --> 02:10:04.603
<i>whenever the ones I care</i>
<i>about are in mortal peril.</i>

2494
02:10:04.636 --> 02:10:06.905
<i>I'm never there for them?</i>

2495
02:10:06.939 --> 02:10:11.677
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2496
02:10:11.710 --> 02:10:14.146
[fireworks burst]

2497
02:10:14.179 --> 02:10:15.681
[insects chirping]

2498
02:10:15.714 --> 02:10:18.485
<i>I had even gone</i>
<i>and made a promise to her.</i>

2499
02:10:18.517 --> 02:10:20.786
[fireworks bursting]

2500
02:10:20.819 --> 02:10:23.622
Are you sure
that I'm the one for you?

2501
02:10:25.724 --> 02:10:27.693
- When we were children.

2502
02:10:27.726 --> 02:10:30.195
do you remember
when you talked to me

2503
02:10:30.230 --> 02:10:31.930
about seeing the fireworks?

2504
02:10:32.931 --> 02:10:33.766
- Huh?

2505
02:10:33.799 --> 02:10:37.136
- Uh. no. not really.
- [giggles]

2506
02:10:38.537 --> 02:10:40.906
- Because of those
little talks we used to have.

2507
02:10:40.939 --> 02:10:43.709
there were a lot of things
which I took with me

2508
02:10:43.742 --> 02:10:46.145
that gave me hope
for the future.

2509
02:10:46.178 --> 02:10:50.749
You said even if we couldn't
see the fireworks that year.

2510
02:10:50.783 --> 02:10:54.053
we could go to the one
happening next year

2511
02:10:54.086 --> 02:10:56.555
or the year after that.

2512
02:10:56.588 --> 02:10:59.691
The truth is. I could
never imagine a future

2513
02:10:59.725 --> 02:11:02.061
where I'd still
be alive a year later

2514
02:11:02.094 --> 02:11:05.030
and certainly
not any longer than that.

2515
02:11:06.299 --> 02:11:08.301
My mother couldn't. either.

2516
02:11:08.334 --> 02:11:11.603
I think that's why she
ended up taking her own life.

2517
02:11:11.637 --> 02:11:14.673
'cause she didn't
want to see me die.

2518
02:11:14.706 --> 02:11:16.242
Not just her.

2519
02:11:16.276 --> 02:11:19.412
I could tell my father
had given up hope. too.

2520
02:11:19.446 --> 02:11:21.113
deep down inside.

2521
02:11:22.282 --> 02:11:24.616
Because I was just so weak.

2522
02:11:25.818 --> 02:11:28.587
But you never
treated me that way.

2523
02:11:28.620 --> 02:11:31.123
You were able to see
a future for me.

2524
02:11:31.156 --> 02:11:34.626
[chuckles] You'd talk to me
about doing things.

2525
02:11:34.660 --> 02:11:38.797
as if-- as if it were obvious
that I'd still be here.

2526
02:11:38.831 --> 02:11:41.934
[sighs]
That made me so very happy.

2527
02:11:49.708 --> 02:11:50.976
[hands grasp]

2528
02:11:53.145 --> 02:11:56.249
So. yes. I am sure
you're the one for me.

2529
02:11:58.251 --> 02:11:59.651
Would you...

2530
02:12:00.453 --> 02:12:02.688
Would you be my husband?

2531
02:12:02.721 --> 02:12:10.896
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2532
02:12:10.929 --> 02:12:12.197
- Yes.

2533
02:12:12.232 --> 02:12:15.568
I promise to become
stronger than anyone

2534
02:12:15.602 --> 02:12:18.070
and protect you
for the rest of my life.

2535
02:12:19.472 --> 02:12:20.806
- [gasps]

2536
02:12:21.673 --> 02:12:22.674
[chuckles]

2537
02:12:22.708 --> 02:12:24.377
<i>- In the end....</i>

2538
02:12:24.410 --> 02:12:26.279
<i>I was all talk.</i>

2539
02:12:26.312 --> 02:12:30.015
<i>I wasn't able to fulfill</i>
<i>any of my promises.</i>

2540
02:12:30.048 --> 02:12:31.650
- [laughs]

2541
02:12:37.156 --> 02:12:39.526
<i>[ominous music]</i>

2542
02:12:39.559 --> 02:12:42.295
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2543
02:12:42.328 --> 02:12:43.862
- What do you want?

2544
02:12:43.896 --> 02:12:44.663
[gasps]

2545
02:12:44.696 --> 02:12:47.099
You've got some nerve!

2546
02:12:47.132 --> 02:12:48.334
- Wait.

2547
02:12:48.368 --> 02:12:50.637
You're from the Soryu Sty--

2548
02:12:50.669 --> 02:12:52.704
- [screams]

2549
02:12:52.738 --> 02:12:57.776
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2550
02:12:57.809 --> 02:13:01.113
[group yelling]

2551
02:13:06.084 --> 02:13:08.053
- [growls]

2552
02:13:11.224 --> 02:13:12.392
- [shrieks]

2553
02:13:12.425 --> 02:13:16.028
- The family of the Soryu Dojo
were recently poisoned.

2554
02:13:16.061 --> 02:13:18.096
and we believe
that a student of theirs

2555
02:13:18.130 --> 02:13:21.234
retaliated against
the kenjutsu dojo.

2556
02:13:21.267 --> 02:13:24.102
Sixty-seven people
were murdered inside!

2557
02:13:24.136 --> 02:13:26.805
He shattered their skulls
and crushed their organs.

2558
02:13:26.838 --> 02:13:28.140
all barehanded.

2559
02:13:28.173 --> 02:13:30.276
Not only were
most of the bodies

2560
02:13:30.310 --> 02:13:32.878
mangled and mutilated
beyond recognition.

2561
02:13:32.911 --> 02:13:36.449
most had limbs missing
that we couldn't even locate.

2562
02:13:36.482 --> 02:13:38.551
Organs. limbs. brain matter.

2563
02:13:38.585 --> 02:13:40.286
even jaws and eyeballs
were found

2564
02:13:40.320 --> 02:13:44.557
strewn across the walls and
the ceiling of the premises.

2565
02:13:44.591 --> 02:13:48.261
This killer
was no ordinary human!

2566
02:13:48.294 --> 02:13:50.896
[footsteps scraping]

2567
02:13:52.699 --> 02:13:55.301
- [wincing]

2568
02:14:10.916 --> 02:14:12.784
- I heard there was
some commotion

2569
02:14:12.818 --> 02:14:14.886
about a demon sighting here.

2570
02:14:14.920 --> 02:14:17.990
even though I know
I never sent one.

2571
02:14:18.023 --> 02:14:20.859
So I decided
to come see for myself.

2572
02:14:20.892 --> 02:14:23.529
Yet all I find is a human.

2573
02:14:23.563 --> 02:14:25.998
How utterly disappointing.

2574
02:14:27.099 --> 02:14:28.735
- Move...

2575
02:14:28.800 --> 02:14:30.168
or I'll kill--

2576
02:14:34.973 --> 02:14:36.209
- It just so happens.

2577
02:14:36.242 --> 02:14:40.613
I was contemplating
creating 12 powerful demons.

2578
02:14:40.647 --> 02:14:42.781
I wonder if you'll be
able to withstand

2579
02:14:42.814 --> 02:14:45.451
the amount of blood
I'm about to give you.

2580
02:14:47.453 --> 02:14:48.787
- You...

2581
02:14:51.156 --> 02:14:52.625
do...

2582
02:14:52.659 --> 02:14:54.560
whatever you want.

2583
02:14:55.561 --> 02:14:58.298
None of it... matters.

2584
02:15:03.303 --> 02:15:05.471
<i>[ominous music]</i>

2585
02:15:05.505 --> 02:15:09.242
[thunder rumbling]

2586
02:15:12.944 --> 02:15:15.348
<i>After becoming a demon.</i>
<i>I lost my memories</i>

2587
02:15:15.381 --> 02:15:19.752
<i>and once again</i>
<i>started to seek out power.</i>

2588
02:15:19.786 --> 02:15:24.357
[yelling]

2589
02:15:34.767 --> 02:15:35.867
It's not enough!

2590
02:15:35.901 --> 02:15:38.438
It will never be enough!

2591
02:15:38.471 --> 02:15:40.807
[thunder crashes]

2592
02:15:40.839 --> 02:15:42.140
<i>[somber music]</i>

2593
02:15:42.174 --> 02:15:45.511
<i>Even though I had</i>
<i>nothing left to my name.</i>

2594
02:15:45.545 --> 02:15:49.047
<i>even though I had nothing</i>
<i>worth fighting for anymore...</i>

2595
02:15:51.250 --> 02:15:54.320
<i>even though my family</i>
<i>was no longer around.</i>

2596
02:15:54.354 --> 02:15:58.291
<i>and I had no desire to live</i>
<i>in a world without them...</i>

2597
02:16:00.959 --> 02:16:02.127
<i>for over a century.</i>

2598
02:16:02.160 --> 02:16:03.929
<i>I committed</i>
<i>senseless massacres</i>

2599
02:16:03.962 --> 02:16:05.997
<i>over and over again.</i>

2600
02:16:07.065 --> 02:16:10.436
<i>Thinking about it now.</i>
<i>it's pathetic.</i>

2601
02:16:10.470 --> 02:16:11.970
<i>it's absurd.</i>

2602
02:16:12.904 --> 02:16:15.475
<i>All those deaths</i>
<i>were meaningless.</i>

2603
02:16:20.847 --> 02:16:22.682
<i>Even if I died now.</i>

2604
02:16:22.715 --> 02:16:26.552
<i>I couldn't go where the other</i>
<i>three were waiting for me.</i>

2605
02:16:27.919 --> 02:16:30.757
<i>Damn you for dredging up</i>
<i>these memories.</i>

2606
02:16:30.790 --> 02:16:32.625
<i>You bastard!</i>

2607
02:16:34.727 --> 02:16:36.396
<i>Pathetic humans.</i>

2608
02:16:36.429 --> 02:16:39.931
<i>Clinging on to life</i>
<i>with their fragile bodies.</i>

2609
02:16:40.833 --> 02:16:44.871
<i>Even their strongest</i>
<i>eventually die</i>

2610
02:16:44.903 --> 02:16:47.205
<i>and vanish into thin air.</i>

2611
02:16:50.610 --> 02:16:52.478
<i>[Giyu] He's still not dead?!</i>

2612
02:16:52.512 --> 02:16:54.814
<i>You can't be serious.</i>

2613
02:16:54.847 --> 02:16:58.484
<i>I have to kill him</i>
<i>before it's too late.</i>

2614
02:16:58.518 --> 02:17:01.052
<i>If we let him regenerate.</i>

2615
02:17:01.086 --> 02:17:03.222
<i>there'll be no stopping him!</i>

2616
02:17:04.990 --> 02:17:06.392
- [blow echoes]
- [gasps]

2617
02:17:08.428 --> 02:17:09.161
[gasps]

2618
02:17:09.194 --> 02:17:10.530
I must have passed out.

2619
02:17:10.563 --> 02:17:12.130
What's going on?

2620
02:17:13.766 --> 02:17:15.133
His head's back!

2621
02:17:15.167 --> 02:17:17.670
But how is that
even possible?!

2622
02:17:17.703 --> 02:17:18.805
[shudders]

2623
02:17:18.838 --> 02:17:21.674
I decapitated him!

2624
02:17:21.707 --> 02:17:24.477
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

2625
02:17:24.510 --> 02:17:27.045
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2626
02:17:27.078 --> 02:17:29.981
- Destructive Death:
Annihilation Type.

2627
02:17:30.783 --> 02:17:32.718
- Stop it!

2628
02:17:32.752 --> 02:17:35.488
<i>- Seriously?</i>
<i>He can still move?</i>

2629
02:17:35.521 --> 02:17:38.324
<i>- Mr. Giyu and I</i>
<i>are going to win!</i>

2630
02:17:38.357 --> 02:17:42.361
<i>Akaza. I'll behead you</i>
<i>as many times as it takes!</i>

2631
02:17:42.395 --> 02:17:45.063
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2632
02:17:45.096 --> 02:17:46.599
<i>My sword...</i>

2633
02:17:47.999 --> 02:17:50.436
<i>- It slipped</i>
<i>out of his hands.</i>

2634
02:17:51.504 --> 02:17:53.171
<i>- I lost my grip.</i>

2635
02:18:01.980 --> 02:18:03.916
<i>- All right. young man.</i>

2636
02:18:03.950 --> 02:18:06.586
<i>time to be reborn.</i>

2637
02:18:07.954 --> 02:18:11.424
<i>- I despise those</i>
<i>who are weak.</i>

2638
02:18:13.459 --> 02:18:17.830
<i>Weaklings. instead of</i>
<i>fighting you fair and square.</i>

2639
02:18:17.864 --> 02:18:21.132
<i>they always resort</i>
<i>to cheap tricks.</i>

2640
02:18:21.166 --> 02:18:23.236
<i>They're atrocious.</i>

2641
02:18:23.269 --> 02:18:25.371
<i>They have no patience.</i>

2642
02:18:25.404 --> 02:18:27.607
<i>and they quickly</i>
<i>grow desperate.</i>

2643
02:18:27.640 --> 02:18:30.409
<i>Just thinking about them</i>
<i>makes me sick.</i>

2644
02:18:32.445 --> 02:18:35.848
<i>I killed people with</i>
<i>my "fists of protection."</i>

2645
02:18:35.882 --> 02:18:41.052
<i>I desecrated my master's</i>
<i>beloved Soryu with blood.</i>

2646
02:18:41.086 --> 02:18:44.724
<i>and I couldn't follow</i>
<i>my father's last wishes.</i>

2647
02:18:47.393 --> 02:18:48.995
<i>That's right.</i>

2648
02:18:49.027 --> 02:18:51.731
<i>The one I wanted to kill...</i>

2649
02:18:57.303 --> 02:18:58.538
<i>- This couldn't be worse!</i>

2650
02:18:58.571 --> 02:18:59.805
<i>I dropped my sword!</i>

2651
02:18:59.839 --> 02:19:01.908
<i>[ominous music]</i>

2652
02:19:01.941 --> 02:19:04.042
<i>My fists</i>
<i>aren't enough to stop him!</i>

2653
02:19:04.075 --> 02:19:10.683
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2654
02:19:14.687 --> 02:19:15.821
<i>He's about to unleash</i>

2655
02:19:15.855 --> 02:19:19.190
<i>the Annihilation Type move</i>
<i>he used on Mr. Rengoku!</i>

2656
02:19:22.160 --> 02:19:24.030
<i>I've got to take</i>
<i>Mr. Giyu with me</i>

2657
02:19:24.062 --> 02:19:25.531
<i>out of the attack range!</i>

2658
02:19:25.565 --> 02:19:29.702
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2659
02:19:29.735 --> 02:19:32.371
[Giyu] Leave me!
Save yourself!

2660
02:19:37.910 --> 02:19:39.845
<i>[Akaza] I've got to kill...</i>

2661
02:19:42.248 --> 02:19:43.816
<i>that weakling...</i>

2662
02:19:44.817 --> 02:19:46.686
<i>I've come to hate!</i>

2663
02:19:46.719 --> 02:19:49.689
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2664
02:20:05.203 --> 02:20:07.773
<i>[dramatic music]</i>

2665
02:20:07.807 --> 02:20:14.614
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2666
02:20:17.583 --> 02:20:20.151
- [gasps]

2667
02:20:20.185 --> 02:20:22.788
[rumbling]

2668
02:20:29.295 --> 02:20:32.130
<i>He just attacked himself.</i>

2669
02:20:34.199 --> 02:20:37.135
<i>Why would he</i>
<i>turn on himself like that?</i>

2670
02:20:37.970 --> 02:20:39.338
<i>Why?</i>

2671
02:20:40.205 --> 02:20:42.708
<i>[gentle music]</i>

2672
02:20:42.742 --> 02:20:43.843
<i>For a second.</i>

2673
02:20:43.876 --> 02:20:47.213
<i>I could pick up the scent</i>
<i>of gratitude from him.</i>

2674
02:20:48.481 --> 02:20:50.616
<i>Why did he smile at me?</i>

2675
02:20:54.353 --> 02:20:55.888
<i>[Akaza] That's enough.</i>

2676
02:20:55.921 --> 02:20:57.155
<i>Stop it!</i>

2677
02:20:57.188 --> 02:20:59.325
<i>I don't want to regenerate!</i>

2678
02:20:59.358 --> 02:21:01.927
<i>Don't you get it?</i>

2679
02:21:01.961 --> 02:21:03.729
<i>The battle is over!</i>

2680
02:21:05.564 --> 02:21:09.200
<i>In that decisive moment.</i>
<i>I lost.</i>

2681
02:21:09.235 --> 02:21:11.270
<i>That technique</i>
<i>he beheaded me with</i>

2682
02:21:11.303 --> 02:21:14.440
<i>was nothing short</i>
<i>of perfection.</i>

2683
02:21:14.473 --> 02:21:16.942
<i>He anticipated my movements</i>

2684
02:21:16.976 --> 02:21:19.011
<i>and pivoted</i>
<i>at the last second.</i>

2685
02:21:19.045 --> 02:21:22.748
<i>then struck me down before</i>
<i>I could unleash my attack.</i>

2686
02:21:23.916 --> 02:21:26.285
<i>It's over now.</i>

2687
02:21:26.318 --> 02:21:30.790
<i>Let me accept my fate</i>
<i>and go to hell.</i>

2688
02:21:32.692 --> 02:21:34.026
[footsteps thumping]

2689
02:21:34.060 --> 02:21:35.895
<i>- Where is he trying to go?</i>

2690
02:21:35.928 --> 02:21:42.168
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2691
02:21:42.234 --> 02:21:45.271
<i>Huh? He stopped</i>
<i>in his tracks.</i>

2692
02:21:48.074 --> 02:21:49.542
- Dad...

2693
02:21:51.143 --> 02:21:53.713
...are you feeling better now?

2694
02:21:53.746 --> 02:21:56.315
Are you in pain anymore?

2695
02:21:56.348 --> 02:22:00.386
- No need to worry. son.
I'm fine.

2696
02:22:00.419 --> 02:22:02.254
Thank you. Hakuji.

2697
02:22:02.288 --> 02:22:08.994
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2698
02:22:09.028 --> 02:22:10.996
- I'm sorry. Father.

2699
02:22:11.030 --> 02:22:12.231
I'm sorry.

2700
02:22:12.264 --> 02:22:14.800
I couldn't start over
like you wanted.

2701
02:22:14.834 --> 02:22:17.236
I failed you.

2702
02:22:19.271 --> 02:22:21.207
- Do not despair.

2703
02:22:21.240 --> 02:22:24.243
Regardless of who
you grow to up be.

2704
02:22:24.276 --> 02:22:27.847
you're still my son
and still my student.

2705
02:22:27.880 --> 02:22:30.516
Heaven may not accept you.

2706
02:22:31.383 --> 02:22:33.119
But you needn't worry.

2707
02:22:33.152 --> 02:22:35.020
Our hearts will be with you.

2708
02:22:36.455 --> 02:22:39.391
- [shudders] Master.

2709
02:22:40.192 --> 02:22:41.026
[gasps]

2710
02:22:41.060 --> 02:22:42.628
- Didn't you say

2711
02:22:42.661 --> 02:22:45.397
you were seeking to become
stronger than anyone?

2712
02:22:45.431 --> 02:22:50.469
Don't tell me you intend to
let it end like this. Akaza.

2713
02:22:51.670 --> 02:22:55.541
<i>- That's right.</i>
<i>I can't die here.</i>

2714
02:22:55.574 --> 02:22:58.310
<i>I have to get stronger!</i>

2715
02:22:58.344 --> 02:23:00.813
<i>So what if I got beheaded?</i>

2716
02:23:00.846 --> 02:23:04.416
<i>Who cares if I win</i>
<i>or lose the fight?</i>

2717
02:23:04.450 --> 02:23:06.819
<i>If I kill those</i>
<i>who stand in my way.</i>

2718
02:23:06.852 --> 02:23:11.023
<i>then there's still hope</i>
<i>for me to get stronger!</i>

2719
02:23:12.992 --> 02:23:16.495
<i>I made a promise.</i>
<i>I'm not about to break it!</i>

2720
02:23:16.529 --> 02:23:20.633
<i>[singer vocalizing]</i>

2721
02:23:20.666 --> 02:23:21.767
[gasps]

2722
02:23:21.801 --> 02:23:25.371
[shudders]

2723
02:23:25.404 --> 02:23:27.139
<i>[gentle music]</i>

2724
02:23:27.173 --> 02:23:28.707
Mr. Hakuji...

2725
02:23:29.508 --> 02:23:31.944
thank you so much.

2726
02:23:31.977 --> 02:23:33.879
You've done more than enough.

2727
02:23:38.050 --> 02:23:39.952
It's okay.

2728
02:23:39.985 --> 02:23:41.887
We're all right now.

2729
02:23:41.921 --> 02:23:43.389
- Akaza!

2730
02:23:43.422 --> 02:23:46.025
<i>[hopeful music]</i>

2731
02:23:49.229 --> 02:23:51.831
[sobbing]

2732
02:23:53.599 --> 02:23:55.100
- Sorry!

2733
02:23:55.134 --> 02:23:58.337
I'm sorry
I couldn't protect you!

2734
02:23:58.370 --> 02:24:01.440
I wasn't there
when you needed me to be!

2735
02:24:01.473 --> 02:24:05.010
I couldn't keep
a single promise I made!

2736
02:24:05.044 --> 02:24:09.148
I'm sorry. Please try
to forgive me. Koyuki!

2737
02:24:09.181 --> 02:24:11.116
I'm so sorry!

2738
02:24:11.150 --> 02:24:13.886
[crying]

2739
02:24:15.421 --> 02:24:17.790
I'm so happy
you remembered us.

2740
02:24:17.823 --> 02:24:21.427
I can't tell you
how happy that makes me.

2741
02:24:21.460 --> 02:24:24.730
And to see you now
as the man that I once knew.

2742
02:24:24.763 --> 02:24:26.333
I'm so grateful.

2743
02:24:26.365 --> 02:24:32.972
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2744
02:24:34.607 --> 02:24:37.810
- Welcome home. Hakuji.

2745
02:24:42.181 --> 02:24:43.983
Hey. Hakuji...

2746
02:24:44.016 --> 02:24:46.185
welcome home.

2747
02:24:46.219 --> 02:24:49.788
[singer vocalizing]

2748
02:24:49.822 --> 02:24:54.327
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2749
02:24:54.361 --> 02:24:56.495
<i>- I'm back now.</i>

2750
02:24:56.528 --> 02:24:58.797
<i>I'm finally back home.</i>

2751
02:25:01.834 --> 02:25:06.339
- Welcome back home.
my darling.

2752
02:25:06.373 --> 02:25:08.607
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2753
02:25:10.042 --> 02:25:11.877
- [gasps]

2754
02:25:13.045 --> 02:25:15.414
<i>[gentle music]</i>

2755
02:25:15.447 --> 02:25:22.054
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2756
02:25:33.966 --> 02:25:35.768
[Tanjiro exhales]

2757
02:25:35.801 --> 02:25:37.436
He vanished.

2758
02:25:39.905 --> 02:25:41.941
- [gasps]

2759
02:25:42.975 --> 02:25:44.977
- [inhales]

2760
02:25:45.010 --> 02:25:46.979
[exhales]

2761
02:25:47.012 --> 02:25:47.947
[shudders]

2762
02:25:47.980 --> 02:25:49.882
It's over...

2763
02:25:49.915 --> 02:25:51.384
right?

2764
02:25:51.418 --> 02:25:53.552
[shudders]

2765
02:25:55.020 --> 02:25:56.289
Gotta hurry..

2766
02:25:56.323 --> 02:25:58.590
and get to...

2767
02:25:58.624 --> 02:26:00.893
where Ms. Tamayo is.

2768
02:26:01.894 --> 02:26:02.995
And then...

2769
02:26:10.035 --> 02:26:12.071
- [gasps] Tanjiro...

2770
02:26:21.448 --> 02:26:24.616
[Crow squawks]

2771
02:26:24.650 --> 02:26:29.855
Tanjiro. Giyu
have defeated Upper Three!

2772
02:26:29.888 --> 02:26:34.026
They're unable to stay
conscious due to exhaustion!

2773
02:26:34.059 --> 02:26:35.462
They've passed out!

2774
02:26:35.494 --> 02:26:38.465
<i>[somber music]</i>

2775
02:26:38.497 --> 02:26:41.166
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2776
02:26:41.200 --> 02:26:44.371
Tanjiro. Giyu...

2777
02:26:44.404 --> 02:26:47.106
have defeated Upper Three!

2778
02:26:47.139 --> 02:26:48.907
Upper Three!

2779
02:26:48.941 --> 02:26:54.880
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2780
02:26:54.913 --> 02:26:57.082
- Akaza...

2781
02:26:57.116 --> 02:26:59.818
his presence has vanished.

2782
02:27:01.520 --> 02:27:04.257
What a baffling conclusion.

2783
02:27:07.360 --> 02:27:08.994
Akaza...

2784
02:27:10.195 --> 02:27:14.234
what happened to your
burning ambition to defeat me?

2785
02:27:16.101 --> 02:27:20.672
To think you'd abandoned
everything you stood for...

2786
02:27:21.740 --> 02:27:25.644
and turned your back
on the path to greatness.

2787
02:27:32.352 --> 02:27:35.321
Your weakness appalls me.

2788
02:27:40.460 --> 02:27:41.660
- Huh?

2789
02:27:42.561 --> 02:27:44.129
[shudders]

2790
02:27:44.163 --> 02:27:45.798
This feeling...

2791
02:27:45.831 --> 02:27:48.567
Could Lord Akaza be dead?

2792
02:27:49.735 --> 02:27:51.036
Very strange.

2793
02:27:51.070 --> 02:27:55.174
Surely my imagination
must be running wild. right?

2794
02:27:55.207 --> 02:28:00.045
It almost felt like Lord Akaza
had turned into some creature.

2795
02:28:02.315 --> 02:28:05.385
But now that he's dead.
I guess it doesn't matter!

2796
02:28:05.418 --> 02:28:07.686
[laughs]

2797
02:28:08.654 --> 02:28:12.492
Let's see. Where was I?

2798
02:28:12.525 --> 02:28:14.494
Oh. I remember!

2799
02:28:14.527 --> 02:28:17.896
I'd just asked
for your name. hadn't I?

2800
02:28:19.031 --> 02:28:21.334
- [panting]

2801
02:28:21.367 --> 02:28:23.936
<i>[singer vocalizing]</i>

2802
02:28:23.969 --> 02:28:28.006
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2803
02:28:30.709 --> 02:28:35.147
- Tanjiro. Giyu
have defeated Upper Three!

2804
02:28:35.180 --> 02:28:37.149
Upper Three!

2805
02:28:37.182 --> 02:28:38.951
- Did you hear that?

2806
02:28:38.984 --> 02:28:43.223
- Yes.
Excellent work. Tomioka.

2807
02:28:43.256 --> 02:28:44.623
Excellent work. Kamado.

2808
02:28:44.656 --> 02:28:49.661
<i>["Zankoku no Yoru ni Kagayake"</i>
<i>by LiSA]</i>

2809
02:28:49.695 --> 02:28:53.765
- Mr. Tomioka and Tanjiro.
they did it!

2810
02:28:53.799 --> 02:28:57.069
- Now its our turn
to follow their lead.

2811
02:28:57.102 --> 02:28:58.371
- Right!

2812
02:28:58.404 --> 02:29:04.377
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2813
02:29:04.410 --> 02:29:05.578
[Zenitsu groans]

2814
02:29:05.612 --> 02:29:07.079
[demon growls]

2815
02:29:08.381 --> 02:29:09.516
[gags]

2816
02:29:09.549 --> 02:29:12.951
- [panting]

2817
02:29:12.985 --> 02:29:15.221
Hang in there.
Agatsuma!

2818
02:29:19.191 --> 02:29:20.792
- [squawks]

2819
02:29:20.826 --> 02:29:22.529
- Start flapping
those wings faster.

2820
02:29:22.562 --> 02:29:24.264
or I'm gonna
keep poking!

2821
02:29:24.297 --> 02:29:25.998
You're gonna
use those wings

2822
02:29:26.031 --> 02:29:28.200
to show me where
the strongest demon is!

2823
02:29:28.234 --> 02:29:29.902
You hear me?!

2824
02:29:29.935 --> 02:29:32.639
I'm comin' through!

2825
02:29:32.671 --> 02:29:34.072
Hyah!

2826
02:29:34.106 --> 02:29:35.207
Now we're talkin'!

2827
02:29:35.241 --> 02:29:38.278
I'm sensing a powerful
demon over here!

2828
02:29:38.311 --> 02:29:39.678
- [squawks]

2829
02:29:39.711 --> 02:29:44.816
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2830
02:29:44.850 --> 02:29:47.052
- Where is
Big Brother?

2831
02:29:47.085 --> 02:29:48.254
- [snarls]

2832
02:29:54.960 --> 02:29:56.895
- [gags]

2833
02:29:56.929 --> 02:29:59.232
- Where are all
the Upper Ranks?!

2834
02:29:59.265 --> 02:30:00.266
Tell me!

2835
02:30:00.300 --> 02:30:01.668
Come on!

2836
02:30:01.700 --> 02:30:04.504
I'm gonna
bury you all!

2837
02:30:04.537 --> 02:30:12.212
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2838
02:30:12.245 --> 02:30:14.112
[Kanata] The passageway
leading north

2839
02:30:14.146 --> 02:30:16.249
on the 88th level
is clear.

2840
02:30:16.282 --> 02:30:18.685
No sign of Muzan.

2841
02:30:18.717 --> 02:30:20.386
[Kuina]
The 127th levels

2842
02:30:20.420 --> 02:30:21.688
in the southeast
are clear.

2843
02:30:21.720 --> 02:30:23.956
No sign of Muzan.

2844
02:30:23.989 --> 02:30:27.227
- He's in here.
He has to be.

2845
02:30:27.260 --> 02:30:29.061
But where is he?

2846
02:30:29.094 --> 02:30:30.597
[Kanata] There's
no sign of Muzan

2847
02:30:30.630 --> 02:30:31.598
on any
of the levels

2848
02:30:31.631 --> 02:30:33.799
from 90 to 100.
either.

2849
02:30:35.867 --> 02:30:38.804
- Covering the entire
100th and 33rd levels.

2850
02:30:38.837 --> 02:30:40.373
No sign of Muzan.

2851
02:30:41.807 --> 02:30:44.076
- Our crows
will find you.

2852
02:30:44.109 --> 02:30:46.778
You can only hide
from us for so long.

2853
02:30:46.812 --> 02:30:50.683
We'll search every inch
of this infinity castle.

2854
02:30:50.717 --> 02:30:52.552
Even if you try
to run from us.

2855
02:30:52.585 --> 02:30:55.288
we will
hunt you down.

2856
02:30:55.321 --> 02:30:57.022
[notes twanging]

2857
02:31:07.400 --> 02:31:09.435
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2858
02:31:09.469 --> 02:31:12.838
- Multilayered structures
are headed northeast.

2859
02:31:12.871 --> 02:31:14.741
- Attention. the
castle's expanding

2860
02:31:14.773 --> 02:31:16.609
in every direction!

2861
02:31:16.643 --> 02:31:18.411
Folding over
themselves...

2862
02:31:18.444 --> 02:31:21.481
[notes twanging]

2863
02:31:22.482 --> 02:31:24.217
- [together]
And becoming one.

2864
02:31:24.250 --> 02:31:26.084
[notes twang]

2865
02:31:30.088 --> 02:31:30.789
- [gasps]

2866
02:31:30.822 --> 02:31:33.626
You can't
be serious.

2867
02:31:33.660 --> 02:31:35.193
No...

2868
02:31:35.228 --> 02:31:36.429
it's fine.

2869
02:31:36.462 --> 02:31:38.231
We've come
too far to lose!

2870
02:31:39.031 --> 02:31:41.199
Crows.
push forward...

2871
02:31:41.234 --> 02:31:42.834
and find Muzan!

2872
02:31:42.868 --> 02:31:48.006
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2873
02:31:48.040 --> 02:31:51.043
[Muzan] Try all you
want. Demon Slayers.

2874
02:31:51.076 --> 02:31:53.011
but each one of you
will meet your end

2875
02:31:53.045 --> 02:31:55.548
before ever
reaching me.

2876
02:31:55.581 --> 02:31:56.915
You may be
feeling smug

2877
02:31:56.948 --> 02:31:58.950
after beheading one
of my Upper Ranks.

2878
02:31:58.984 --> 02:32:00.819
but unless
you can kill me.

2879
02:32:00.852 --> 02:32:03.121
your triumph
is meaningless!

2880
02:32:04.324 --> 02:32:07.125
[laughs]

2881
02:32:07.159 --> 02:32:09.928
You're all going to die
the most pointless deaths.

2882
02:32:09.961 --> 02:32:13.031
all the while
never seeing my face.

2883
02:32:13.065 --> 02:32:14.900
I can't think
of a more fitting end

2884
02:32:14.933 --> 02:32:17.804
for the Demon Slayer Corps.

2885
02:32:17.836 --> 02:32:20.038
Mark my words.
When I'm done here.

2886
02:32:20.072 --> 02:32:23.041
I'm going to make you regret
the day you were born!

2887
02:32:24.243 --> 02:32:25.278
Just wait.

2888
02:32:25.311 --> 02:32:28.314
You're each going to squirm
and writhe in pain.

2889
02:32:28.348 --> 02:32:30.416
Draw your final breaths.

2890
02:32:30.450 --> 02:32:33.820
because for every one
of you Demon Slayers.

2891
02:32:33.852 --> 02:32:37.189
there is no tomorrow!

2892
02:32:37.223 --> 02:32:43.629
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2893
02:32:47.500 --> 02:32:48.900
- Please. Giyu...

2894
02:32:52.538 --> 02:32:54.307
don't die.

2895
02:32:55.941 --> 02:33:00.713
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2896
02:33:00.747 --> 02:33:05.685
We can't have you
dying on us. Tanjiro.

2897
02:33:05.718 --> 02:33:08.321
<i>[singers vocalizing]</i>

2898
02:33:08.354 --> 02:33:14.960
<i>♪ ♪</i>

2899
02:34:45.451 --> 02:34:47.052
<i>[music ends]</i>

2899
